\
Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Laps completed (${VALUE}/2)","Follow the direction of Seoca as you circle the tourney field and learn to control your steed.\
\
You must make two full circuits of the outer track in order to proceed.","All flags passed (${VALUE}/11)","Lap Completed!","Blue flags passed!","Mount your war-steed near the outer starting line","Run the flags course as directed by Seoca.\
