\
- Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
- Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Speak with Seoca to complete your training.","You have begun a short training tutorial at the Harwick Stables to teach you how to control your war-steed.","Speak with Seoca.","Run the flags course as directed by Seoca.\
\
On the first round, you must pass through the blue flags.\
\
On the second round, you must pass through the red flags.\
\
On the third round, you must pass through both sets of flags at once.\
\
<rgb=#0000FF>Important: This course is not timed, but if you miss a flag, the flag count will restart on your next lap.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","'Ok, now we will work on your combat skills.\
\
'Use the speed of your mount to keep you out of harm's way, while delivering devastating attacks against your enemies.'\
\
<rgb=#ff00>- Tip: Queue your attacks before you reach your target.\
\
- Tip: Slowing down before a turn lets you turn much faster.</rgb>","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. I see you've earned yourself a fine steed of Rohan on which to ride forth. Finely done!\
\
'Yet steel yourself well - for this is no quiet mare, but a noble mount trained in the ways of war!\
\
'You'll find them spirited, and in some ways more difficult to ride than your prior mounts, but you will find that they possess the strength and stamina to do battle.'","Blows landed (${VALUE}/10)","Flag course completed!","Ride through the blue flags","'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. It will take several years to truly master the art of mounted combat, but you are off to an excellent start.\
\
'I think the battlefield shall teach you more now than I can, and time is short. I have many young riders yet to train this day.'","Red flags passed (${VALUE}/5)","Begin your instruction in how to ride a war-steed by speaking with Seoca.","This is the combat skill course.\
\
Ride back and forth between the target dummies at either end of the field, striking each in turn.\
\
<rgb=#ffff00>- Tip: Queue your attacks before you reach your target.\
\
- Tip: Slowing down before a turn allows you to turn much faster.</rgb>","Red flags passed!","Speak with Seoca near the jousting course in the middle of the field.","'Good luck to you, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Dark times are upon us, and I hope to see you at the forefront of our efforts to drive them back.'","Fences jumped (${VALUE}/4)","Blue flags passed (${VALUE}/6)","Jump each of the fences as you ride around the track.\
\
If you miss a fence, your count will reset when you cross the start line and you can keep going.","'Right, easy isn't it? Well, now we'll make things a bit more interesting.\
\
'Next up is the flag course.'\
\
<rgb=#ffff00>- Tip: This course is not timed, but if you miss a flag, the flag count will restart on your next lap.\
\
- Tip: If you find the flags are too closely spaced to pass through at full speed, try slowing down a little.\
\
- Tip: Using the mouse to turn allows finer control than the the keyboard.</rgb>","Speak with Seoca","Mount your war-steed near the outer track starting line.","Speak with Seoca to begin the next training course.","El Campo de Torneo: Tutorial de combate montado"},
[13207]={"Infiltrate the Gondorian tower and defeat the leader of the Orc forces","The Tower by the Stream","You have defeated the Orc leader","'I have given much thought to the situation, and I believe that the Orc menace may be more coordinated than we had believed. If our foe has been poaching fish from our stream, then surely they have discovered Minas Rant, the ancient Gondorian military tower due west from where you stand. I would wager that the Orcs plan to use it as a stronghold with which to watch over their newly claimed homes, I would stake my life on it!\
\
'It is time for us to claim a measure of retribution. The Orcs assailed my home, and now you must assault theirs. Find whichever brute commands these monsters and strike him down for the sake of all those who have fallen.'","Minas Rant is west of Springview Estate, at the edge of the stream that runs across the Norcrofts.\
\
Cyneswith believes that the commander of the Orcs inhabiting the farmsteads has likely established his base within the Gondorian tower of Minas Rant.","'Your actions have brought me some peace, for I know that a great measure of justice has been delivered. Once again, you have proven to be a ${CLASS} without equal. We are ever in your debt, friend.'","Speak to Cyneswith","Cyneswith awaits at the Springview Estate to the east of Minas Rant.\
\
Cyneswith is eager to hear of your stirke against the commander of the invading Orc forces.","The leader of the Orc forces pressing for control of the lands in the western plains of Norcrofts has fortified himself within the ancient Gondorian tower, Minas Rant."},
[13211]={"'¡Mira quién es, ${PLAYER}!'","Willem está celoso de toda la atención que Bingo le está dando a Crinloca. Cualquiera podría verlo.","'¿Tú y Bingo encontraron algún indicio de los agentes del Ojo Sangriento, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
Le entregas a Egwylf el broche que descubriste y le dices que te recuerda a la Piedra de Roth, una joya similar que encontraste en tus viajes. Ella asiente.\
\
'No sé dónde encuentra el Culto del Ojo Sangriento estos tesoros, pero valoran las gemas rojas por encima de todas las demás y las buscan exclusivamente. Sin embargo, he descubierto que los hombres que llevan estas broches no dudan en dejarlas atrás cuando están cerca de ser capturados. Sin estos identificadores, se vuelven casi invisibles a mi persecución, pero no es una pérdida completa, amiga mía. Ellos usan estas gemas como prueba de su lealtad, y sin una prueba como esta, ¿qué orco estaría dispuesto a creer que son quienes dicen ser?\
\
'Así que uno de los hombres que seguía ha quedado efectivamente despojado de sus garras. En cuanto al otro, he perdido su rastro. ¡Pediré tu ayuda y la de Bingo, si aún la ofrecen!'","'¿Qué pasó con el broche? ¿Lo dejaste atrás?'","Habla con Egwylf fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","'¡Qué hermoso paseo! ¡Bien hecho, Crinloca! Creo que no cabe duda de que eres el mejor corcel de todo Rohan. ¿Qué dices tú, ${PLAYER}? ¿No crees que Crinloca y yo parecemos estar en perfecta sintonía galopando por los campos de Rohan?\
\
'¿Pero qué le ocurre a Willem? No parece ser él mismo. ¿Está todo bien, W.B.?'","Bingo quiere viajar a la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts de Rohan Oriental, y te ha pedido derrotar a los enemigos de Rohan en el Páramo y los Norcrofts durante el viaje.","'Los dos hombres que seguí hasta Cliving buscarán lugares apartados dentro de la ciudad. ¡Busca algún rastro de su presencia!'","'¿Qué le ocurre a Willem? No parece ser él mismo. ¿Todo bien, W.W.?'","'No esperaba volver a verlos tan pronto, pero la pista que seguía me ha traído de regreso a Cliving. Mi misión en Stangard fue breve; los hombres allí permanecerán atentos a mi presa, pero hay tan pocos hombres confiables en Stangard que no sé si puedo fiarme de cualquier red que lleguen a tejer.\
\
'Hay fuerzas actuando en Rohan que buscan debilitar el reino. Es con gran vergüenza que les digo que no todos esos males vienen desde fuera. ¡Algunas de las mayores maldades las cometen hombres y mujeres de Rohan! Un culto llamado el Ojo Sangriento se ha aliado con orcos de la Tierra Negra. Creo que hay tres agentes del Ojo Sangriento activos en Rohan; he seguido a dos de ellos hasta aquí, a Cliving.\
\
'¿Me ayudarán a encontrarlos? Los reconocerán por los broches o collares que llevan: cada uno porta una gema roja, bien visible. Se esconden en rincones apartados de la ciudad, lejos de ojos curiosos. Si esto es demasiado peligroso para su amigo Bingo, lo entenderé. Pero agradecería mucho su ayuda.'","Bingo está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, en el Rohan Oriental.","Enemigos de Rohan derrotados en el Páramo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bingo ya está muy encariñado con Crinloca y está listo para comenzar su travesía por los vastos campos de Rohan.","'Creo que nuestro próximo destino debería ser la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, al suroeste. ¡Te esperaré fuera de la entrada, si Crinloca está dispuesto a emprender el viaje!'","'¡No esperaba ver a Egwylf tan pronto! ¡Su misión debe haberla traído de vuelta a Rohan con urgencia!'","Recoge el broche del Ojo Sangriento detrás de las tiendas","Willem no parece convencido, y Crinloca parece no darse por enterado.","Has encontrado un broche con una gema roja sobre un tronco detrás de unas tiendas, en la zona oriental de Cliving, y deberías recogerla.","Egwylf está fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.","Bingo está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, en Rohan Oriental.","Derrota enemigos de Rohan en los Norcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La pista se ha enfriado. ¡Agradecería vuestra ayuda para seguirla!'","Bingo está fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.","El broche contiene una gema roja y te recuerda a la Piedra de Roth.","Habla con Bingo fuera de la entrada de Cliving, en los Norcrofts","'No ha tomado mucho tiempo, ¡pero ya me he encariñado con Crinloca! Es un compañero amable y muy amistoso. El suelo no parece estar demasiado lejos desde aquí, y aunque no deseo dar un traspié, si llegara a rebotar fuera de la silla, creo que estaría bien. Y no parece tener interés alguno en morder mi sombrero o a mí, lo cual aprecio muchísimo.\
\
'¡Qué buen chico eres, Crinloca! Cuthbald me contó un poco de la geografía de Rohan, y creo que nuestro próximo destino debería ser la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, al suroeste. Yo me concentraré en mantenerme en la montura, si tú puedes encargarte de luchar contra cualquier enemigo que se cruce en nuestro camino, ${PLAYER}. ¡Derrotemos enemigos en el Páramo y en los Norcrofts mientras viajamos, y así nuestra presencia será un beneficio para la buena gente de Rohan!'","'¿El Ojo Sangriento? ¡Suena peligroso!'\
\
Bingo se estremece y luego aprieta los puños.\
\
'¡No tengo miedo, ${PLAYER}! Si podemos ayudar a Egwylf a capturar a esos malhechores, ¡debemos hacer lo que podamos! Yo estaré atento aquí en Cliving, ¡y tú deberías hacer lo mismo!'","El Rastreador","Camina hasta la entrada del Salón de Hidromiel en Cliving","'¡Deberías darle eso a Egwylf! ¡Yo no lo quiero! ¡No me gusta ni un poquito, ni un poquitito!'","Puede que agentes del Culto del Ojo Sangriento hayan llegado a la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.\
\
Egwylf te pidió que busques en la ciudad cualquier indicio de la presencia de los agentes del Ojo Sangriento.","Averigua qué le ocurre a Willem Bigote","'No me gusta nada este grupo del Ojo Sangriento, especialmente si sus miembros están aliados con orcos. ¿Quién querría unirse a criaturas tan terribles? ¡Yo no lo haría, por nada del mundo!\
\
'No sé si podré ser de mucha ayuda para Egwylf. Después de todo, ella es una rastreadora experta, y ha seguido a esos agentes del Ojo Sangriento durante lo que parece mucho tiempo. Pero somos aventureros, y si podemos ayudarla en su misión, ¡definitivamente debemos hacerlo! Es una pena que la pista se haya enfriado. ¿Crees que podrá retomarla? Si lo hace, podría resultar en un capítulo muy emocionante de mi relato del viaje.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'Una pista fría' (Nivel recomendado: 85)</rgb>","'¿Celoso? ¡Willem, no hay razón para eso! Nunca he tenido un amigo lince tan maravilloso, y desde que te uniste a nuestra pequeña compañía nunca he olvidado lo afortunado que soy de tenerte a mi lado en esta aventura!'\
\
Bingo hace una mueca.\
\
'Bueno, quizá lo olvidé una vez, pero en mi defensa olvidé muchas cosas cuando caí en las cavernas bajo las Montañas Nubladas. ¡Pero no volverá a pasar, Willem! Crinloca es un nuevo amigo, es cierto, ¡pero tú eres el único W.B. en este grupo! Creo que ustedes dos deberían llevarse bien, o me romperán el corazón. ¡Di algo tú, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Por ahora, deberíamos ir al Salón de la Hidromiel en Cliving y ver qué podemos aprender sobre esta ciudad. ¡Pero quiero que ustedes dos se lleven bien! ¡Esta aventura no será tan divertida si todos tienen sentimientos heridos!'","'Un culto que se hace llamar el Ojo Sangriento se ha aliado con orcos de la Tierra Negra. Creo que hay tres agentes del Ojo Sangriento actuando en Rohan; he rastreado a dos de ellos hasta Cliving.\
\
'¿Me ayudarás a encontrarlos? Los reconocerás por los broches o collares que llevan: cada uno porta una gema roja, bien visible. Deben de estar escondidos en rincones apartados de la ciudad, lejos de miradas indiscretas. Si esto es demasiado peligroso para tu amigo Bingo, lo entenderé. Pero tu ayuda será bienvenida.'","Le cuentas a Bingo que Willem está celoso de Crinloca.","Willem ignora la voz de Bingo y no se da vuelta.","'Creo haber visto algo sospechoso en el lado sureste del Salón de la Hidromiel, detrás de unas tiendas. Algo rojo y brillante atrapó la luz y destelló en mis ojos. ¿Qué habrá sido? Ahora no lo veo, pero quizá si la luz se refleja de nuevo, ese objeto rojo vuelva a mostrarse.'","Encuentra algún indicio de que los agentes del Ojo Sangriento están en Cliving","Derrota enemigos de Rohan en el Páramo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hola de nuevo, aventureros.'","Enemigos de Rohan derrotados en los Norcrofts (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","No hablas el lenguaje de los linces, pero incluso sin esa habilidad es fácil comprender qué le ocurre a Willem Bigote: ¡está celoso del nuevo amigo de Bingo, Crinloca!","Un broche con una gema roja ha sido dejada sobre un tronco apartado.","Egwylf está fuera del Salón de la Hidromiel de Cliving, en los Norcrofts.\
\
Has encontrado un broche con una gema roja abandonado en un rincón de Cliving, detrás de unas tiendas.","El Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving está en la esquina noreste de la ciudad.\
\
Bingo quiere caminar hasta el Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving y averiguar cuál es la situación para los aventureros en los Norcrofts.","Bingo ha visto un rostro familiar fuera del Salón de Hidromiel.","Lleva el broche del Ojo Sangriento a Egwylf fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","Habla con Bingo fuera del Salón de Hidromiel de Cliving","Willem Bigote está fuera de la entrada de la ciudad de Cliving en los Norcrofts, en Rohan Oriental.","'Creo que nuestro próximo destino debería ser la ciudad de Cliving, en los Norcrofts, al suroeste. Yo me concentraré en mantenerme en la silla, si tú puedes luchar contra los enemigos que crucen nuestro camino, ${PLAYER}. ¡Derrotemos enemigos en el Páramo y en los Norcrofts mientras viajamos y así nuestra presencia será un beneficio para la buena gente de Rohan!'","'¿Has encontrado algo?'","'¿Alguna suerte ya? Yo no he encontrado nada interesante, ¡pero no pienso rendirme!'","'¡Debemos registrar la ciudad para encontrar algún indicio de esos hombres! ¡Me da la impresión de que esos agentes del Ojo Sangriento no traen nada bueno para Rohan!'"},
[13212]={"You found the mysterious footprints","'These are indeed the Ungoledain. I spoke with Radagast about these strange skin-changers when we were last in the Vales of Anduin. He said they were following the call of one they named Mam Murgwid, and it was his belief that might be Ungwetári herself. There is much I do not understand, but if these Men choose to ally themselves with the spiders, then they are my enemy, and yours! But because they are Men, we should attempt to take one as a prisoner and bring our captive back to Echad Taerdim. An interrogation may yield useful information.'","The Ungoladan attacker has been defeated.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Find the mysterious footprints","Legolas draws his weapons!","'I understand what the Rangers meant; the footprints of a Man, and then suddenly...'\
\
Legolas goes silent. His eyes dart around, closely examining the prints.\
\
'I think I see what they could not. The footprints do not disappear, they merely change shape! I am not surprised that the Rangers could not see the footprints of a spider, but they are an old enemy of my people and I know them well. I believe you have already encountered Men who can become spiders, have you not, ${PLAYER}? We have uncovered the presence of the Ungoledain!\
\
'Let us continue in the direction of these tracks. We may find the skin-changers higher in these mountains.'","Legolas would like to speak with you.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","'I would like to begin with these mysterious \\qwinged men\\q. While the spiders are likely the most pressing concern, I do not want to travel into the more dangerous areas of Cirith Ungol with an unknown enemy still out there. Come, let us travel to the cliffs to the north-west and see if we can find the tracks for ourselves.'","Attempt to take an Ungoladan prisoner","The Ungoladan slumps to the ground, unconscious","The mysterious footprints of which the Rangers spoke can be found north-west of Echad Taerdim.\
\
You should find the footprints with Legolas.","Find a safe place to regroup near Cadar Skûs","You are being ambushed!\
\
Defeat the attacker!","Legolas would like to regroup in a safer location.\
\
You should find a safer spot to talk south of Cadar Skûs.","Legolas would like to talk to you about these strange footprints.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Find the Ungoledain","You have discovered a camp of Ungoledain","You have discovered an Ungoledain camp within Cirith Ungol. Legolas has decided a prisoner may yield some useful information.\
\
You should attempt to take an Ungoladan prisoner within Cadar Skûs.","Legolas has decided to first pursue the tracks the Rangers believe to be left by \\qwinged men\\q.","Defeat the attacker!","Legolas would like to speak to you about the Ungoledain camp you discovered.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","You have discovered evidence of an Ungoledain presence in Cirith Ungol.\
\
You should follow the tracks to find the Ungoledain.","The Ungoladan did not respond to you, and died fighting","'This foolish Ungoladan was easily dispatched... perhaps too easily. Why did he not shift into his spider form? It matters not; we desired a prisoner and now we have one.'","'Something is wrong. It is as if they cannot hear us at all and are completely entranced by some unseen force. I do not believe we will be able to capture one while they are in this state. We should do what we can to reduce this threat to the Rangers. When we are finished let us regroup in a safer area nearby.'","The Tracks of Winged Men","Habla con Legolas."},
[13213]={"The Tracks of an Army","Return to Déorwine","'While Théoden King's outriders look ahead, I am charged with leading the rearguard scouts who must look behind. We know we are being watched and that enemy forces creep up from all sides. I have sent my men out to cover what tracks they may, but I fear our marks were too many and my scouts too few.\
\
'Will you aid them in this effort, and cover tracks where you find them in the Beacon Hills? I thank you, ${CLASS}.'","Help Déorwine's scouts and cover any tracks left by the Rohirrim in the Beacon Hills.","Déorwine has requested help in aiding his rearguard to cover the tracks left behind by the Rohirrim.","Déorwine smiles widely as you describe all the Rohirrim tracks you covered. \
\
'I am glad to have you as a friend and not a foe, ${CLASS}! I shall rest easier knowing  how much harder a time the enemy will have in tracking our trail.'","Covered Rohirrim tracks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cover Rohirrim tracks (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Déorwine in the camp in Taur Drúadan and tell him that you have covered many of the Rohirrim tracks in the Beacon Hills."},
[13214]={"Now that the route from Felegoth to Lake-town has been made safe, trade can resume! Return to Loeglond to tell the raft-elves the good news.","Talk to Thranduil","Talk to Lorndúr","King Thranduil can be found within Felegoth.\
\
You should talk to Thranduil.","The Trade Must Flow","Lorndúr can be found in Loeglond.\
\
You should talk to Lorndúr","'You have done great deeds this day, ${PLAYER}, and not even for your own people. I am impressed by your generosity and valour. I shall keep my word and allow trade to resume with the Dale-folk. The Woodland Realm thanks you.\
\
'If you are seeking more good to be done, you might make your way to the Men of Lake-town and Dale. Their problems become our problems if left untended. Safe journey to you.'","'You have done it, ${PLAYER}! All my raft-elves are accounted for, and everything has been made safe. You should return to King Thranduil and tell him the good news. Thank you for everything you have done for us.'\
\
He bows deeply.","'I will be returning to Lake-town, now that this is all sorted out. If you ever end up there, look for me. Always plenty going on in Lake-town!\
\
'You may tell the Elves of Mirkwood that their friend is free and the Lake is safe for trading once again. '"},
[13215]={"The Trail Begins","You read:\
\
'Brother, the last group of captives has been secured deep within the waterfall. These foul invaders have infested our land, harry our men, and will be taught a lesson.\
\
'The filth in our cages will be a fitting tribute for our masters in among the crags to the east.  The weaker ones can be traded to the giants for protection. \
\
'Send a few men to the waterfall to guard the prisoners, when you have a chance.'\
\
Someone should be told of this letter.","'Thank you for returning with this note, ${PLAYER}. \
\
'It bodes poorly for those that journeyed here with me, but perhaps there may be time to save them.'","This note describes a hideous end for any that would fall into the clutches of the Draig-lûth, which have come north out of Dunland.","Gronu can be found at his camp north of Harndirion, at the foot of the mountain.\
\
You should seek out Gronu and give him the message that you found.","Bring the note to Gronu at his camp"},
[13216]={"'I cannot thank you enough for freeing the captives of the Draig-lûth. Not all were my companions, but they were indeed of my people.\
\
'${PLAYER}, praises will be spoken today and from our kin for many generations.'","According to a note that you discovered, the members of Gronu's hunting-party may still be alive and held in a secret cave beneath a waterfall.","The dungeon is behind the second waterfall, east of Gronu's camp.\
\
Gronu has asked you to find the dungeon where the Draig-lûth hold their prisoners and free his companions.","Talk to Gronu at his camp","Discover the cavern and save the captives","The Trail Ends","'It appears as if the Draig-lûth did not slay my companions after all. According to this note, they hold their prisoners in a dungeon behind a waterfall. This gives me hope that my friends and kinsmen yet live.\
\
'Perhaps you could locate this cavern and release any captives that might be held there. I fear for their fate if they cannot be rescued.\
\
'The note tells that the cavern may be found behind a waterfall east of here, the second one you will find, I believe.'","Gronu is at his camp, west of the waterfall.\
\
You should return to Gronu and let him know that all of the captives that could be found have been freed.","'Please, ${PLAYER}, find my friends and free them.'"},
[13217]={"Encontrarás a Falstarr en el campamento de Dolven-view, en Moria.\
\
Falstarr te ha pedido que vuelvas a hablar con él cuando estés listo para buscar la antigua armería, pero te advierte que una banda bien organizada de orcos de Moria se ha hecho con el control de la sala.","'Una banda organizada de orcos ha invadido la sala donde se encuentra el yunque que buscas. Si pretendes llegar hasta él, te espera una batalla difícil.\
\
'Puedo indicarte cómo llegar a la sala, pero el viaje será en vano si no me traes antes un granate imbuido. Sin esa piedra, no podrás otorgar a tu arma el poder que deseas.\
\
Cuando la encuentres, la prepararé para ti y te diré cómo llegar a la antigua estancia.'","'¿No has sido capaz de imbuir la piedra? Sin ella, no puedo ayudarte.'","Fastarr sabe de un yunque antiguo donde puedes forjar el núcleo con la calidad que buscas para tu arma, pero los exploradores informan que la antigua armería en la que se encuentra ha sido invadida recientemente por una fuerza bien organizada de orcos de Moria, incluso ahora se están entrenando para prepararse para su próximo asalto para expulsar a los enanos de Moria.","'¿Así que has regresado? Ah, veo que traer el granate imbuido. Eso significa que has tenido éxito.\
\
'Veamos si esa piedra es suficiente para alcanzar la calidad que buscas.'","Lleva un granate imbuido a Fastarr","'¡Ah!¡Al fin has encontrado un granate imbuido! Ahora tendrás que llevarlo a la antigua armería, pero antes debo prepararlo.\
\
'Cuando estés listo para partir hacia la amería, vuelve a hablar conmigo.'","'Has hecho un gran trabajo limpiando la antigua armería. No abundan los valientes dispuestos a arrojarse a las fauces de una banda entera de orcos,¡y menos aún los que tienen la fuerza necesaria para resistir hasta el final!'","¡La armería sigue en manos de los orcos!","La sala de entrenamiento","Lleva el granate imbuido a Fastarr","Encontrarás a Fastarr en el campamento del Mirador de la Gran Excavación, en Moria.\
\
Debes regresar con él para completar la mejora de tu arma.","Fastarr te ha pedido que le lleves un granate imbuido para ayudarte a imbuir de poder tu arma. Sin embargo, no sabe dónde puedes encontrar una piedra así.","'Si mis exploradores no se equivocan, un uruk especialmente brutal ha subido con sus fuerzas desde las minas más profundas y ha invadido la sala donde se encuentra el yunque que buscas. No será fácil expulsarlos de allí, pero cuanto antes lo hagamos mejor, porque están preparando un asalto contra nosotros en este mismo instante.'\
\
'¿Estás listo para enfrentarte a los orcos? Si es así, ponte en marcha...¡el tiempo apremia!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión en solitario y no se puede completar en grupo.</rgb>","Habla con Fastarr para viajar a la antigua armería","'Necesitarás traerme un granate imbuido antes de que podamos comenzar.'"},
[13219]={"Tilmakhím is to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Lay the traps in various locations around Tilmakhím.","Mâramit can be found at Tilmakhím, to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Speak with Mâramit and inform her the traps have been laid. She will want you to deliver a message to Hármelak to receive payment for her services.","Traps set (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Mâramit","'Have you spoken with Mâramit? I would not wish to wait long, lest those pests in Tâkhdar learn of our plans to ensnare them. I jest, of course, but the sooner the better to keep my people safe.'","Mâramit can be found at Tilmakhím, to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Ask Mâramit for more traps to place in order to capture pests. Hármelak will pay her later.","Hármelak is waiting in Dâr Laja.\
\
Return to Hármelak to convey Mâramit's good wishes, and inform her the traps have been set.","'Welcome back to my lovely little shop! Did you forget something? Or did you miss me?\
\
'Ah, Hármelak sent you this time. She has kept her word with me before. Yes, I will give you even more of my wares. Come see me again when you are finished setting the traps and we will discuss further, you and I.'","Return to Hármelak","Traps received","Tilmakhím is to the south of Tâkhdar.\
\
Hármelak has asked you to acquire more traps from Mâramit to ensnare more pests in Tâkhdar.","Ask Mâramit for more traps","'Do not forget to speak with me once you have finished setting all your traps! I must trust that you will convey my message to Hármelak regarding my payment.'","Set traps (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Do not forget to tell Hármelak I appreciate her wisdom! Make sure you mention how reasonable and generous my business is, as well.'","'Your assistance in discovering those dangerous traps was most welcome, ${PLAYER}. I have been made aware of the true source of these pests, and I require your assistance once more.\
\
'I assume you recall Mâramit, a purveyor of traps in Tilmakhím? Inform her you are my messenger, and that I will pay her well once she has given you more traps to place in these areas I will mark for you. She will not hesitate to comply, I am certain.'","'You return from Takhdâr. Then you faced no difficulty in setting my traps for those pests? I knew you would not disappoint.\
\
'Mâramit is a most beloved ally of mine. She has naught to fear from me, although I do find her magnanimous gesture touching. I thank you for sharing her kind words with me.\
\
'As before, I appreciate your delicacy and discretion in keeping our city safe. I do not think these pests will trouble us any longer.'","'You are finished with your task? Excellent. I will guess Hármelak wishes our exchange to be kept our little secret, no? I am accustomed to such matters in my trade. I just sell the things; what you do with them matters naught to me.\
\
'Tell Hármelak I will not expect payment this once, but I would like my generosity remembered next time any guards might want to poke their noses where they do not belong. Say this nicely, please!'","The Trappings of Nobility","Spoke with Mâramit","'Has Mâramit asked payment for her services? Bring me the exact amount, and I will be sure to thank her for her discretion most handsomely.'"},
[13220]={"El Bugan del Tesoro","¡Un Bugan furtivo intenta escapar con tesoros robados!\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión será eliminada de tu registro de misiones cuando termine el evento asociado.</rgb>","<rgb=#FF0000>¡No dejes que el Bugan escape!</rgb>","¡Un Bugan furtivo intenta escapar con tesoros robados!","¡Recuperaste el tesoro robado!","<rgb=#FF0000>¡El Bugan escapó!</rgb>","¡Derrota al Bugan del Tesoro antes de que escape!"},
[13221]={"¡Los Bugan del Tesoro han aparecido en Instancias por toda la Tierra Media!","¡El Evento del Bugan del Tesoro está aquí!","Teodoro Tojo, aventurero extraordinario, ha descubierto que los traviesos Bugan del Tesoro han comenzado a aparecer en lugares peligrosos por toda la Tierra Media.","El autoproclamado aventurero extraordinario Teodoro Tojo está siguiendo el rastro de los Bugan del Tesoro en algunos lugares peligrosos de la Tierra Media. Reúnente con él para iniciar una asociación provechosa.","Completa para recibir tu primera Moneda del Bugan","Teodoro Tojo puede encontrarse en cualquiera de estas instancias:\
