[13222]={"Culang el montaraz ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que lo encuentren los saqueadores de tumbas.","'Este acertijo podría esconder el secreto de la localización del tesoro:\
\
    \\qVerdes campos dos caminos surcan,\
   y bajo la mirada de cuatro reyes se cruzan.\\q\
\
'¿Quizás estas palabras hablen de la encrucijada de Canadiach, al este de Tinnudir?'","Un hito de piedra en Evendim podría esconder un tesoro. Culang ha compartido contigo este acertijo, que podría contener una pista de la localización del hito:\
\
   \\qVerdes campos dos caminos surcan,\
   y bajo la mirada de cuatro reyes se cruzan.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","El hito de piedra está roeado de signos de excavación. Si una vez marcó la localización del tesoro, seguro que ha sido  econtrado.\
\
El hito tiene una inscripción, desgastada por el paso del tiempo.","'He encontrado un acertijo que podría indicar el camino a un tesoro enterrado, ${PLAYER}. Un terrateniente Dúnadan enterró algo en algún lugar de Evendim, temeroso de que pudiera ser encontrado por las fuerzas del Rey Brujo si Fornost caía. Parece que su linaje se extinguió en la batalla, y sus tierras se abandonaron. Pero creo que su tesoro todavía no ha sido encontrado.\
\
'Este es el acertijo, ${PLAYER}: \\qVerdes campos dos caminos surcan,\
   y bajo la mirada de cuatro reyes se cruzan.\\q\
\
'No sé dónde si podría ser, pero hay una encrucijada al este de Tinnudir. Quizá este acertijo hable de la encrucijada de Canadiach.'","La búsqueda del tesoro"},
[13223]={"You have defended the wild herd from slaughter","'The true treasure of the Riddermark lies in one of its most royal bloodlines... the Mearas, lords of horses. While most of the wild horses of Rohan are not of pure Mearas stock, they all share in the bloodline, making them highly desirable to all.\
\
'Long has Mordor raided the herds of Rohan, taking the black horses and slaughtering the rest. I have learned that Orcs from Mordor are preparing to attack a herd not far from here... to the south-east.\
\
'You must not allow these noble beasts to be taken or slaughtered! Speak with me again if you are willing to go to their defence.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance is meant to be run with Mounted Combat. It may be run on foot, but will be considerably harder.</rgb>","'You must hurry if you are to save the horses!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance is meant to be run with Mounted Combat. It may be run on foot, but will be considerably harder.</rgb>","The mysterious old man is at Éomer's Vengeance, near the eaves of Fangorn, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should speak again with the mysterious old man if you are willing to defend the herd of wild horses.","The mysterious old man is at Éomer's Vengeance, on the eaves of Fangorn, in the Entwash Vale.\
\
You should return to the mysterious old man with news of your success.","'You discovered the source of the smoke and ashes? You say that a battle was fought there and that the bodies of the Orcs were burned? That would mean the Rohirrim were victorious.\
\
'This old man you speak of sounds much like Saruman... it is said he goes to and fro in such disguise; however, why would he send you to kill the captain of the goblins if he is behind the invasion as you say?\
\
'As well, his tidings saved the wild herds from the Orcs of Mordor... I cannot believe any evil of the man.'","Let the mysterious old man know that you will defend the herd","The old man is gone","Having returned from Thrug-unur victorious, the mysterious old man reveals another task that is more vital to the Rohirrim than the death of any Orc or goblin.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: This instance is meant to be run with Mounted Combat. It may be run on foot, but will be considerably harder.</rgb>","Talk to the mysterious old man at Éomer's Vengeance","Talk to Thane Béortnoth outside of Thornhope","The Treasure of Rohan","Thane Béortnoth is encamped beyond the walls of Thornhope, east of Éomer's Vengeance.\
\
You should return to Thane Béortnoth and tell him of the mysterious old man."},
[13225]={"Burned webbed trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Mirkwood spiders have killed and webbed many trees in Taurlingol.\
\
You should burn webbed trees.","Legolas can be found on a hill near Taurlingol.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","'The Mirkwood spiders have only been in Cirith Ungol a short time, and yet they have already begun to destroy the forest. They suffocate and hollow out trees to use as shelter for their broodlings. The dead trees must come down.","'We could do nothing for the trees that were already killed, but by culling the spiders, we may yet save the living forest.'","Habla con Legolas.","The Mirkwood spiders have only recently arrived, but already they taint the forests in Cirith Ungol.","Burn webbed trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Trees of Taurlingol"},
[13227]={"Thaliollang está en Lin Giliath, al noroeste de Taur Gonwaith.\
\
Thaliollang se alegrará de saber que tenía razón en su creencia: había un emisario de Angmar entre los trolls. Para beneficio de todos, lo has derrotado.","'Has ganado más agradecimiento del que puedo darte, ${PLAYER}, por derrotar al guardián de trolls de Angmar.\
\
'Lachenn se habría alegrado de conocerte. Te nombro Amigo de los Elfos y no olvidaré lo que has hecho aquí, ${PLAYER}. Espero que los trolls de piedra tampoco lo olviden. Lin Giliath puede tener paz por un tiempo.'","Alguien maligno ha agitado a los trolls de piedra, incitándolos a sembrar el caos en los hermosos claros de Meluinen.","El emisario de Angmar debe residir en lo profundo de la cueva en Taur Gonwaith, al sureste de Lin Giliath.\
\
Debes derrotar al emisario de Angmar que ha ganado la lealtad de los trolls de piedra.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una comunidad para esta misión.</rgb>","Has descubierto las Cuevas de Etten en Taur Gonwaith. Sea lo que sea que haya incitado a los trolls, sin duda se oculta en estas vastas cavernas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Se recomienda una comunidad para esta misión.</rgb>","'Lachenn ha sido vengado, y los trolls de piedra quizá nunca vuelvan a atacar Lin Giliath.'","'Que Angmar ya tenga poder incluso en Meluinen es una triste noticia.'","Busca en las Cuevas de Etten al líder de los trolls.","'Cruza las Quebradas con precaución, ${PLAYER}, pues los peligros aumentan con cada día que pasa.'","El guardián de trolls"},
[13228]={"Derrota trolls de piedra en Ost Thondol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los Trolls de Ost Thondol","Trolls de piedra derrotados en Ost Thondol (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Trolls de piedra han descendido desde las Montañas Nubladas hacia las Gargantas del Bruinen, en el Bosque de los Trolls.","Hay trolls de piedra asentados en las ruinas de Ost Thondol, en las Gargantas del Bruinen del Bosque de los Trolls.\
\
Mientras explores Ost Thondol, deberías encargarte de los trolls de piedra que se han establecido allí."},
[13229]={"Los trolls de Taur Gonwaith","Has derrotado a un buen número de amenazadores y mortíferos trolls en los bosques de Taur Gonwaith.","Un buen número de trolls deambulan por los bosques de Taur Gonwaith. Estas son peligrosas y malvadas criaturas, siervas del enemigo. ¿Quién los ha despertado de las profundas cavernas donde permanecían en letargo?","Los trolls merodean por Taur Gonwaith en Meluinen, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes derrotar a los mortíferos trolls de Taur Gonwaith.","Derrota trolls en Taur Gonwaith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Trolls derrotados en Taur Gonwaith (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado"},
[13230]={"Vatug-ronk, home to the fiercest Orcs in Gundabad, also plays host to a number of trolls who are tougher than average. Defeating them as quickly as possible before they cause deaths on the battlefield would be best.","Derrota a los trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeating the trolls of Vatug-ronk as quickly as possible before they cause deaths on the battlefield would be best.","You have defeated a number of trolls in Vatug-ronk. The less the Gabil'akkâ has to deal with the trolls, the better.","Defeat trolls in Vatug-ronk","The trolls of Vatug-ronk remain a sizeable threat to the Gabil'akkâ","The Trolls of Vatug-ronk","Vatug-ronk, home to the fiercest Orcs in Gundabad, also plays host to a number of trolls who are tougher than average.","Completado","Trolls derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated a number of trolls in Vatug-ronk."},
[13231]={"'¿Moscas de la cosecha atacando a la gente? ¡Eso no parece correcto! Bueno, seguro que les diste una lección.'","Hay un nido de moscas de la cosecha en la Colina Yale, a una distancia al sur y este de Bolgovado, no muy lejos al noreste de Casa del Bosque. La colina está marcada por tres pilares en su cima.\
\
Bingo Bolger está preocupado por la agresividad aumentada de las moscas de la cosecha y te ha pedido ayuda para lidiar con ellas.","'Antes, las moscas de la cosecha eran solo una molestia. Mordían nuestros cultivos y causaban algo de daño, pero uno aprendía a vivir con ellas.\
\
'¡Recientemente, sin embargo, las moscas de la cosecha han llegado a atacar hobbits en el Marjala! No sé qué las ha alterado tanto, pero ¡ojalá no fuera así!\
\
'Si puedes encargarte de nuestro problema con las moscas de la cosecha, te lo agradecería mucho, {Frontero[m]|Frontera[f]}. Escuché que hay todo un nido en la Colina Yale, una colina al sur y este de Bolgovado. No está muy lejos al noreste de Casa del Bosque. Hay tres viejos pilares en la cima de la Colina Yale, así que no debería ser difícil de encontrar.'","Derrotar moscas de la cosecha (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'No soportaba a las moscas de la cosecha cuando solo arruinaban los cultivos, ¡pero ahora son aún peores!'","El problema con las moscas de la cosecha","Las moscas de la cosecha generalmente solo son una molestia para los cultivos, pero recientemente han comenzado a atacar hobbits en el Marjala.","'Puedes encontrar moscas de la cosecha por todo el Marjala, ${PLAYER}, pero especialmente en la Colina Yale, al suroeste de Bolgovado y al noreste de Casa del Bosque. Hay tres pilares en la cima de la colina, y deberías poder verla desde lejos. ¡Todos nos sentiremos más seguros si puedes deshacerte de algunas moscas de la cosecha!'","Bingo Bolger está en Bolgovado, junto a un corral de cerdos en la ladera baja del pueblo.\
\
Bingo Bolger informó sobre el aumento de la agresividad entre las moscas de la cosecha en el Marjala y te pidió que te encargues de ellas. Debes regresar con él para informarle sobre tu éxito.","'Bueno, qué alivio, ${PLAYER}. No sé qué ha hecho que las moscas de la cosecha empiecen a atacar a la gente, ¡y creo que no quiero saberlo! ¡Solo quiero que se calmen y dejen en paz a la buena gente del Marjala!'","Moscas de la cosecha derrotadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13232]={"El problema con los sureños","Ahora que conoces Bree, Graeme Tenderlarch ha decidido pedirte ayuda real en las afueras del pueblo.","'Habla con mi Vigilante Jefe al norte por el Camino Verde, en una cabaña de piedra fuera de la Puerta Oeste de Bree.'","Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar fuera de Bree.","'Como mencioné antes, los bandidos se han convertido en una verdadera amenaza para la seguridad de las Tierras de Bree. Mi Vigilante Jefe se ha trasladado a las afueras del pueblo, justo fuera de la Puerta Oeste y hacia el norte por el Camino Verde, a una pequeña cabaña de piedra, en un intento por frustrar los planes de los bandidos.\
\
'¿Podrías ir a visitarlo y ver si ha logrado algún progreso contra la amenaza que estos sureños representan para nuestra ciudad? Me parece que cada día más y más bandidos logran entrar en Bree, y aunque algunos son simples refugiados, temo que un número creciente tiene malas intenciones para este pueblo.\
\
'Habla con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar tan pronto como puedas.'","'¿Tenderlarch te envió? Bien, me vendría bien una mano aquí.\
\
'Si Tenderlarch se saliera con la suya, habríamos pedido ayuda a esos malditos Montaraces. Por suerte, lo convencí de que mis Vigilantes pueden manejar esta amenaza incipiente.\
\
'Con tu ayuda, haremos que estos bandidos retrocedan hasta las Quebradas del Sur en poco tiempo.'","El Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar está en una cabaña de piedra junto al camino, fuera de la Puerta Oeste de Bree y hacia el norte por el Camino Verde.\
\
Graeme Tenderlarch, el alcalde de Bree, te pidió que hablaras con el Vigilante Jefe Grimbriar sobre los bandidos que amenazan la seguridad de las Tierras de Bree."},
[13233]={"Stanric seems to be a good man and has asked you to help the toiling Men of Stangard with their chores.","'Yes, the Men of Stangard carry many burdens. There was hope that Sithric would make things better here, but life is harder now.\
\
'Men are hungrier, and many leave and do not return. Those who stay carry more weight than ever.'","Talk to Gadda, Stanric's most trusted guard","'Ah, Stanric sent you to see me? I understand -- I will not say a word to Sithric on this matter.\
\
'I have plenty of ideas as to how you can help in Stangard, ${PLAYER}. Let us begin with delivering rations, performing the watch, and dealing with some of the petty crime we have been experiencing of late.\
\
'Please go and help the men with their duties. You will be of great help!'","Byrnstan guards the Mead Hall door of Stangard. Gadda stands not far from the Mead Hall. Sabert guards the north gate down below.\
\
You should speak with Gadda and see how you may assist the men of Stangard.","'Sithric has been sent by Théoden King and is an advisor of Edoras. I... have no power over him, and he asserts his will in all that goes on here.\
\
'I am sorry that we cannot welcome you here more warmly, according to our traditions, ${PLAYER}. But if you wish to do my men a kindness, you may help them with their duties.\
\
'Gadda is a good man and will know where you can begin.'","Help Byrnstan find what was stolen from him","The Troubles of Stangard","Gadda guards the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should speak with Gadda about what to do to assist the Men of Stangard.","Tell Gadda of the hardships you observed","Gadda is outside the Mead Hall in Stangard.\
\
You should tell Gadda of the many problems and hardships you observed in life at Stangard.","Help Gadda give food rations out to the men","Help Sabert by performing a long-overdue watch-tower duty"},
[13235]={"Tóki Barbablanca te dijo que los trolls robaron las piedras que llevaba su compañía.","Busca las piedras robadas entre los trolls de piedra.","Has encontrado las piedras robadas.","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperes el tesoro de los enanos.","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperaras el tesoro de los enanos.","Heithur Puñohierro se encuentra en el campamento de Barachen, al sur del camino, hacia el oeste del campamento de los trolls de piedra.\
\
Debes llevar las piedras robadas a Heithur Puñohierro de inmediato.","Los verdaderos ladrones","Los trolls de piedra están apostados en un sendero al norte del camino, más hacia el este desde el Último Puente.\
\
Tóki Barbablanca te pidió que dieras caza a los trolls que robaron las piedras y que recuperaras el tesoro.","Lleva las piedras robadas a Heithur Puñohierro","'¡Has recuperado las piedras de los trolls de piedra! ¡Tienes mi gratitud, ${PLAYER}, y más aún..... también tienes el agradecimiento del señor Glóin de la Montaña Solitaria!\
\
'¡Toma esta recompensa y consérvala en memoria del bien que has hecho por mí y por mi señor!.'","Busca las piedras robadas entre los trolls de piedra del Bosque de los Trolls.","'¿Dónde están las piedras?'"},
[13237]={"Náin has asked to speak with you in Aslíf.","Habla con Náin","'I understand the value in listening, at least; perhaps the Orc will accidentally let go of important information. I'll tolerate his presence for now. But the moment he ceases to be useful, I will not hesitate to bring the Black Mattock down upon his head.\
\
'Come, then. Let us hear what he has to say.'","With the Orc taken as prisoner, Náin and Féli prepare to interrogate him.","'Keep your wits about you.'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>WARNING: This is a solo instance and cannot be completed in a fellowship.</rgb>","Náin waits for you in Aslíf.","'Gorgar's pride must know no bounds if he is boastful enough to claim that he killed my father. Hah! As if that wretch could have ever laid a finger on him!\
\
'My people might never see justice done for what the Orcs have wrought upon us. But if we defeat Gorgar, then I can see at least a small amount of justice done for my family. To put an end to the line of Azog once and for all... my grandfather and my father would rest easier, knowing it is over.'","The Truth of the Matter"},
[13238]={"Collected turtle-eggs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'You have done a great thing, stranger. Saving the turtles is very important to the hunters of the Avanc-lûth.\
\
'Please, take this as a token of my appreciation.'","Turtle-eggs can be found throughout the southern Dunbog.\
\
Rhodri has asked you gather turtle-eggs from all over the southern bog so that the turtles can be saved.","Rhodri is worried about the endless slaughtering of turtles and feels that eventually there will be no more turtles in all of the Dunbog.","The Turtle or the Egg","Talk to Rhodri at the hunters' camp","'You still need to save more turtle eggs and quickly. Collect all the eggs and return here when you are done.'","'Do you know what the hunter's favoured game is in the Dunbog? Turtles. They present a challenge because they protect themselves so very well. We love hunting them... too much, perhaps.\
\
'The turtles are in danger of vanishing from the Dunbog. We cannot let this happen. We must protect the turtles.\
\
'Go forth and gather turtle-eggs from around the edges of the great southern bog. We need to save the eggs so that we can make sure there are always turtles to hunt!'","Collect turtle-eggs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13239]={"Habla con Orchalwë en Tinnudir","Las propiedades del Crepúsculo","'Mi diario contiene toda la información que necesitas.'","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Andalath","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Nambarth","Tienes la sensación de que Tham Nambarth está bajo control. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Varan","Tienes la sensación de que Tham Varan está bajo control. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Ornen","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Varan","Las propiedades al este de Tinnudir, en los Campos del Crepúsculo, pertenecieron en su día a familias de gran riqueza y prestigio del Reino del Norte.","'La tierra al este de aquí se llama los Campos del Crepúsculo. En su interior se encuentran las ruinas de varias propiedades antiguas. Estos lugares fueron en su día el hogar de poderosas familias del reino. Cultivaban cereales y criaban animales para alimentar a la ciudad, y daban trabajo a mucha gente.\
\
'Ahora están deshonradas por los saqueadores, invadidas por la naturaleza, profanadas por los trasgos, y una de ellas incluso sirve de campamento a una fuerza de Angmar. Es una afrenta para todos aquellos que descienden de las orillas de este lago.\
\
'He detallado en este diario notas sobre las propiedades y las amenazas que las acechan. Por favor, llévatelo y léelo mientras exploras los Campos del Crepúsculo. Te servirá de guía si decides ayudarnos a recuperar estas antiguas ruinas.'","Sientes que has hecho todo lo que podías en Tham Ornen. La siguiente página del diario habla de Tham Andalath","El diario de Orchalwë se encuentra entre tus pertenencias.\
\
El diario de Orchalwë detalla lo que hay que hacer para recuperar los Campos del Crepúsculo.","'Las propiedades de los Campos del Crepúsculo están ahora bajo nuestro control. Todavía queda algo de trabajo por hacer en Tham Ornen, pero creo que ya podemos hacer frente a la situación que queda por resolver.\
\
'Has hecho un gran trabajo por nosotros. Quizás algún día mi espada se una a la tuya y nos enfrentemos juntos a nuestros enemigos.'","Lee el diario de Orchalwë y recupera Tham Ornen","Los trasgos han huido, aterrorizados por lo que sea que merodee en la oscuridad. Has llegado al final del diario. Deberías regresar con Orchalwë."},
[13240]={"'¡Qué vergüenza me da admitirlo, pero me he quedado sin cordel, ${PLAYER}. Yo, el Maestro Zapatero del evento de Aplastamiento de Musarañas del Jardín...\
\
'Es verdad. Difícil de creer, lo sé. ¿Podrías... podrías traerme más, por favor? Normalmente lo consigo en Celondim, donde los Elfos que trabajan en los muelles fabrican un hilo fino y resistente.\
\
'Eres una buena clase de ${RACE}, ${PLAYER}. De verdad.'","'¡Cordel! Maravilloso. Empezaba a pensar que te habías perdido. Bueno, esto servirá por un tiempo, al menos. Mis gracias, ${PLAYER}. ¡Eres más útil de lo que pareces a primera vista!'","Recoge cordel en los muelles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Deluraw, el zapatero del evento de pisoteo de musarañas, se encuentra en Duillond, cerca de los hornos.\
\
Debes llevar el cordel que recogiste a Deluraw.","Lleva el cordel a Deluraw","Cordel recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El cordel elaborado por los Elfos puede encontrarse en Celondim, sobre y alrededor de los muelles.\
\
Debes recoger cordel en Celondim para la fabricación de las botas usadas en el evento de pisoteo de musarañas.","Los Cordeles que Unen","El zapatero del evento de pisoteo de musarañas necesita cordel para terminar su último lote de botas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTA: Esta misión se eliminará de tu registro cuando finalice el festival actual. </rgb>","'Oh... sigues aquí. Quizá no me escuchaste bien: me he quedado sin cordel. No vino. No salmuera. Cordel. Por favor, tráeme más.'"},
[13241]={"'¡Hom! El bosque hierve de ira mientras el poder del Corazón Retorcido crece, y aunque temo que tengamos poco tiempo, la prisa solo nos llevará al desastre.\
\
'Ta-room, ta-rum... ¿Estás completamente con preparación para lo que viene? Asegúrate, porque la muerte nos espera si fallamos.'","Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Ramalarga te pidió que lo acompañaras contra el Corazón Retorcido.","Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar otra vez con Ramalarga.","Acompaña a Ramalarga contra el Corazón Retorcido","El Corazón Retorcido","Habla con Ramalarga en las Agujas de la Linde","'¡Hoom! De las ramas marchitas que me trajiste, he comprendido mucho. En el bosque del sur vivía un árbol muy antiguo al que conocí bien, pero tras la destrucción provocada por las guerras de antaño, se volvió hacia dentro y ya no quiso hablar conmigo... aunque mi propio pesar por los actos de los Hombres era casi tan grande como el suyo.\
\
'Ahora parece que los trolls silvanos —en especial aquel al que llaman Putrecorazones— le han susurrado durante su largo sueño y lo han despertado bajo su dominio. Su corazón es ahora negro y retorcido por su malicia, y no tolera a ningún ser de carne en su dominio. ¡Hom! ¡Ta-room! Si solo eso hubiera ocurrido, le prestaría poca atención, pues la locura del Corazón Retorcido sería solo suya; pero ahora sus raíces se extienden lejos y profundamente, aferrándose y torciendo cada árbol que tocan, y los trolls silvanos seguirán su estela. No puedo permitir que el Corazón Retorcido deforme todo el bosque según su voluntad. Debemos enfrentarlo y derribar tanto a él como al vil troll que lo corrompió.\
\
'Sé cuidadoso, pues el poder del Corazón Retorcido se ha vuelto terrible, y temo que será todo lo que podamos hacer simplemente encararlo en el lugar donde es más fuerte... pero no tenemos otra opción. ¡Ta-rum! ¡Hoom! Háblame de nuevo cuando puedas partir.'","Ramalarga cree que algún poder maligno podría estar retorciendo el bosque con fines oscuros.","'¡Hoom! Gracias por ayudarme a purgar la Arboleda Retorcida de los males que la asolaban. Es triste ver caer a un viejo amigo a un destino así, pero así es el mundo. Las estaciones cambian, las hojas caen, las ramas se marchitan... y con el tiempo, nuevos brotes crecen para ocupar su lugar. Pero ese paso nunca está libre de dolor, ¿verdad?'","¡Hoom! ¡Hom! ¡Ha pasado tanto tiempo desde que mi sangre corrió con tanto calor y fervor! ¡Eso estuvo bien peleado! Aunque tengo poca estima por hachas y espadas, había olvidado la energía tan agradable del combate. ¡Ta-room! Incluso ahora siento que la ira del bosque disminuye mientras la influencia del Corazón Retorcido se desvanece. Pronto, creo yo, regresará algo de paz a este lugar.\
\
'Ta-rum... Mi agradecimiento para ti. Tu ayuda fue más que bienvenida. Por favor, perdona mi rudeza cuando nos conocimos."},
[13242]={"Ramalarga está en las Agujas de la Linde, en la orilla noroeste del lago Evendim.\
\
Deberías hablar otra vez con Ramalarga.","Acompaña a Ramalarga contra el Corazón Retorcido","'I have received a strange message from our allies in Evendim. It seems that far to the West in the forests of Evendim there lies a grove where one an Ent has taken up residence in his search for the Entwives. Through his Elf-friends he has sent forth a call for aid against a dark menace in the forests there -- some corruption of the wood by a band of Wood-trolls and a Huorn that has fallen under their sway.\
\
'I need you to gather a strong following of your companions and make this journey into the western woods, so that this threat may be eliminated before it spreads its corruption further.\
\
'Speak with Longbough the Ent when you are ready to begin your assault.'","'Have you gathered your allies? Hom! The forest seethes with anger as the power of the Twisted Heart grows, and while I fear we have little time, haste will lead only to disaster.\
\
'Ta-room! Ta-rum! Are you fully prepared for what lies ahead? Be certain, for we face death should we falter.'","Hoom! Hom! It has been ever so long since my blood has run with such heat and fervour! That was well fought, Little One! Indeed while I have little love for axes and swords, I had forgotten the enjoyable haste of battle. Ta-room!\
\
'Even now though, I feel the anger of the forest subsiding as the Twisted Heart's influence fades. Soon some measure of peace shall return here, I think.\
\
'Ta-rum! My thanks to you, little one. Your aid was most welcome. Please forgive my rudeness when first we met.","'Hoom! Thank you for your help in purging the Twisted Grove of the evils that had beset it, Little One. It is sad to see an old friend fall to such a fate, but such is the way of the world. Seasons turn, leaves fall, branches wither -- and in the fullness of time, new shoots grow to take their place. But such passing is never without pain, is it?'","The Ent Longbough believes that some evil power may be twisting the wood to dark ends.","The Twisted Heart -- Redux","Longbough is at the Eavespires, on the north-west shore of Lake Evendim.\
\
Handarod has asked you to speak with the Ent Longbough and assist him against the Wood-trolls of Evendim.","Talk to Longbough"},
[13243]={"Le das a Cebadilla algunas monedas de parte de Bingo y las acepta gentilmente.\
\
'Oh, muchas gracias, es muy generoso de vuestra parte. Es un honor y un placer servir a gente tan amable como el señor Bingo y usted, y el señor Buenavista es un parroquiano habitual, por supuesto. Vuestro grupo ha sido muy agradable. A veces necesito bajar a la gente que se sube a las mesas a bailar, pateando la vajilla por todas partes, ¡pero ustedes han sido unos clientes excelentes!'","Bingo está dentro de la poco acogedora sala común de la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias.","Habla con Cebadilla Mantecona dentro del Poney Pisador","Prueba algo de comida de los platos pequeños (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bree está al este del camino desde Norburgo.\
\
Bingo está listo para continuar su viaje, y quiere caminar contigo hasta la puerta oeste de Bree.","'¡Gracias de nuevo por tu generosidad y la del señor Boffin!'","'Me reuniré contigo en la Puerta Oeste de Bree. ¡Estoy listo para que nuestra aventura continúe!'","Quizás a Cebadilla le vendrían bien unas monedas más, después de todo","'¡Ahí estás! Bingo estaba preguntando por ti. ¡Quiere que te unas a él en la mesa y te pongas a <rgb=#FF0000>bailar</rgb>! ¡No había quien se lo discutiera! ¡Tendrás que hacerlo!'","Viaja a la Posada Abandonada, en las Tierras Solitarias","Bingo y tú habéis sido invitados a uniros a la fiesta en el Poney Pisador. Deberías hablar con su propietario, Cebadilla Mantecona.","La siguiente etapa del viaje de Bingo le lleva a Bree, donde los hobbits y la Gente Grande viven juntos en la colina de Bree.","Cebadilla Mantecona está en el Poney Pisador, y tus recientes hazañas de baile te han convencido de que quizá merece unas cuantas más de las monedas de Bingo.","'Ah, ¡qué voz tan singular! ¡Parece que has ido ganando talento mientras más tiempo pasamos aquí, ${PLAYER}!\
\
'Toma, aquí tienes mi monedero. ¿Puedes asegurarte de que Cebadilla recibe suficientes monedas para pagar nuestra comida y bebida? Somos un grupo bullicioso, ¡y lo justo es que se le recompense adecuadamente por su hospitalidad!\
\
'Mientras te ocupas de eso, debo decirle algo a Milo. ¿Qué era? Algo sobre hobbits, ¡eso es lo que recuerdo! Pero, ¿qué era? Ya me volveré a acordar, estoy seguro.'","'¡Bienvenidos a Bree, mis nuevos amigos!'","'¡Te veré en el interior del Poney Pisador, ${PLAYER}!'","Lleva unas cuantas monedas más de Bingo a Cebadilla","Bebe jarras de cerveza (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Después de todo ha sido una visita agradable, ${PLAYER}. Prisca terminará perdonándome por lo que haya tenido que ver en la decisión de Caléndula de convertirse en una heroína en vez de una hobbit casera, y disfruté el tiempo que pasé con mis numerosos primos. He anotado sus nombres en los márgenes de mi manuscrito para no olvidarlos. ¡Una vez más, me maravilla cómo Prisca lleva la cuenta de todos ellos!\
\
'¡Mis pies están listos de nuevo para retomar el camino! He consultado el mapa, y parece que Bree debería ser nuestra siguiente parada. Caminemos hasta la puerta oeste del pueblo, admiremos las vistas un momento y luego continuaremos hacia las Tierras Solitarias... ¡a la aventura!'","'Te he dado mi monedero. ¿Puedes asegurarte de que Cebadilla reciba suficientes monedas para pagar nuestra comida y bebida? Somos un grupo bullicioso, ¡y lo justo es que se le recompense adecuadamente por su hospitalidad!'","'¡Come, bebe y canta, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! No es hora de discutir, ¡incluso si hay errores en la historia de Milo!'","La Posada Abandonada está en las Tierras Solitarias, al este de Bree.\
\
Bingo ha decidido que sería lo mejor continuar su viaje antes de pasar más tiempo de fiesta en el Poney Pisador.","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Más monedas? ¡Ah, gracias, gracias! No es realmente necesario.'\
\
Cebadilla mira alrededor con un aire conspirador.\
\
'¡Vuestro baile no era TAN malo, ${PLAYER}! ¡Ja, ja! No es mi intención faltar al respeto, por supuesto, ¡y gracias de nuevo por vuestra generosidad y la del señor Boffin!'","Prueba algo de comida de los platos grandes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las dos posadas","'¡Magnífico, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! Tienes una voz muy bonita, ¡y estoy impresionado por la cantidad de comida y bebida que has despachado en tan poco tiempo! ¡No es nada comparada con la mía, por supuesto, pero aún así es impresionante!\
\
'¿Vas a bajar el ritmo? ¡Inaceptable! ¡Más comida, más bebida y más canciones! ¡No debemos insultar al propietario de este buen establecimiento!'","Habla con Bingo en la Posada Abandonada","Encuentra a Bingo en algún lugar del exterior del Poney Pisador","'¡Siempre es un placer conocer gente nueva!'","El interior de esta posada es oscuro, silencioso y poco acogedor","Bingo está disfrutando de su estancia en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","'¡Le doy la bienvenida al Poney Pisador, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}! Póngase ${PLAYERNAME:cómodo[m]|cómoda[f]}, ¡y no sea ${PLAYERNAME:tímido[m]|tímida[f]}! El señor Boffin ya ha encontrado una mesa en la sala común, y me dijo que le esperaría.\
\
'Por favor, hágame saber si hay algo que necesite, ¡y disfrute la comida, bebida y la compañía!'","'Bingo y tú sois estupendos, ${PLAYER}! ¡Sois bienvenidos en Bree cuando queráis!'","Habla con Bingo en el Poney Pisador","'Bingo dijo que se sentía mal, y salió fuera a tomar un poco de aire. Supongo que lo encontrarás dormido en uno de los fardos de heno cerca de los establos del Poney. Yo he despertado en esas pesebreras más de una vez, ¡te lo puedo asegurar!\
\
'Deberías asegurarte de que se encuentra bien, ${PLAYER}.'","'Nunca he estado antes en Bree, pero siempre había oído que había algo particular en los hobbits que vivían aquí. ¡Pero este Milo parece ser perfectamente amigable! Nos ha invitado al Poney Pisador para una breve bienvenida en el salón principal, y he aceptado de buen grado. ¡Qué bien hacer nuevos amigos!","'Es un honor y un placer servir a gente tan amable como el señor Bingo y usted, y el señor Buenavista es un parroquiano habitual, por supuesto. Vuestro grupo ha sido muy agradable. A veces necesito bajar a la gente que se sube a las mesas a bailar, pateando la vajilla por todas partes, ¡pero ustedes han sido unos clientes excelentes!'","Bingo te da su monedero para que puedas pagar a Cebadilla","Bingo te ha invitado a comer, beber y cantar en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","'¡No puedo imaginar una sala común más distinta a la del Poney Pisador, ${PLAYER}! ¡Esta es opresiva y nada acogeadora, desde luego! Aunque puede que sea lo mejor, ¡porque la algarabía y el jolgorio del famoso Poney de Bree amenazaban con detener mi viaje allí para siempre!'\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Bert Bartolín ha llegado a Ost Guruth en las Tierras Solitarias.</rgb>\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>La semana que viene: 'El último tesoro' (Nivel recomendado: 26)</rgb>","Jarras de cerveza bebidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'El Poney Pisador está justo subiendo la colina, y es un lugar de mucho jolgorio, con buena comida y bebida y mucha buena gente, tanto Grandes como Pequeñas. ¡Habla con Cebadilla y él se asegurará de atendernos!'","Viaja a la Puerta Oeste de Bree","Comida probada de los platos pequeños (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡${PLAYERNAME:Bienvenido, bienvenido[m]|Bienvenida, bienvenida[f]}! Bingo me estaba contando sobre este viaje suyo. ¡Qué tipo tan extraordinario! No podía quedarse sin experimentar la mejor posada de todas las Tierras de Bree, ¿no te parece?\
\
'Encontrarás el Poney subiendo la colina, y creo que será una buena oportunidad para el descanso y el jolgorio. Después de todo, la aventura de Bingo pronto le llevará a las tierras salvajes, ¡y habrá pocas oportunidades para festejos! Habla con el viejo Cebadilla en el interior del Poney, y él se asegurará de proporcionarnos cualquier cosa que necesitemos.'","'Milo nos ha invitado al Poney Pisador para una breve bienvenida en el salón principal, y he aceptado de buen grado. ¡Qué bien hacer nuevos amigos!'","'Según el mapa, hay otra posada justo al entrar en las Tierras Solitarias, al este. Viajemos a esa posada y busquemos habitaciones para pasar la noche. ¡No más jolgorio de momento! ¡Ha probado ser incluso más peligroso para mi viaje que las Quebradas de los Túmulos!'","Milo Buenavista busca llamar tu atención en el Poney Pisador.","<rgb=#FF0000>Canta</rgb> en la sala común del Poney Pisador (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Milo Buenavista está esperando para hablar contigo en el Poney Pisador.","Lleva el monedero de Bingo a Cebadilla Mantecona","Comida de los platos grandes probada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","¡Bingo te ha pedido que te reúnas con él en la mesa y bailes!","Milo te ha dicho que Bingo ha salido fuera para tomar un poco el aire, y podría estar durmiendo en uno de los fardos de heno en los establos cerca del Poney Pisador.","'Oh, ${PLAYER}... no me siento muy bien. ¡Quizá esto no haya sido buena idea!'\
\
Bingo menea la cabeza, aturdido.\
\
'He disfrutado haciendo nuevos amigos, ¡pero confieso que este no es un comienzo prometedor para nuestro viaje! Creo que lo mejor será que dejemos Bree y su famoso Poney tras nosotros, ¡o esto será todo lo lejos que me lleve mi aventura!\
\
'Según el mapa, hay otra posada justo al entrar en las Tierras Solitarias, al este. Viajemos a esa posada y busquemos habitaciones para pasar la noche. ¡No más jolgorio de momento! ¡Ha probado ser incluso más peligroso para mi viaje que las Quebradas de los Túmulos!'","Habla con Milo Buenavista en la Puerta Oeste de Bree","Cebadilla Mantecona es el propietario del Poney Pisador, y Bingo te ha dado su monedero para asegurar que su hospitalidad sea bien recompensada.","'Bingo dijo que quería salir a tomar un poco el aire. ¡Supongo que lo encontrarás dormido en uno de los fardos de heno de los establos de fuera!'","Bingo ha hecho un nuevo amigo en la Puerta Oeste de Bree.","Bingo y Milo se sienten como en casa en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","Bingo lo está pasando de maravilla en la sala común del Poney Pisador.","'¡Este pueblo es mucho más grande de lo que esperaba!'","Súbete a la mesa y <rgb=#FF0000>baila</rgb>","'¡Ah, ahí estás! ¡Qué lugar tan estupendo, ! Toma algo de comdia y bebida, ¡y canta una canción o tres! ¡Hay de todo en abundancia, y todos deberíamos sumarnos al estrépito con nuestras melodías!\
\
'Milo me ha estado contando algo de la historia de este pueblo, ¡y dice que Bree fue fundada por hobbits antes incluso que la Comarca! No sé si será verdad, pero él lo cree a ciencia cierta. Es un buen tipo, pero creo que está equivocado en este tema. No sé de dónde vinieron los hobbits, pero hay muchos de nosotros en la Comarca comparado con Bree, así que pienso que nosotros somos los más antiguos.\
\
'¡Come, bebe y canta, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}! No es hora de discutir, ¡incluso si hay errores en la historia de Milo!'","Habla con Milo Buenavista en el Poney Pisador","Milo Buenavista está en la puerta oeste de Bree.\
\
Bingo ha hecho un nuevo amigo, un hobbit de Bree llamado Milo Buenavista, y deberías hablar con él.","'El señor Boffin y el señor Buenavista ya están en la sala común. No le han esperado para empezar a comer y beber, pero me dijeron que llegaría enseguida, ¡así que no le di mayor importancia!'","Habla con Bingo en la Puerta Oeste de Bree","'¿Has visto qué lugar, ${PLAYER}?'","Has llegado a la Puerta Oeste y Bingo ya ha hecho un nuevo amigo"},
[13244]={"The Haban'akkâ of Thráin will be victorious!","Raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Muru Azog","Defeat Ufúrzrak Orcs at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Ufúrzrak thrug-hai at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The Haban'akkâ has need of your aid, my friend.\
\
'I have received word that Azog's clan, the Ufúrzrak, still cling to their encampment in the shadow of Nud-mekhem. Neither Azog, nor his sons, nor any of his kin shall ever again find quarter at Khazad-dûm! In Thrór's name, I swear it!\
\
'Let the Ufúrzrak know the wrath of the Haban'akkâ! Death to Azog and all of his kin!'","Before Nud-mekhem, the old East-gate of Khazad-dûm, Azog's clan, the Ufúrzrak, dwell to defend their would-be realm from the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","Destroyed banners of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Ufúrzrak Undone","You have done much to hinder the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.\
\
You should raise a banner of the Haban'akkâ of Thráin at Muru Azog.","Orcs, thrug-hai, and banners of the Ufúrzrak clan can be found at Muru Azog.\
\
King Thráin has commanded you to join in the assault at Muru Azog. You should aid the Haban'akkâ of Thráin.","Defeated Ufúrzrak Orcs at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Ufúrzrak thrug-hai at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Destroy banners of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13245]={"'The time has come to confront Guard-captain Thurferth. Since I have taken it upon myself to provide protection to the city, his services and influence are no longer needed.\
\
'Elda and I have prepared a letter that lists the terms of his removal from his post. Please deliver this letter to him as soon as you can. If he does not leave quietly, then he must be removed by force... let us hope it does not come to that.'","The wealthy merchant Gifemund has determined that he feels Thurferth is a direct threat to his designs for the seat of Woodhurst. A confrontation is imminent.","Bring the letter to Herubrand","Herubrand is in the cellar of the farmhouse.\
\
Herubrand would probably like to see the letter Gifemund prepared for Thurferth.","'I assume this letter is a poor jest. That man has no leverage to threaten me and certainly cannot remove me from my post.\
\
'He claims that I drove the Rohirrim out of this city? I will admit, I do not favour them and prefer we no longer exile the Dunlendings in lower Woodhurst. I will face his challenge for the seat in Woodhurst, as I have just as much claim as he.'","Bring the letter to Guard-captain Thurferth","Guard-captain Thurferth is near the fountain around the centre of Woodhurst.\
\
You should bring the letter to Guard-captain Thurferth.","The Ultimatum to Guard-captain Thurferth","'This is bold and will likely result in a confrontation. It was a gamble for Gifemund to do this, and it seems that they are vying for my seat. Are they the champions Hildegard said would squabble?\
\
'I suspect this conflict will become bloody. They now fight for the seat of my father, but I am still too weak to claim it myself. I shall wait to decide who receives my support until I hear their perspectives.'"},
[13246]={"The briber in Lake-town has accidentally left a trail of coins behind him.\
\
You should follow the trail of coins to catch the briber.","Someone has been posting notices in Lake-town, making false claims such as those about Dagrun's bloodline.","Put a stop to the slanderous gossip in Lake-town.","Dispersed crowds (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The briber flees but tears his gold pouch in the process!","Utûkel can be found in Lake-town's underbelly.\
\
You should defeat the one behind the slanderous gossip in Lake-town.","Find the briber","The briber was taking orders from an Easterling!","A pile of rust, just like the one you found in Esgaroth-of-old!","'It is not enough to prove my true bloodline. Someone has been planting these rumours - I know, because I have found this.'\
\
She waves a piece of paper in front of you, with the claims of her kinship with Othur written out on it.\
\
'Please, I ask you to track down those who seek to wrongly discredit me and tear down as many of these awful notices as you can find!'","Follow the trail of coins","You notice something nearby the defeated Easterling","Disperse crowds (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","You should examine what you noticed lying near the defeated Easterling, Utûkel, in Lake-town's underbelly.","The coins mark a clear enough path!","Someone in Lake-town is bribing people to spread rumours. You should find the briber.","Removed slanderous notices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Confront the briber","You have defeated Utûkel and put a stop to the slanderous gossip in Lake-town. Seeing the same pile of rust in both Esgaroth-of-old and the underbelly of Lake-town has made you wonder if there is some connexion between the two groups of evil men operating in the Dale-lands. It would seem this Akshir, whoever he is, may be behind it all!","Examine the thing","Discrediting notices can be found around Lake-town.\
\
You should find and remove any slanderous notices that you come across.","The Underbelly of Deceit","Suspicious characters can be found around Lake-town.\
\
You should find suspicious characters in Lake-town who look to be putting up the slanderous notices.","Remove slanderous notices (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Defeat Utûkel"},
[13247]={"Bring the mushrooms to the rations chest","The Underground Harvest","Mushrooms can be found within the cisterns.\
\
You should collect mushrooms for Rathon.","Rathon can be found outside the cistern entrance on the Fourth Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should speak with Rathon.","Speak with Rathon","Collect mushrooms from the cisterns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected mushroom (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'I do not know if you have been to any of the Minas Tirith food stores as of late but just one look at them and you will see that they will not feed the city for a long war. Nearby farms are now burnt by the enemy or inaccessible. Now look at me, I sound like a doomsayer!\
\
'Never mind all that talk of gloom. Sometimes you can find hope in the most unlikely of places. There is particular, tasty, white mushroom that usually only grows in the caves of Mount Mindolluin. Now they grow in the cisterns! I suspect the cave-lizards may have helped spread the mushrooms from the caves high above us to the cisterns. Perhaps they have done us some good after all! This mushroom has been growing so well in the cisterns that I believe we can start harvesting it. Would you be kind enough while you're in the tunnels to pick some?'","Rathon has been tasked with maintaining many of the cisterns in Minas Tirith by himself but continues to work towards helping his fellow Gondorians where he can.","The Foodmongers' Fellow-hall on the First Circle of Minas Tirith.\
\
You should bring the mushrooms to a rations chest outside of the Foodmongers' Fellow-hall.","'What a harvest! Great work! I had already let the Foodmongers' Fellow-hall know about the mushrooms. They have set up a collection box in front of their guild hall. If you would kindly take the mushrooms there, the guild will then dry them and prepare them for the food stores.'"},
[13248]={"Bilbo Bolsón ha terminado su libro y desea asegurarse de que sus recuerdos sobre los lugares y sucesos importantes sean correctos.","Habla con Bilbo Bolsón","Bilbo Bolsón está en el Salón del Fuego en la Última Morada de Rivendel, al sur de la Ciudad de los Trasgos.\
\
Encontraste la cueva de Gollum en las profundidades de la Ciudad de los Trasgos y descubriste una choza improvisada en una isla en el lago. Una vez allí, escribiste lo que viste. Ahora debes regresar con Bilbo Bolsón.","La cueva de Gollum está en lo profundo de los túneles de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, más allá del salón central.\
\
Bilbo Bolsón te entregó materiales de escritura y te envió a encontrar la cueva de Gollum, con la instrucción de verificar los detalles que ha escrito en su libro sobre ese lugar.","El sendero inexplorado","Has completado la descripción que Bilbo te pidió","'Gollum y su cueva son muy importantes para mi libro, así que debo estar seguro de los detalles. ¿No podrías encontrar al viejo villano? No, supongo que eso sería imposible, claro está.\
\
'En fin, no sé cómo logré caer en una de las cavernas más profundas de la Ciudad de los Trasgos, pero si pudieras encontrarla y asegurarte de que mis recuerdos no me han fallado, te lo agradecería mucho. Había un gran lago en esa caverna, eso lo recuerdo con claridad.\
\
'Sé que Gandalf y Frodo no aprueban esta idea, pero darías una gran alegría a este viejo hobbit si pudieras hacer esto por mí.'","Has encontrado la cueva de Gollum","Escribe una descripción de la cueva de Gollumn con el material de escritura de Bilbo","'Bueno, esto demuestra que solo se puede confiar hasta cierto punto en la propia memoria. Había olvidado por completo la choza de Gollum... y menos mal que nunca la vi de cerca, así que no tenía razón para recordarla.\
\
'Parece que tendré que revisar mi libro. ¡Muchas gracias!'","'¿Has tenido oportunidad de verificar mis escritos? ¿Has logrado al menos encontrar la cueva de Gollum? Oh... qué lástima.'","'La cueva de Gollum estaba en algún lugar muy profundo, en las entrañas de las Montañas. Solo sé que estaba más abajo que el salón principal donde encontramos al Gran Trasgo y donde Gandalf nos salvó a todos de un destino terrible.\
\
'Me alegraría mucho que pudieras encontrarla otra vez y verificar los detalles que he escrito en mi libro.'"},
[13249]={"'You have done what I could not....\
\
'I could not bear to look upon that monstrous creature again, but thanks to you, my dear Beremud is avenged.'","Fara can be found in Hultvís.\
\
You have slain Drokstaz the Undying and should now return to Fara.","Haunted by a massive warg that slew her husband at Avabárg, Fara seeks to put an end to the demon-beast that lurks in the old keep of the North-men.","Bathed in shadow, an enormous warg rushes forth!","The Undying Beast","Find and defeat Drokstaz the Undying in Avabárg","Drokstaz the Undying can be found somewhere in the depths of Avabárg.\
\
Desperate to avenge her husband, Fara has begged you to defeat the terrible warg known as Drokstaz the Undying.","As the beast falls defeated, the sunken chambers of Avabárg seem to darken...","'Will you lend me your ear, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'I have suffered in silence since the ending of the War, but I cannot bear it any longer. My husband Beremud fell at Avabárg in the final days of the War. We had pushed our foes from the walls of Hultvís to the islet, and victory seemed certain... until Drokstaz came. Before either of us could loose an arrow at him, that terrible warg leapt forth and tore into Beremud's throat.  With his last strength, my husband slashed Drokstaz's flank and loosed his entrails. The beast withdrew into the catacombs of Avabárg to die... or so I thought.\
\
'But I have seen his eyes glowing in the night. They stare at me from across the waters of Anduin... from Avabárg. You must believe me! I promised Beremud that I would avenge him, but I cannot go back to that place... I cannot face that creature again, and Drokstaz knows my shame, and taunts me with it.\
\
'I beg you, ${PLAYER}. Slay Drokstaz and put out those terrible eyes!'","Talk to Fara"},
[13250]={"Search the corpse for additional information","Talk to Prince Ingór","You explain to Lóssi about the Angmarim you found at Khorroz.\
\
'I thank you for this information. If there is a secret path, I would not worry, ${PLAYER}. Between the vicious cave-beasts and my watch, they will not be able to ambush us here in Máttugard.'","Upon the Angmarim corpse you find a short missive:\
\
'Devoted servants of the Crown,\
\
A rift with Gorgar has become clear. The Azhorn under Orc control are lost to us. Go to Khorroz through the secret path and subdue more beasts for our purpose. Through our will, our new Azhorn will serve only the Iron Crown.\
\
You have your orders.'\
\
The missive is unsigned.\
\
It would seem the Angmarim sent here failed their objective. You decide to make sure the Angmarim are unable to learn of the whereabouts of these slain servants.","Dead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should burn the Angmarim corpses at Khorroz.","Voices of Men can be heard coming from the back of Khorroz!","The dead Angmarim can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should search the corpse for additional information as to the Angmarim's presence here.","Defeat Iron Crown Sentinels and destroy the evidence (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Iron Crown Sentinels and destroyed the evidence (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Angmarim have captured many cave-beasts with the purpose of training them to become deadly Azhorn.","The Angmarim supply of beasts to train into Azhorn had run low","Burned Angmarim corpses at Khorroz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The body of a recently mauled Angmarim can be found in the far depths of Khorroz. The Angmarim was indeed killed by one of the cave-beasts lurking in this passage. Why an Angmarim was here at all is a question that will need answering, however. Perhaps there is some additional information to be found on this corpse.","Prince Ingór can be found at Maergrind and Lóssi can be found at Imrêkh-guthlu.\
\
You should talk to Prince Ingór or Lóssi.","Voices can be heard at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should investigate the voices heard in Khorroz.","Investigate the voices heard in Khorroz","The Unfortunate Trainers","Iron Crown Sentinels can be found at Khorroz in Máttugard.\
\
You should defeat the Iron Crown Sentinels and destroy any evidence of your deeds.","You explain to Prince Ingór about the Angmarim you found at Khorroz.\
\
'I thank you for this information. If the war has indeed divided the Orcs and Angmarim further, our success in Gundabad may come sooner than we initially planned!'","More Angmarim!","Burn Angmarim corpses at Khorroz (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Lóssi"},
[13251]={"You hear approaching footsteps","The third door to test is to the north-east of Dâr Laja, the Meeting-hall, and is the entrance to a palatial manor within the Upper Ward.","Collect crocodile teeth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Yamin is at the Grand Market in the Upper Ward.","The lock remains true, and the door does not open","Bring the rocks and crocodile teeth to Kîflu at the Shoreward Stone","'You have come back, which is more than I might say of my last apprentice! He was frightened of the crocodiles outside the city, and when I told him to just move faster than they do, he left my service on the spot! How ungrateful! But that means the coin I would have given to him can instead be given to whoever fulfills his duties for me, and those have been piling up: coin and duties both!\
\
'One of the services I provide for every lock I fashion is a periodic test to ensure that the lock remains in good condition. This involves trying to open the locked door, and making certain that the lock holds. Will you perform these tests for me? The doors in question are to the north-east of the Grand Market. Test all three of the doors and report back to me with your findings.'","'One of the services I provide for every lock I fashion is a periodic test to ensure that the lock remains in good condition. This involves trying to open the locked door, and making certain that the lock holds. Will you perform these tests for me? The doors in question are to the north-east of the Grand Market. Test all three of the doors and report back to me with your findings.'","The second door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, within the walls of an enclosed estate in the Upper Ward.","'You have made the arrangements with my supplier at the Shoreward Stone? Good, good! It is nice to have a reliable apprentice once again! Are you interested in learning the trade of a locksmith? It is not very difficult, to tell you the truth. I mostly use the molds prepared for me by the Temámir.\
\
'But it is good to know you are not afraid of a few crocodiles! My last apprentice was so frightened of them he swore never to again leave the city, and as far as I know he never has! But here is your payment. Take it with my thanks!'","The lock remains steadfast, and the door stays shut","You hear approaching footsteps.","The lock rattles loosely, and feels close to breaking free of the door","'One of the services I provide for every lock I fashion is a periodic test to ensure that the lock remains in good condition. This involves trying to open the locked door, and making certain that the lock holds. Will you perform these tests for me? The doors in question are to the north-east of Dâr Laja. Test all three of the doors and report back to me with your findings.'","'One of the locks is nearly ready to give out? I will need to see that replaced, which means I need to send you with some resources to my supplier, a Temámir dwarf named Kîflu.\
\
'There are rocks with shiny flakes east of the city, at a place called Bâlakhat. Collect some of those rocks and bring them to my supplier outside the Shoreward Stone. We have a deal, he and I, so be sure to also gather some teeth from the crocodiles that lurk at Bâlakhat. He gives my requests a higher priority if they are accompanied by crocodile teeth. He is making a necklace of the things, I believe.\
\
'Aye, Bâlakhat is the area that my former apprentice refused to traverse. Why do you ask?'","Test the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, in the yard of an enclosed estate","Talk to Khôltekh at the Shoreward Stone","Khôltekh walks away, chuckling to himself","A familiar-looking dwarf of the Temámir rounds the corner","Rocks with shiny flakes and crocodiles with sharp teeth can be found near Bâlakhat, outside the city and along the south-eastern shore.","Khôltekh nods to you in greeting, summoning you to speak with him outside the Shoreward Stone.","Test the lock on the door to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master","Collected crocodile teeth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Kîflu can be found at the Shoreward Stone, waiting to accept delivery of the items you collected for Yamin.","Talk to Yamin by the Grand Market in the Upper Ward","'Bring the rocks and the crocodile teeth to my supplier, a Temámir dwarf named Kîflu outside the Shoreward Stone.'","Yamin has had work piling up ever since his last apprentice left, and he would like you to help him with some of it.","The Unlocking Trade","Test the lock on the door to the palatial manor north-east of Dâr Laja","The first door to test is to the north-east of the Grand Market, by the Stable-master in the Upper Ward.","Collect rocks with shiny flakes from Bâlakhat (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Khôltekh regards you silently.\
\
'It is very important to have a lock on your door, my friend. Does it not warm your heart to know you are safe and secure in your own bed, behind strong walls? It is the pride of the Temámir to aid our local locksmiths and key-makers by supplying the molds with which they fashion all such devices. It is the least we can do.'\
\
You ask Khôltekh if this means the Temámir know how to open all of the locks that are made in the city, and he smiles broadly.\
\
'I like you, friend. You amuse me.'","'There are rocks with shiny flakes east of the city, at a place called Bâlakhat. Collect some of those rocks and bring them to my supplier outside the Shoreward Stone. We have a deal, he and I, so be sure to also gather some teeth from the crocodiles that lurk at Bâlakhat. He gives my requests a higher priority if they are accompanied by crocodile teeth. He is making a necklace of the things, I believe.","Collected rocks with shiny flakes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Yamin in the Grand Market of the Upper Ward","The dwarf sizes you up in silence. When you present the items you have brought, his expression changes completely.\
\
'Our key-making friend has another request? Ah! I see you have some crocodile teeth! I will make certain he gets the supplies that he needs!\
\
'It is good that he continues to honour our deal.'"},
[13252]={"Encuentra el campamento de Reginard en la ciénaga","Examina las huellas","Los trasgos podrían haber capturado a Reginard y haberlo llevado a Lhúngobel.\
\
Intenta encontrarlo allí.","La mayoría de estas pisadas deben haber sido hechas por trasgos, pero un par podría pertenecer a un hobbit. No encuentras signos de resistencia.\
\
Quizá sería mejor continuar tu investigación en Lhúngobel al norte.","El hobbit se debate desesperadamente para liberarse de sus ataduras","'¡No pensaba que nadie vendría tan lejos al norte para rescatarme! Los trasgos me emboscaron y se llevaron mi mochila. No creí que fuera muy inteligente intentar pelear... así que aquí estoy.'","Los trasgos tienen a Reginard cautivo en Lhúngobel.\
\
Habla con él.","'¿Tienes tiempo para ayudarnos a buscar a hobbit desaparecido? Se llama Reginard; se aventuró fuera de Campotieso hace un día y no ha vuelto. Estoy algo inquieto; el pobre chico tiene fama de desafortunado. Había un tiempo en que la mala suerte no se ensañaba con Reginard pero... bueno, no me toca a mí hablar de ello.\
\
'Se dirigió hacia un campamento en la ciénaga al oeste. Estoy seguro de que se apaña con la fauna salvaje local, pero los trasgos son otra historia. Hay unos cuantos de ellos en las ruinas al noroeste. Espero que no se haya encontrado con ellos...'","Habla con Reginard","El hobbit Reginard ha desaparecido.\
\
Podrías encontrar pistas de su paradero en su campamento en la ciénaga al oeste de Campotieso.","Reginard no está por ninguna parte, pero ves huellas en el barro...","Has encontrado el campamento de Reginard, pero no a él.\
\
Examina las huellas en el campamento.","Un hobbit llamado Reginard se marchó de Campotieso y no ha vuelto. ¿Dónde ha ido?","El aventurero desafortunado","Encuentra a Reginard en Lhúngobel"},
[13254]={"The steed seems drawn to this rock formation. Why have you been guided here?","Adnoth, the stable-hand, has asked you to help him with an unruly horse that has recently come into his stable.","Your mount is pulling you onwards towards the rock cluster, further to the north","The unruly horse is waiting at the Elthengels stable in the Norcrofts.\
\
The stable-hand, Adnoth, has asked you to take the unruly horse for a ride, in the hopes that it might relax and slowly become more amenable to handling.","Return to Adnoth and talk to him about your discovery","The steed seems determined to head towards the cluster of trees north along the cliff wall","You uncover what can only be the steed's former owner. Upon this discovery, the steed seems at ease","Mount the unruly steed and ride until it calms down","Elthengels' stable-hand, Adnoth, is awaiting your return at the stables near the south-west entrance to Elthengels.\
\
The unruly steed led you to discover the body of its former owner. It has since become calmer, and the stablemaster must be informed of this development.","'The steed led you to a body? Aye, I imagine it was the horse's previous Rider. I will ask one of the guards to retrieve the poor fellow, so we can honour his remains.\
\
'This seems to have calmed the steed quite thoroughly. He was trying to let us know about his owner, and we mistook it for unruly behaviour. I will make certain such a loyal steed goes to a most worthy new rider.\
\
'Thank you for your help.'","The steed appears to be eagerly guiding you towards the nearby gate out of Elthengels","The Unruly Stallion","'Hail, there. Have you any skill with horses? I am a bit ashamed to admit this, but I am having trouble with one of the horses in my stable.\
\
'This particular steed raced riderless into town, no more than a day ago. Perhaps he was abandoned and was fleeing from the Orc-raiders? I have taken him into my stable and have orders to prepare all of these steeds for the Elthengels guards... but this new horse is simply too unruly.\
\
'Perhaps if you were to take a ride with him and see where he may take you, it could be just what he needs to relax and become more amenable to our handling.'"},
[13255]={"Talk to Vaskorn","Talk to Vaskorn in Limlók","The Untamed Wilds","Runerik Knotbeard can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should talk to Runerik Knotbeard.","Patrol the wilds west of the river","Patrol the wilds near the White Mare","The raiding party is still nowhere to be found","'What? A Warg made it through Misthallow? Skarding is either in trouble or he has been overwhelmed... and I am sure he is not in trouble.'","'Our victory was for Hunulf. Our success was for elder Threkmóth. Until now, I felt lost, thrust from my quiet life in the Thornholt, a sudden victim of death and conflict. But I am now newly-resolved: I shall remain in Limlók and help protect this village. If Limlók is not kept safe, how will my Skoghús ever be so?'","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds north of the White Mare.","'Speaking of Vaskorn, he has recovered fully from his injuries. I knew that he would. He is eager to patrol the wilds. I will tell you what I told him, for I fear an assault upon Limlók may be imminent. I need you to find any of these raiding-parties before they find the village!\
\
'Speak to Vaskorn before you set out, ${PLAYER}.'","All is clear","Vaskorn can be found in Limlók.\
\
You should talk to Vaskorn.","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds near the White Mare.","Vaskorn can be found in the north wilds of the Floodfells.\
\
You should talk to Vaskorn.","Patrol the wilds north of the White Mare","Talk to Runerik Knotbeard in Limlók","'Keep a hushed tone about you, ${PLAYER}. I hear the tread of Warg-paws: over the hill, within the valley of Misthallow. They come this way. Should we retreat and warn the village? If we run, we will lose sight of this band, and an unseen threat can be the more dangerous. No, we must stand our ground. I have fled too often of late. No more.'","Vaskorn has asked you to patrol the wilds north of Limlók.\
\
You should patrol the wilds west of the river.","'Yes, I am healed and ready to assist Runerik. Let us patrol the wilds of the Floodfells in search of any of these raiding parties. I will patrol the southern route and round the western hill towards the northern pass. You patrol the northern route past the horse rocks. We will meet up at the northern pass.'","Runerik Knotbeard fears an assault upon Limlók may be imminent.","Talk to Vaskorn at Limlók","There are no signs of a raiding party"},
[13256]={"The Untended Wood","'You ask if this is the work of the cold? Hom. I have seen many a winter, little one, and this is not the craft of merely a chill in the forest.'","Wood-trolls and Huorns can be found to the south, east, and west of Stonecliff.\
\
Tithenolf wants you to defeat corrupted Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood and examine their remains in hopes of understanding what has driven them to such aggression.","Examine remains of Baleful Wood-trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Examined remains of Baleful Wood-trolls (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tithenolf wants you to discover what is causing the Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood to become so aggressive.","'The forest... is not itself, friend. When Barallas and I awoke from our sleep, we did so in darkness. And... we awoke into violence. Hoom. Such happenings are troubling, and I fear that Finglas cannot wake to aid us, for he had been becoming more and more tree-ish, so to speak, before our sleeping.\
\
'The Wood-trolls harry us wherever our limbs carry us in this gloom and the Huorns... they are unruly without Finglas's tending. They may be beyond saving, though I do not wish to believe it so....\
\
'Hoom. The Wood-trolls must have been affected by Núrzum's passing. I can only wonder what wounds he inflicted upon them to make them far more hostile than they already had been to my kind.' \
\
Tithenolf heaves a heavy sigh.\
\
'Seek out the Wood-trolls, and for the good of this forest, please return them to the earth. However, I would ask that you examine their remains and perhaps then we can discover what has driven them to madness.'","Talk to Tithenolf","Tithenolf can be found in northern Balewood at Stonecliff near the path to the Limlight Gorge.\
\
You should return to Tithenolf with news of the unnatural chill surrounding the Wood-trolls and Huorns of the Balewood."},
[13257]={"'I do not like it, ${PLAYER}. Someone has been sneaking around the far shore of the lake under cover of night. It is not one of my people, and I do not think it is one of yours, either.\
\
'I am not as spry as I was when I was young. I cannot track this unwelcome guest, but perhaps you can. Go to the far shore of the lake and look for the footprints of this intruder. That may tell me something I can use.\
\
'Kill the avanc while you are there and bring me their jaws. I have an idea.'","Find a set of footprints on the western shore of the lake, north-west of the eyot","Collect avanc-jaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Collected avanc-jaws (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You find a set of deep footprints at the base of the rock","'That was fast. Did you really find any sign of the intruder I saw?'\
\
Wynfor listens as you describe the footprints you found on the far shore of the lake. He nods.\
\
'Those sound like women's feet, ${PLAYER}. Some woman is creeping around in the dark, and she does not want to be found. If she is not one of ours, and she is not one of yours, then she is an enemy.\
\
'Hand me those avanc-jaws.'","The footprints appear to have been made by someone not wearing shoes","'Someone has been creeping around on the far side of the lake under cover of night. I do not like it. Search for this intruder's footprints while you are out there. They may tell me something useful.\
\
'Slay avanc on the lakeside and bring me their jaws, too. I have a notion that I will be wanting them.'","The Unwelcome Guest","You find a set of shallow footprints in the mud","'You haven't brought me anything.'","There may be footprints on the far side of the lake, and there certainly are avanc.\
\
Wynfor wants you to look for footprints on the far side of the lake in Tâl Methedras. He also wants you to slay avanc and bring him their jaws.","Wynfor is at Tûr Morva, in Tâl Methedras.\
\
You have scouted the far shore of the lake for footprints and have also collected the jaws of the avanc that live there. You should bring them to Wynfor as he requested.","Bring avanc-jaws to Wynfor","Find a set of footprints beneath the rocky cliffs west of the western shore","Wynfor has seen someone sneaking around the far shore of the lake in Tâl Methedras and wants you to investigate."},
[13260]={"'Oh, hello! I haven't seen you in quite some time, ${PLAYER}. I'll have to tell Sarnir that you're back! What brings you to Sardol?'\
\
You inform Mellien that you have come on behalf of King Elessar to deliver a message to the people of Sardol. Mellien gathers the other inhabitants of Sardol, introduces you as an emissary of the King, and gestures for you to speak. You offer your sincere gratitude to the people of Sardol, and they appear to be heartened by your words. You apologize on behalf of King Elessar for the severe edicts during the War, including the brief suspension of their hunts by order of Malthellam, and for the failure to make safe the road through Tarlang's Crown. At the mention of Tarlang's Crown, a few hushed voices whisper to each other in the crowd. As you finish your remarks, the inhabitants of Sardol offer you their thanks.\
\
'I had no idea you'd become an emissary of King Elessar, my friend. What an honour! It is good to know that the King has not forgotten us, and that he was thoughtful enough to send someone who was a great help to us during the War. Like many others in the Vale, we lost some of our young men in the War, for they were among Lord Duinhir's company when he marched to Minas Tirith. Your words have soothed some of our hurts, but only time can heal what remains. But I would not lay such things at your feet or at those of the King—it is the enemies of Gondor who slew our bowmen, and the King has made certain that many of them have been repaid.\
\
'I must warn you, though. There are still some unsavoury folk lurking along the road through Tarlang's Crown, but it is not like it was... not like when that so-called Heir of Castamir, Azruthor, first set his encampment upon it. It is good to see you again, ${PLAYER}, and you are always welcome among us.'","'Hail! What business do you have in Tingobel? Has the Lord sent you to check on our progress?'\
\
You inform Drabnir that you have come on behalf of King Elessar to deliver a message to the people of Tingobel. Drabnir summons the other inhabitants of Tingobel over to you and gestures for you to speak. You offer your sincere gratitude to the people of Tingobel, and they appear somewhat heartened by your words. You make certain to mention that the hardships that Tingobel, in particular, endured during the War of the Ring have not been forgotten to Gondor and that King Elessar mourns those who were slain by the Orcs of the White Mountains. After you finish speaking, the crowd murmurs in assent and disperses.\
\
'I know, for my part, that many here will appreciate the King's words. You see, I lived in Tingobel before the War, and it was a great pain upon my heart to learn what became of it while I served with Lord Duinhir in the defence of Minas Tirith. I know firsthand what battles we fought and what sacrifices we made during the War, and I know well the role that King Elessar played in securing this newfound peace for Gondor. I was there, ${PLAYER}, but many of these folk were not. It is important that they know that Gondor remembers them and that the King works in their best interests.\
\
'I thank you for your visit on the King's behalf, ${PLAYER}. There is much work to be done still in Tingobel, but we shall see it to its end!'","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Sardol","Talk to Malthellam in Morlad","'Much has changed since last you visited the Vale, my friend. The War exacted a heavy toll upon us, and many of our bowmen did not return from their journey to Minas Tirith.\
\
'Morlad has borne the greatest loss in the Vale, with many of its sons being slain in the War, and in especial, the Lord's sons: Duilin and Derufin. They were beloved among the people of Morlad, and it is a great sorrow that neither of them will be heir to the Lordship of the Vale. Between the news that King Elessar would not come to the Vale and of the baseless rumours that Lord Duinhir slew an emissary of the Haradrim in Minas Tirith, the people of Morlad believe that the Blackroot Vale has come to be known as a place of disrepute—a place of low-born criminals not worthy of the King's attention. Such a thing cannot be true, of course!\
\
'After all, King Elessar was swift to pardon the Lord when the true culprit was identified, but alas, voices carried through Minas Tirith and out into Gondor. That is another matter, though.\
\
'If you have come on behalf of King Elessar, then let us continue your work. It is true that you are an emissary of King Elessar, but more importantly, you are held in high regard among many people in the Vale. Your presence could do much to ease their misgivings in the aftermath of the War, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'I would ask that you travel to the hamlets of Alagrant, Sardol, and Lancrath to deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to their people. Oh, and Tingobel. It has been rebuilt since last you were in the Vale, and its people would be pleased to see you again.\
\
'May you find good fortune in this errand, ${PLAYER}. Let us hope that peace is closer than it seems!'","After learning that King Elessar will not visit the Blackroot Vale, many of its people believe they have been cast aside and forgotten, left only to mourn those they lost in the War of the Ring.","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Alagrant","'Welcome back to Alagrant, ${PLAYER}. To what do I owe this visit?'\
\
You inform Calennen that you have come on behalf of King Elessar to deliver a message to the people of Alagrant. Calennen calls over the other inhabitants of Alagrant and steps back to allow you to speak. You offer your sincere gratitude to the people of Alagrant, and a few among them appear heartened by your words while others appear entirely uninterested. You apologize on behalf of King Elessar for the severe edicts during the War, including the brief suspension of their hunts by order of Malthellam, and a few people in the crowd grumble in affirmation. As your speech concludes, the remaining crowd disperses.\
\
'I appreciate your words, my friend, and I think many in the Vale would find them a comfort. However, whether the King visits us or not is not of terrible concern to many of us here in Alagrant. Although we are all thankful that that terrible War is ended, it is no secret that we were sheltered from the worst of its horrors. We are simple hunters, after all. If King Elessar wishes to offer his gratitude to us, though, I would not refuse it. Perhaps he can visit Alagrant himself when next he wishes to see the Blackroot Vale!'","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Tingobel","'At last you return, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'What had the folk of Alagrant, Tingobel, Sardol, and Lancrath to say of King Elessar's gratitude? I hope they were a more welcoming sort than you encountered here in Morlad!'\
\
You tell Malthellam that the inhabitants of the Blackroot Vale were largely accepting of King Elessar's gratitude, but that the people of Lancrath, in particular, have taken issue with the choices of King Elessar.\
\
'I see. I commend you for taking on such a task, my friend. It is a difficult thing to stand before people and speak on behalf of another, knowing that words alone will not satisfy them. Always there are questions you cannot answer, fears you wish you could comfort, and promises that you cannot make—knowing you may not fulfil them. As Steward of the Vale, I am no stranger to being put in such a position, but for one to speak with the voice of the King carries even greater expectations. I do not envy you!\
\
'It shall be some time before Lord Duinhir is able to return to his duties, ${PLAYER}. In the meantime, I shall try my best to serve in his stead.'","Deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of Lancrath","Alagrant can be found to the south of Morlad, Tingobel can be found to the east of Morlad, Sardol can be found far to the south-west of Morlad near Tarlang's Crown, and Lancrath can be found far to the south-east of Morlad near Tarlang's Neck, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Malthellam has asked you to deliver word of King Elessar's gratitude to the people of the Blackroot Vale. You should travel to the hamlets of Alagrant, Tingobel, Sardol, and Lancrath.","Malthellam can be found outside his home in Morlad, in the Blackroot Vale.","The Vale Left Behind","'Ah, ${PLAYER}. What an unexpected return! What business brings you to Lancrath?'\
\
You inform Osbenn that you have come on behalf of King Elessar to deliver a message to the people of Lancrath. Osbenn calls for the other inhabitants of Lancrath and they gather about you as you begin to speak. You offer your sincere gratitude to the people of Lancrath, and while some appear to be heartened by your words, a few others seem dismissive of your presence in the Blackroot Vale. You apologize on behalf of King Elessar for the hardships that Lancrath endured during the War, including accepting the refugees of Tingobel after it was sacked by the Orcs of the White Mountains. At the mention of Tingobel, a few in the crowd grumble in protest. After you finish your remarks, the crowd disperses.\
\
'I am afraid gratitude alone is little comfort to those who have lost their sons in the War. Not to mention, you have forgotten another matter entirely—that of the Sleepless Dead. When the King summoned them, they followed him past Lancrath. Do you have any idea how scared our children were? How heavy that dread laid upon the hearts of our elders? No? Short of banishing the last of the Dead, there is little else that troubles us here now that the War is ended. If that authority is King Elessar's alone, then I ask why he has not used it for the good of his people! Forgiveness or no, what further use could those Dead Men have to Gondor? They endanger us by their very presence, so I must believe that King Elessar deems our lives a worthy cost.'\
\
Osbenn pauses.\
\
'Forgive me, ${PLAYER}. I apologize for my harsh manner, but you must understand that not all is well simply because Gondor has won the War. As always, you are welcome in Lancrath, but King Elessar has much still to prove to us!'"},
[13261]={"'El Valle de Andrath es la puerta de Bree hacia el Sur. Si los bandidos no son detenidos, las Quebradas del Sur, las Tierras Brunas, Isengard y el Paso de Rohan quedarán cerrados para las Tierras de Bree. Está claro que Zarquino no es un simple líder de bandidos. Ha empleado semiorcos para llenar sus filas, un acto totalmente depravado. \
\
'Envié a mis hombres a vigilar las ruinas de Andrath y temo que ahora sean prisioneros o algo peor. Por favor, dirígete al sur más allá de El Cruce del Camino Verde, más allá de la sombra de los túmulos, y busca a mis exploradores, Robledales y Hojafrágil. Con suerte, habrán encontrado un lugar seguro cerca de las ruinas, probablemente en el lado oriental.\
\
'Ve rápido, porque temo lo peor, ¡y lleva precaución contigo! ¡Ese lugar probablemente sea peligroso!'","'¡Rápido! Dirígete a Andrath, al sur, por el Camino Verde. Me temo que he subestimado a los enemigos que hay allí cuando envié a mis hombres.'","El Valle de Andrath","'¿Grimbriar nos envía por fin refuerzos? Nos estábamos preguntando si no se había olvidado de nosotros.\
\
'Cuando llegamos, encontramos una fuerza mucho mayor de lo que habíamos previsto y supimos de inmediato que no podríamos abandonar el puesto. ¡Ya hemos visto a estos monstruos cometer varios crímenes abominables!\
\
'No debemos perder el valor y debemos mantener nuestro puesto.'","El campamento de los bandidos se encuentra en el extremo sur del Valle de Andrath, al sur del Camino Verde, muy lejos de El Cruce del Camino Verde. Los hombres de Grimbriar, los vigilantes Hojafrágil y Robledales, estarán escondidos en algún lugar cercano.\
\
El jefe de vigilancia Grimbriar ha sabido que los hombres de Zarquino y sus aliados semiorcos han bloqueado el Valle de Andrath. Te ha pedido que viajes hacia el sur para apoyar a sus hombres.","Los hombres de Zarquino y sus aliados semiorcos del sur han bloqueado el Valle de Andrath, impidiendo el comercio con las naciones del sur.","Encuentra a los exploradores de Grimbriar"},
[13264]={"'Hay muchas criaturas extrañas en este pantano. Abundan las criaturas viles en este lugar, quizás el aire tóxico fomente su crecimiento, pero incluso la más vil de las alimañas tiene su utilidad. \
\
Las alas de mosca de pantano son ligeras, flexibles y resistentes, y se pueden usar para muchas tareas de artesanía. Los merodeadores de pantano son criaturas de una naturaleza verdaderamente extraña, pero a pesar de su apariencia extraña, sus patas hacen una comida sabrosa cuando se asan.\
\
Caza estas bestias verminosas, y te pagaré bien por estos trofeos. Puedes encontrar estas criaturas dispersas por esta parte del pantano.'","Malenhad, el vil pantano de azufre de Angmar, está lleno de criaturas viles y repugnantes, pero incluso las más extrañas de estas criaturas tiene sus usos para los Montaraces de Angmar.","Recoge patas de merodeador de pantano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recogidas alas de mosca de pantano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los merodeadores de pantano y las moscas de pantano se pueden encontrar por todo el pantano cerca del campamento de los cazadores.\
\
Othran te ha pedido que recolectes patas de merodeador de pantano y alas de mosca de pantano, que su gente utiliza para su beneficio.","El valor de la alimaña","'¿No has encontrado suficiente de la alimaña?'","Recogidas patas de merodeador de pantano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bien, bien. En Malenhad, debemos hacer uso de cualquier bestia que encontremos.'","Lleva los trofeos a Othran","Recoge alas de mosca de pantano (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13265]={"The Value of an Estuarine Crocodile","'Though it does not spring to mind when you think of food, there is some value in the flesh of the crocodile. The meat is tough, gamey, and requires some preparation, but there are delicacies that are enjoyed by many throughout the region.\
\
'There are no prime cuts that come from the crocodile, but the meat can be dried, or prepped and turned into trail rations and some other tasty treats that are crafted by guild masters in the city.'","'You spoke with Tevurin, eh? Then you want to know about the salties and the value of their hide? Valuable. Very valuable. The hide is thick and scaly, but pliable enough to mould and shape as you need. True masters of the craft make fine leathers, cops, bracers, belts, and helms from the hide of the beasts.\
\
'Further, the thin layer of fat that one can peel from the sinewy muscles and hide can be boiled down into an oil that helps to maintain the pliability of the hide during processing.'","Speak with the engraver Dorshet","Tevurin asked that you visit the three expert assistants to learn about the crocodiles and other creatures that make the beaches of the Cape of Umbar their home. When you have learned what the experts know, you are to return to Tevurin so that he can provide you further direction.","'Take note of what you were told. The wilds of Umbar can be very dangerous.'","Speak with the outfitter Karbah","'Bones from creatures we once hunted among the waves are carved by some jewellers, but it is a hobby that the seaborne warriors practice that brings value to something other than the bones of the saltwater crocodiles; their teeth.\
\
'Crocodile teeth are larger than most and make carving easier. When sealed properly they make fine thong fasteners as well as ornamentation for outfits or jewellery.'","Speak with the cook Zerkho","'Greetings. It appears that the overseer of this effort has found another set of hands to help us meet the quotas we are asked to meet. If this is true, then I would have you see my three assistants to learn about the fauna, specifically the crocodiles, that dwell along the shore here in the eastern stretch of Umbar.\
\
'Once you have absorbed the knowledge that my associates possess, return to me so that I can set you about the many tasks that we have.'","You spoke with the visiting specialists from Umbar Baharbêl. Return to Tevurin and tell her that you are prepared for her requests.","You visited Tevurin, the shore hunter, and were instructed to speak with his assistants to learn more about the fauna that make the shoreline of the eastern Umbar Cape their home."},
[13266]={"Do not allow the totems to finish spewing their vileness (${VALUE}/2)","Destroy White-hand Totems or Defilers carrying totems (${VALUE}/18)","The enemy has brought totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. They must be stopped before they are able to cause destruction to all upon the wall.","A powerful White Hand defiler, Dagrí, has ordered his followers to place vile totems atop the wall. These totems are meant to bring destruction and cause widespread damage to the defenders still standing on the wall. \
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- White-hand Totem planted on the wall\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Moderate Merit Loss:</rgb>\
- White-hand Totem spews its foul energy","White-hand totem destroyed (${VALUE}/18)","The Vanguard Defilers","You have allowed the wall to be overwhelmed with totem spew"},
[13267]={"Dagrí is fleeing from the battle","Defeat Orc Totem-callers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Do not allow Dagrí enough time to escape from the wall","The Orc defiler Dagrí has brought his totems of destruction to Helm's Deep. He must be stopped before he is able to cause destruction to all upon the wall and defeated before he can flee from the battlefield.","Defeat the Orc Defiler, Dagrí","A powerful White Hand defiler, Dagrí, has lead his followers onto the centre wall section at Helm's Deep. Dagrí means to use his totems of destruction and his defiler allies to cause widespread damage to the defenders still standing on the wall. If enough time passes, Dagrí will attempt to flee from the chaos upon the wall.\
\
Merit Rating\
\
This quest starts with <rgb=#FFFF00>Full</rgb> Merit Rating.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Major Merit Loss:</rgb>\
* Elemental Totem Explodes","The Vanguard Defilers"},
[13269]={"'¡Necesito desesperadamente tu ayuda! ¡Mira... mira lo que encontré clavado en mi puerta esta mañana!\
\
'¡Mira esto! Es una flecha muy extraña. La punta es sin duda de fabricación hobbit, aunque muy, muy antigua. Sin embargo, el asta se parece a las hechas por la Gente Grande. ¿Por qué alguien haría esto? ¿Qué significa?\
\
'Parece que la flecha vino de algún lugar directamente al norte de aquí, cerca de la puerta del seto que lleva a los Campos del Puente. Estoy demasiado asustado para ir allí -- quién sabe qué acecha allí -- pero ¿podrías ir tú y ver qué encuentras?'","Wilimar Bolger se encuentra cerca de su agujero en el lado noroeste de Bolgovado.\
\
En la zona que Wilimar Bolger te pidió buscar, encontraste un campamento abandonado y un diario. Quizás este diario contenga información útil para Wilimar. Deberías llevárselo.","'¿Así que encontraste este diario cerca de la puerta del seto, verdad? Bueno, ¡espero que contenga algunas pistas sobre quién disparó esa flecha a mi puerta y si pretende hacerme daño!'","'¿Tienes ese diario que encontraste? ¡Quizás tenga la información que necesito para averiguar qué está pasando con esta flecha!'","Cuando Wilimar Bolger se despertó esta mañana, encontró una flecha amenazante clavada en la puerta de su casa. La punta de la flecha era de fabricación hobbit, aunque muy antigua, mientras que el asta parecía hecha por Hombres.","'Creo que la flecha fue disparada desde algún lugar al norte de aquí, no lejos de mi casa. ¡Debo saber quién disparó esta flecha y por qué!'","Lleva el diario a Wilimar Bolger","Diario recogido","Recoge el diario","La amenaza velada","La flecha vino de la zona cerca de la puerta del seto que lleva a los Campos del Puente, al norte de la casa de Wilimar Bolger.\
\
Wilimar Bolger te ha pedido que busques en el lugar de donde cree que vino la flecha, con la esperanza de encontrar alguna señal de la persona que la disparó y lo que podría significar.","Busca al norte de la casa de Wilimar Bolger","Ves un diario en el suelo"},
[13270]={"Derrota ladrones Montebruno (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a Vance Waithman","'¡Esos villanos Montebruno no robarán mi hierba para pipa otra vez, gracias a ti!'","Ladrones Montebruno derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mi cultivo de hierba para pipa no irá a ninguna parte si tengo algo que decir al respecto.'","Habla con Himloc Grouse en Entibo","Vance Waithman derrotado","Himloc Grouse está seguro de que los bandidos Montebruno que han estado robando su cultivo de hierba para pipa no se rendirán simplemente porque recuperaste parte de él.","La Vigilia","'¡Debes detenerlos! Mi campo está al este de Entibo, en la colina sobre la casa de Eldo Swatmidge.'","Himloc Grouse está en la plaza del pueblo de Entibo.\
\
Himloc estará complacido de saber que has impedido que los Montebruno roben más de su hierba para pipa.","El campo de hierba para pipa de Himloc Grouse está en la colina sobre la casa de Eldo Swatmidge, al este de Entibo.\
\
Himloc está seguro de que los bandidos Montebruno seguirán robando su cultivo de hierba para pipa a menos que puedas derrotarlos mientras lo intentan. Himloc cree que puedes encargarte de estos ladrones en soledad y te aconsejó que los busques en su campo, pero ten cuidado con el líder.","'¿Has detenido a esos Montebruno, ${PLAYER}? ¡Me alegra escucharlo!\
\
'Creo que los bandidos recibirán el mensaje de mantenerse alejados de mi hierba para pipa a partir de ahora, gracias a ti. Aquí, toma estas monedas.'","'Si no hacemos algo, los bandidos Montebruno seguirán robando mi hierba para pipa, ${PLAYER}. Se escabullen en mi campo bajo la cobertura de la oscuridad y toman tantas plantas como pueden cargar, pero si puedes atraparlos en el acto, ¡quizás puedas infundirles algo de miedo!\
\
'Mi campo de hierba para pipa está en la colina sobre la casa de Eldo Swatmidge, al este de Entibo, justo cerca del borde occidental de los Pantanos de Moscagua. Deberías poder encargarte de ellos en soledad.\
\
'Los ladrones intentan robarme día y noche, así que tendrás que vigilarlos. Y si ves a su líder, ocúpate de él también.'"},
[13271]={"El Comité de Vigilancia","Bamfurlargo, la granja de Maggot, está al sur por el camino del río, en la Marjala.\
\
Mat Harfoot te ha pedido que busques a Violeta Sotomonte y te ha sugerido que hables primero con el viejo granjero Maggot.","Mat Harfoot te dijo que uno de los miembros de su \\qComité de Vigilancia\\q, Violeta Sotomonte, ha desaparecido.","'¿Violeta Sotomonte? Sí, de hecho, le dije a esa joven lo que te voy a decir a ti, y lo que le habría dicho a los Fronteros hace días, si tuviera algo de sentido.\
\
'Algunos rufianes han entrado en la Comarca no muy lejos al oeste de aquí. Bandidos, más que probablemente. Mi hijo Hammy aquí también puede contarte más sobre ellos. A ambos nos gustaría verlos fuera de la Comarca.'\
\
'Le dije a esa joven que su campamento no era un lugar para que ella estuviera metiendo la nariz, pero supongo por lo que dices que no escuchó. Debería haberle contado a alguien sobre ellos, pero pensé que ella tenía más sentido hobbit.'","'Los Fronteros no han podido mantener la paz tan bien como solían, sin ánimo de ofender, así que hemos organizado nuestro propio grupito. Lo llamamos, bueno, el Comité de Vigilancia.\
\
'Algunos de nosotros hemos estado investigando cosas extrañas, como ese Jinete Negro que se ha visto por aquí y otros Forasteros que han venido a la Comarca últimamente. La cuestión es que uno de nuestros miembros ha desaparecido. Violeta Sotomonte iba a investigar algunos informes de extraños en el sur de la Marjala, pero no ha vuelto, y me estoy preocupando. Me pregunto si puedes ir allí y buscarla?\
\
'Puede ser que el granjero Maggot la haya visto. Él sabe lo que pasa por allí. Su granja, Bamfurlargo, está al sur por el camino del río, en la Marjala.'","'Por favor, habla con el granjero Maggot sobre nuestra desaparecida Violet. Su granja, Bamfurlargo, está al sur por el río. Si alguien sabe dónde está, él lo sabrá.'"},
[13272]={"Los Gusanos pueden encontrarse en la Sala Decimosexta, al noreste del Refugio Sombrío.\
\
Ymar parece verse afectado de forma diferente a todos los demás que vigilan el Refugio Sombrío. Está atormentado por visiones de gusanos y desea que los mates mientras te encuentres en la Sala Decimosexta.","Gusanos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¡Por mi barba! Me alegra que estés aquí. Cometí el error de verlos, ¡y ahora no consigo sacarlos de mi cabeza! Están ahí cuando cierro los ojos, infestando mis pesadillas, ¡y todo lo que veo lo confundo con uno de ellos! ¡Cómo me pica y se me eriza la piel! Crecen en los propios vientres de sus víctimas y brotan para atormentar mi cordura.\
\
'No puedo regresar a la Sala Decimosexta, pues no deseo volver a ver a esos gusanos; ¡una sola vez fue suficiente para causar un daño duradero! Llámame cobarde si quieres, pero no me acercaré a ese lugar mientras los gusanos sigan allí.\
\
'Si Mallas te ha enviado aquí para cumplir mis órdenes, acabarás con los reptantes hasta el último que se arrastre. ¡Cuánto los odio! Solo verlos hace que me flaqueen las piernas…'","La Sala Decimosexta es una zona infestada de orcos, muchos de los cuales padecen una terrible enfermedad que provoca crecimientos similares a hongos en sus cuerpos.\
\
Mallas, un elfo aliado de los enanos, cree que hay algo oculto bajo la Sala Decimosexta y desea descubrir el verdadero propósito y el origen de la plaga.","Derrota a los gusanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ymar se encuentra en el Refugio Sombrío, al suroeste de la Sala Decimosexta.\
\
Has matado a muchos, muchísimos gusanos viles y deberías informar a Ymar de que la amenaza pesadillesca ha pasado.","'Se han ido, todos… bien. Te creo, pero aún los veo. Me pregunto si esta pesadilla llegará a terminar algún día.\
\
'¿Por qué soy el único que tiene estos sueños y visiones? No me gusta nada. Aun así, me has hecho un gran servicio y le hablaré a Mallas de tu valía.'","Regresa con Ymar en el Refugio Sombrío","Los infectados viles","'La Sala Decimosexta se encuentra al noreste del Refugio Sombrío. ¡No te demores!'"},
[13274]={"Throw water on the fire at the north-east edge of town","Another fire burns at the north-east corner of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut at the north-east edge of the village.","Lhan Tarren burns! The servants of the White Hand did not take kindly to the Elder's refusal, and their vengeance has been frightfully swift and cruel.","As Lhan Tarren burns, the river still flows with quelling water astride the village. The flames are beginning to spread....\
\
You should search the banks of the river for a way to carry water to the fires, starting with the nearest fire at the tree by the bridge.","Use the bucket to douse the fire at the Elder's hut","'Thank you for dousing the flames, ${PLAYER}. You have a cooler head than I when all is in upheaval. I must conquer myself; I must find a way to lead my folk!'","Guto can be found in Lhan Tarren, mourning the loss of his grandfather the Elder.\
\
You should return to Guto in Lhan Tarren.","Return to Guto","Another fire burns in the middle of Lhan Tarren. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut in the middle of the village.","Throw water on the fire at the hut in the middle of town","Use the bucket to throw water on the flaming tree","'What have I done? ${PLAYER}... what have I done? The village burns! My people are dead.\
\
'Please help me. I am the chief of the Stag Clan now... my grandfather is dead, and I must set this right. I cannot do this alone. \
\
'Help me, ${PLAYER}! The fires!'","You have dampened the flames","Another fire burns at the Elder's hut. The bucket can be found by the river that runs near the town.\
\
You should throw water on the fire at the flaming hut where the Elder once stood.","The Village Burns"},
[13275]={"'Debemos enfrentarnos a los Orcos.'","El Vino de la Guerra","Bruicheron espera que su querido amigo Belvagor deje la lucha contra los Orcos a otros y en su lugar comparta una visita relajante con ella.","Bruicheron está en Telain Glorelloth, en Caras Galadhon.\
\
Belvagor ha decidido que su deber requiere que permanezca de guardia contra los Orcos por el momento, y lamentablemente no puede unirse a Bruicheron para un día de descanso. Debes regresar con las noticias a Bruicheron.","El vinatero Glasnír está fuera de los Viñedos de Lórien, al sureste de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Bruicheron te ha pedido que recuperes un vino especial del vinatero y se lo lleves a su amado Belvagor, con la solicitud de que se una a ella para un día de descanso.","'¡Has recuperado el vino especial! Llévaselo ahora a mi amado Belvagor, que actualmente guarda las puertas de Caras Galadhon, y dile que me gustaría compartirlo con él en un día de descanso, para que pueda olvidar sus problemas.'","Lleva el vino especial a Bruicheron","'Regresa a Telain Glorelloth, ${PLAYER}, y dile a mi amada Bruicheron que aún no puedo unirme a ella para un día de paz.'","Belvagor está custodiando las puertas de Caras Galadhon.\
\
Glasnír te ha dado el vino especial solicitado por Bruicheron, y ahora deberías entregárselo a Belvagor.","'Me duele saber que Belvagor no puede disfrutar de un día libre de las preocupaciones del deber.'","'¿No tienes nada para mí?'","'Entiendo, ${PLAYER}. Belvagor tiene su deber, y no sería mi amado si no lo tratara con seriedad. Pero ¡ay de cualquier Orco que amenace siquiera un solo cabello de él!\
\
'Guardaré esta botella, sin abrir, hasta el día en que Belvagor pueda tomar la paz que merece. Dejará de lado el vino de la guerra, y volveremos a disfrutar del confort que hemos ganado.'","'¿Qué es esto que me has traído, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
'Este vino tiene un significado especial para mí y Bruicheron, ${PLAYER}, y me encantaría compartirlo con ella entre las hojas doradas de un gran mallorn. Pero mi deber está aquí, y es por ella que debo mantener mi vigilancia. No podemos permitir que los Orcos amenacen la hermosa Lórien o a cualquiera de sus habitantes, especialmente a ella que es la más querida para mí.\
\
'Lleva este vino a ella ahora y dile que me uniré a ella tan pronto como pueda. Pero debo asegurarme de que los Orcos no estén lo suficientemente cerca para lanzar un asalto.'","'¿Has sido enviado por Bruicheron para el vino especial que ella pidió? Lo recuperaré para ti.\
\
'Recuerdo cuando se guardó este vino; fue hace muchos años, y me complació ver que todavía nos quedaban algunas botellas, porque Bruicheron notó que se guardó el mismo día que conoció a Belvagor. Ella pidió que apartara algunas de esas botellas, diciendo que tenían un significado especial para ella: tenían exactamente la misma edad que su amor por Belvagor.\
\
'¿Te pidió que se lo llevaras a él? Probablemente lo encontrarás custodiando las puertas de Caras Galadhon.'","'Un día, Belvagor podrá disfrutar de la paz que tanto merece.'","Habla con Glasnír en los Viñedos de Lórien","'Es bueno verte aquí, ${CLASS} ${PLAYER}. Los aventureros no suelen tener permiso para entrar en los límites de Lothlórien, pero tu presencia aquí me indica que el Señor y la Dama realmente tienen la intención de defendernos de los Orcos a cualquier costo.\
\
'¿Has conocido a mi amado? A menudo está de guardia en la entrada de Caras Galadhon con mi hermano Rilhathel; su nombre es Belvagor. Ahora que estás aquí, quizás Belvagor pueda tomarse un descanso de su puesto y compartir una botella de vino conmigo en paz. Le hará bien tener un respiro de las preocupaciones de enfrentarse a los Orcos.\
\
'Viaja a los Viñedos de Lórien, al sureste de Caras Galadhon, en Egladil, y habla con el vinatero Glasnír. Él te dará la botella de vino que he solicitado... un vino especial que tiene un gran significado para Belvagor y para mí. Lleva la botella a Belvagor y dile que le pido que comparta un día de descanso conmigo.'","Lleva el vino a Belvagor en la entrada de Caras Galadhon","'El vinatero Glasnír está justo fuera de los Viñedos de Lórien, al sureste de Caras Galadhon. Recupera el vino especial que le he solicitado y llévaselo a mi amado Belvagor, que actualmente guarda la entrada de Caras Galadhon. Me gustaría compartirlo con él en un día de descanso, para que pueda olvidar sus problemas.'","'Lucharé contra los Orcos hasta que Lothlórien sea segura para mi amada Bruicheron.'","'¿Bruicheron quería que llevaras este vino especial a Belvagor, no es así? Búscalo en las puertas de Caras Galadhon, al noroeste.'","'Un día, descansaré de mi deber, pero ese día aún no ha llegado.'"},
[13276]={"The Visage of Mam Murgwid","'I have seen the totems the Ungoledain carve in the likeness of \\qMam Murgwid\\q; the face they give to the voice in their minds. I worry these are no mere statues, but perhaps a vessel for their foul magic. We should tear down those we come across in Cadar Skûs.'","Destroyed spider totems (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have destroyed many spider totems in Cadar Skûs.\
\
You should talk to Legolas.","Destroy spider totems (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Legolas has asked you to destroy the Ungoladan totems in Cadar Skûs.","Habla con Legolas.","'Thank you for humouring me, ${PLAYER}. Even if the totems are not conduits for magic, you have still removed their gruesome images from the world, a favourable outcome.'","Legolas has asked you to destroy spider totems in Cadar Skûs, for fear they may be conduits for foul magic."},
[13277]={"Idhremmin ha escuchado una voz extraña proveniente de los Campos de Fornost, y has decidido investigar.","'¡Tra-lili-la, tra-la! ¡Oh! Hace mucho que no tengo a alguien para cantar y bailar conmigo. ¡Ven, canta! Tra-lili, tra-la....'","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías consultar con Idhremmin sobre lo que escuchaste.","Medita para escuchar cualquier sonido extraño","Idhremmin se encuentra en el Campamento de Mincham, en el borde de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías regresar con Idhremmin al Campamento de Mincham.","Idhremmin mira más allá de ti, sus ojos recorren los campos lúgubres","La canción provenía del noroeste del Campamento de Mincham, en los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías buscar la fuente de la extraña canción.","Regresa con Idhremmin","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías esperar y escuchar señales de lo que ha captado la atención de Idhremmin durante tanto tiempo.","Dile a Idhremmin que escuchaste la voz escalofriante en el aire","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías <rgb=#FF0000>meditar</rgb> y escuchar señales de lo que ha captado la atención de Idhremmin durante tanto tiempo.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTA: Esta misión requiere gestos. Escribe el comando '/meditate' y presiona enter.</rgb>","Le dices a Idhremmin que has escuchado la extraña voz, y te mira bruscamente. Sus palabras salen vacilantes, como si la Lengua Común le resultara extraña.\
\
'Escuchas la canción retorcida. Un gran mal yace más allá de la luz de este fuego. ¿Buscas la muerte? Si no, quédate y escucha desde lejos.'","'Lo hiciste bien. No muchos habrían sobrevivido a tal encuentro, y menos aún habrían ahuyentado al espíritu maligno sin dañar a la chica.'","De repente percibes, apenas, una canción lejana, fantasmal e inquietante","'¿Preguntas por Idhremmin? Él observa y escucha todo el día. Yo mismo no tengo buen oído, y mucho menos los sentidos agudos de los Elfos. No sé a qué presta atención.\
\
Habla muy poco, pero de algo estoy seguro: lo que atrae su atención, lo teme. No se aventurará en los Campos de Fornost para buscarlo.'","Pregunta a Idhremmin qué escucha en los Campos de Fornost","Has ahuyentado al espíritu maligno Olnathron de Idalene","<rgb=#FF0000>Medita</rgb> para escuchar cualquier sonido extraño","Le preguntas a Idhremmin qué escucha, pero no responde. Su expresión es levemente molesta, como si lo hubieras interrumpido en algo importante.","La Voz en el Aire","Idhremmin rompe su silencio para advertirte que no busques la voz","Idhremmin está en el Campamento de Mincham en las Quebradas del Norte, en el extremo suroeste de los Campos de Fornost.\
\
Deberías preguntarle a Idhremmin qué escucha.","Encuentra la fuente de la canción inquietante"},
[13280]={"Tu misión es interceptar una caravana de carretas llenas de suministros y armas, derrotar a los soldados que la protegen y entregar la caravana a las fuerzas de Mizâdi.","Asegura la primera carreta","Soldados de Ekhamâti derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dôlo de Ekhamâti derrotado","Tercera carreta asegurada","El dôlo de Ekhamâti ha llegado para defender la caravana. Encuéntralo y dérrotalo.","Asegura la cuarta carreta","Derrota al dôlo de Ekhamâti","Asegura la tercera carreta","Cuarta carreta asegurada","Las carretas de la guerra","'Veo que has asegurado la caravana. Debemos regresar a Iridír antes de que lleguen los refuerzos.'","Primera carreta asegurada","Asegura la segunda carreta","Derrota a los soldados de Ekhamâti (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","El dôlo de Ekhamâti ha llegado para defender la caravana.","Segunda carreta asegurada"},
[13281]={"'Mae govannen. Me llamo Grethron. Las noticias que traes me llenan de esperanza y de desesperación, pues conozco a la mujer de la que hablas. Yo la he estado buscando.'","¡El rostro de la elfa se ilumina cuando cuentas tu historia!","'Me alegra saber que el niño está ileso, pero no sé cómo ayudar con la elfa que llora. Parece que se asustó cuando intentaste hablar con ella.\
\
'A lo mejor si conoce a alguien puede parecerle menos peligroso. He oído que hay un grupo de elfos al otro lado del río desde Caranost. ¿Por qué no hablas con ellos y averiguas qué saben de la elfa? Debo volver a Herne con Cai antes de que las elhudan vuelvan a inquietarse.'","¡El niño perdido, Cai, ha vuelto sano y salvo, pero la elfa que llora ha huido! Hay que encontrarla antes de que ponga a más niños en peligro.","Habla con alguien que pueda conocer a la mujer elfa","Gurthern te ha sugerido que hables con los elfos acampados en Sírlond, al otro lado del río desde Caranost.\
\
Deberías buscar Sírlond en el centro de Cardolan.","La mujer que llora"},
[13282]={"Defeat Wainrider bowmen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Wainrider soldiers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Wainriders of Dol Acharn","The Wainriders of Dol Acharn were not easily bested, but through your efforts, the Host of the West shall remain unknown to them.","Defeat Wainrider charioteers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat Wainrider horsemen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Wainrider charioteers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated many of the Wainriders at Dol Acharn.","Defeated Wainrider bowmen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated Wainrider horsemen (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","After suffering a crushing defeat in days long past, the Wainriders have returned to Dagorlad in force, and so too has their hatred for the Men of Gondor.","Defeated Wainrider soldiers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","In the wake of turmoil within Mordor and the march of the Host of the West, the Wainriders that fell upon the battle plain have risen to stand against the Men of Gondor once again.\
\
They have not yet moved against the Host of the West, and to ensure that this remains so, you should confront them at Dol Acharn and draw their attention away from the Host.","The Wainriders can be found at Dol Achcarn in eastern Dagorlad.\
\
You have arrived at Dol Acharn and should now defeat the Wainriders to keep them from discovering the Host of the West."},
[13283]={"Maukatish can be found at Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Maukatish.","Wait for a slot to open in the pit-fighting tournament","Complete A Small Task","Maukatish can be found in Thorzhaf.\
\
You should either complete a task for Maukatish or wait your turn to get your name added to the pit-fighting tournament.","The Waiting List","'Have such great plans! With you helping, this poor snaga will soon rise to power as best scrap monger, yes. We must prepare then. Párgrub needs to check supplies to see what this scrap monger can bet with, err, on you.'","'Gar, you still here?! I tell you once and I tell you again, go away!'\
\
In the best Orc impression you can muster, you tell a tall tale of the many Men you have slain during the Siege of the White City under the command of Gothmog! Many know you as the Master Mangler.\
\
'Gar, haven't heard about you yet, but a good story is a good story, I say. Tell you what. I'll put your name on the bottom of the waiting list here. Now you can either wait until your name comes up or you can do something for me. Then your name just might move up to the top. What'll it be, Mangler?'","'Gar, well how about that. Looks like you'll be in the next tournament, Master Mangler. Better get preparing. I bet you'll need it! Har, har!'","Talk to Párgrub","Párgrub can be found near Thorzhaf.\
\
You should speak with Párgrub.","An Uruk in charge of the list of fighters for the pit-fighting tournament has a system of rules and is hard to sway.","Talk to Maukatish","Perhaps you will be able to add your name to the tournament list now"},
[13284]={"Other than the Dead, it appears that nothing has disturbed the hill recently","Clearly not made by the circling Dead nearby, the footprints denote heavy boots of foreign make","'The Hill of Erech has been the site of many queer dealings as of late, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'While I swear I saw the Dead rush from the vale, I was apparently mistaken. Many of their number lurk about the hill even now, but strangest of all, I noticed a dark figure creeping up the hill toward the Stone last night. Could it be the same person you sought near Sardol?\
\
'For my part, I searched the hill the following morning, but I found no evidence of their passing. I worry that I missed something, ${PLAYER}, and would ask that you search the hill as well.'","The Stone of Erech stands untouched, but you notice curious footprints near its base","The path to the Stone of Erech lies upon the west path out of the southern end of Lancrath.\
\
Gúrion has asked you to search the Hill of Erech for any sign of the dark figure he spotted.","Examine the strange footprints near the base of the Stone","DNT -- will not be seen","Search the Stone of Erech for sign of the dark figure","The Walking Shadow","The Stone of Erech can be found atop the Hill of Erech in central Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have spotted something unusual near the base of the Stone of Erech and should examine it more closely.","'These boot-prints you spoke of, you say the make is unknown to you?\
\
'I wish we had learned more from this, ${PLAYER}. Allow me a moment to think... at least we are certain the invader has visited the hill.'","Gúrion can be found in Lancrath in south-eastern Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have searched the hill, and found strange footprints in the shadow of the Stone of Erech. You should return to Gúrion with this news.","Your searches in Sardol and Lancrath align as Gúrion believes he is also pursuing the mysterious invader from Tarlang's Crown.","Search the Hill of Erech for sign of the dark figure","Talk to Gúrion","The Stone of Erech can be found atop the Hill of Erech in central Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have searched the path from Lancrath to the hill and found no evidence of the dark figure's passing. You should now search near the Stone of Erech."},
[13285]={"The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should speak with Authest, the caretaker at Eilendoth.","Defeated spider at Eilendoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Authest","The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
Defeat spiders at Eilendoth.","The beacon's caretaker cowers from spiders that have infested the beacon","Climb the hill to the beacon of Eilendoth","Defeat spiders at Eilendoth (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Waning Beacon","The beacon of Eilendoth is located south-west of Ethring in Ringló Vale.\
\
You should climb the hill to the beacon.","'When my son Dervorin answered the call in my stead, I promised to keep the beacon of Eilendoth burning bright in his absence. The beacon's light signifies my son's safe return. I fear the darkness that swept over the land is choking the beacon's flame. The air we breathe is growing stale. If the flame falls, surely we are next.\
\
'The beacon has been slowly waning. I see it dim with each passing day. Will you tend to the beacon? I will be grateful if you are able to restore its light to the former brilliance I remember. I assure you, Ethring could use the light in this hour.'","Borhador asks for you to tend to the beacon of Eilendoth.","'I thought my time had come! I have not seen such creatures of that size before!'"},
[13286]={"The Want-kin","Talk to Nagli Want-kin at Khadâsh-gâra","'It has been a delight having you among us. I only regret that you could not stay for longer!'","Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli Want-kin and his companions would like to see you off from Khadâsh-gâra. You should talk to Nagli Want-kin.","Nagli Want-kin can be found at Khadâsh-gâra.\
\
Nagli Want-kin and most of his companions kindly bid you farewell at an unexpected party of sorts. You should talk to Nagli Want-kin.","'You will stay? Good!\
\
'It is a tradition among us Want-kin, albeit a new one, to celebrate those that join our little company and those that depart it. In this case, you will have done both. Now, it may not be as lavish as the celebrations you are accustomed to... but we know a bit about good food, good company, and the comfort of a warm fire!\
\
'Let us make a few preparations and then the celebration shall begin!'","'Come along, ${PLAYER}. There will be time enough for adventures tomorrow!'","Talk to Nagli Want-kin","Neither Longbeards, Zhélruka, nor Stout-axes, a company of clanless dwarves known only as the Want-kin have made camp in Elderslade."},
[13287]={"Habla con Durin","¡La expedición de guerra te necesita!","Debes presentarte en Annâk-khurfu, en el Valle Ancestral. Los maestros de establos reclutadores de miniaventuras están a tu disposición para llevarte allí a toda prisa.\
\
Puedes encontrar maestros de establos reclutadores de miniaventuras en la Puerta de Thorin, Gondamon, la ciudad de Bree, la Sala Vigesimoprimera, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, el Campamento de Glóin, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor y Minas Tirith (solsticio de verano).","Preséntate ante el príncipe Durin en la sala de guerra, en el nivel superior de Annâk-khurfu.","(Opcional) Preséntate ante un reclutador de la expedición de guerra","Entra en Annâk-khurfu, en el Valle Ancestral","Preséntate ante el comandante Glóin en la sala de guerra, en el nivel superior de Annâk-khurfu.","'Te doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYER}. Me alegra contar con la ayuda de aventureros valientes como tú. Hay mucho que hacer antes de la batalla que se avecina.\
\
'Nos enfrentamos a un enorme ejército de orcos, troles, huargos, trasgos y quién sabe qué otras inmundas criaturas acechan en esa fortaleza de la montaña. Su líder es Gorgar el Despiadado, hijo de Bolg y nieto de Azog. Todos los enanos conocen esos nombres, pues nos enfrentamos a esos viles comandantes en la última gran Guerra de los Enanos y los Orcos.\
\
'Tengo a un ejército de Barbiluengos, Zhélruka e incluso unos cuantos Hachas Recias respaldándome, pero me temo que nuestros enemigos nos superan en número con creces. Debemos ser astutos y hacer lo que podamos para debilitar a nuestros enemigos antes de enfrentarnos a ellos en el campo de batalla. Preséntate ante uno de mis comandantes a cargo de esta expedición de guerra, el héroe barbiluengo Glóin. Él dirigirá tus esfuerzos allí donde más se necesiten.'","Habla con uno de los guardias en Annâk-khurfu para que te indique el camino.","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. ¿Has venido a prestar tu ayuda a la expedición de guerra? ¡Bien, no hay tiempo que perder!'","Has llegado a Annâk-khurfu","Habla con Glóin","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYER}! ¿Has venido a responder a la llamada a la guerra? ¡Las cabras de los maestros de establos reclutadores de miniaventuras pueden llevarte hasta el príncipe Durin en Annâk-khurfu a toda prisa!'","Habla con uno de los guardias en Annâk-khurfu","¡El príncipe Durin de los Barbiluengos ha declarado su intención de reconquistar Gundabad para los enanos! Necesita a héroes como tú para que ayuden en la expedición de guerra si hay alguna esperanza de vencer al ejército orco.\
\
Si deseas ayudarle, deberías presentarte ante uno de los reclutadores de la expedición de guerra en los asentamientos enanos repartidos por toda la Tierra Media. Te llevarán a Annâk-khurfu, el centro de mando del príncipe Durin en el Valle Ancestral. Puedes encontrar reclutadores de la expedición de guerra en la Puerta de Thorin, Gondamon, la ciudad de Bree, la Sala Vigesimoprimera, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, el Campamento de Glóin, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, el Mirador de la Gran Excavación, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor y Minas Tirith (solsticio de verano).","'¡Te doy la bienvenida, ${PLAYERNAME:aventurero[m]|aventurera[f]}! ¡La llamada a la guerra de nuestro príncipe debe de haberte llegado! Querrá hablar contigo de inmediato. ¡Sube a la sala de guerra a toda prisa!'","El príncipe Durin de los Barbiluengos ha declarado su intención de reconquistar Gundabad para los enanos. ¡Necesita a héroes como tú para ganar esta guerra!"},
[13288]={"'We must secure a foothold outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.\
\
'Hlóthi has asked that you accomplish several tasks to aid in this effort. If you are able to complete several tasks for him this week, we will be able to reward your accomplishments.'","Speak to Stálskeg Ironbeard to be given a small token of his esteem for your assistance.","The War Effort: A Great Leap (Weekly)","Stálskeg Ironbeard has requested your aid in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves. He has enlisted Hlóthi to gather several ongoing tasks that need to be completed throughout the area.","Talk to Stálskeg Ironbeard","Your assistance has truly assisted the Gabil'akkâ in its attempt to rescue our fallen homeland.","Stálskeg Ironbeard has requested your aid in securing a foothold outside of Gundabad for the Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves.","Talked to Stálskeg Ironbeard","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Additional Steps' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Additional Steps' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13289]={"The War Effort: Missions for the Cause (Weekly)","Speak to Elóf","'We have need of your assistance in completing a series of missions for the on-going war effort.\
\
'The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has been making headway towards Gundabad, but their troops are spread too thin to accomplish all that is needed to be done.\
\
'Seek out and complete several of these missions to assist our efforts.'","Seek out and push forward the war effort by completing 'The War Effort: Missions for the Cause' several times.","Seek out and speak to Elóf regarding your completion of several missions.","'We wish to thank you for your hard work towards the war effort. Your good deeds shall help secure our foothold into Gundabad itself!'","The Gabil'akkâ, the Unified Army of Dwarves, has requested your assistance in completing a series of missions on their behalf.","Complete 'March on Gundabad: Missions for the Cause' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completed 'March on Gundabad: Missions for the Cause' (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13291]={"Habla con Hórin","Habla con Durin","Your contribution to the war effort has turned the tide in favour of the dwarves!","'${PLAYER}, as reward for your efforts, I grant you the rank of Azghzabad, and name you Hero of Durin's Folk. You will have a place in my vanguard as we lead the attack on Gorgar's forces and reclaim Gundabad!\
\
'I must sincerely thank you for your part in this campaign. The war has not yet been won, but because of your actions, we no longer face insurmountable odds. Battle is soon upon us, and I plan to lead this grand army of dwarves to victory!\
\
'You are a great hero, ${PLAYER}, and must receive a hero's reward. Hail, ${PLAYER}, Hero of Durin's Folk!'","'I am not one for all this pomp and high praise, but I must admit, it has been a pleasure working with you, ${PLAYER}. May we fight side by side in the battle to come, and together see Gorgar dead at last!'","'${PLAYER}, your efforts have done what we could only hope: you turned the tide of the war in our favour! We have confirmed that Gorgar's forces have all pulled back to defend Gundabad. The time for the final battle is soon upon us. The others wish to speak with you, and Prince Durin has said he plans to reward you for all your hard work. The Longbeards owe you a great debt, friend!'","The dwarves wish to thank you for your hard work!\
\
You should talk to Ausma and Hórin in Annâk-khurfu.","Habla con Ausma","The War Nearly Won","Prince Durin wishes to reward you for your hard work.\
\
You should talk to Durin in Annâk-khurfu.","'${PLAYER}!'\
\
The dwarf grabs your hand and gives it a hearty shake.\
\
'We have done it! Gorgar's forces are on their last legs, and a great battle is upon us! I swell with pride just imagining it. Let us fight side by side when the time comes, and slay many Orcs together. We will reclaim Gundabad! For the Zhélruka!'"},
[13292]={"Two wine shop owners suspect each other of dishonest business practices.","Read the manifest at The Full Belly in the Upper Ward","Akhmâra plans to confront her brother, Mutâz, at his shop.\
\
Go to The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl to witness the confrontation.","'What do you think you are doing? I asked you to investigate The Drowned Prince, not my own shop! Now tell me, what tricks is my dolt of a brother employing?'\
\
Now that you think of it, she and Mutâz do share a resemblance.\
\
'Yes, we are twins! What of it? Our parents left us these shops after their passing. He and I could not agree on how to run them so we each took one shop for ourselves, and I swear I will not rest until I prove to him that my ways are better!'\
\
You share that both the twins are ordering the same goods from the same suppliers in almost the same quantities.\
\
'What? That is absurd. His wine tastes like swill, and I sell only the finest vintages! That is IT! I am going down there myself and getting to the bottom of this!'","Mutâz said that Akhmâra is the one guilty of underhanded business practices and has asked you to investigate her.\
\
Search for clues around Akhmâra's shop, The Full Belly, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Mutâz at the Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven","Akhmâra asked you to investigate her business rival.\
\
His shop, The Drowned Prince, can be found in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","The War of the Wine Shops has reached a peaceful conclusion... for today, at least","Akhmâra storms off to confront her brother Mutâz","Read the manifest at The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven","In familiar, chunky handwriting, you read the following:\
\
1 cask Mereham Rose 3014\
2 cask Bergraw White 3012\
1 casks Winbury Red 3013\
2 cask Iáphel Red 3014\
\
All goods paid for\
- Captain Nishak","'He is cheating! I know he is cheating! I don't know how he is cheating but I will figure it out. Or maybe you will.\
\
'I am Akhmâra, owner of the finest wine shop in town, and my rival Mutâz is a liar and a cheat and a good-for-nothing! Please, kind stranger, help me uncover the nature of his misdeeds and I will repay you.'","'How is business? It is wonderful! Wine is equally welcome at celebrations and commiserations, and there is no shortage of either in the city. It... could be better, though. My rival, Zâkh Okhon, the Full Belly, is stealing some of my customers away. Its owner is a liar and a cheat and a good-for-nothing! I know she is hiding something.\
\
'I heard a rumour that she waters down her wine. I implore you on behalf of all honest businesspeople and wine-lovers everywhere... find out what she's doing, and how she's doing it!'","In hasty, chunky handwriting, you read the following:\
\
1 cask Mereham Rose 3014\
1 cask Bergraw White 3012\
2 casks Winbury Red 3013\
1 cask Iáphel Red 3014\
\
All goods paid for\
- Captain Nishak","Talk to Akhmâra at The Full Belly in the Upper Ward","The War of the Wine Shops","'You know, if we place one large order with Nishak, we could negotiate for a better price than if we ordered separately...' Mutâz says. 'I wonder what other costs we could trim if we worked together?' Akhmâra asks. Finally the two notice you have arrived.\
\
'Oh, your job is done. My brother and I have business to discuss. Come see me if you need to buy wine!'\
\
'No, come see me!' Mutâz interjects.\
\
Akhmâra wheels on him. 'What? No. Come to me. I met you first and my wine tastes better because it is not kept as hot as the roof-tops at noon.'\
\
'I do not keep my wine too hot!' Mutâz protests.\
\
You have your reward. Perhaps you should escape this argument before you get drawn into it any further.","There is nothing suspicious in The Drowned Prince's latest shipping manifest. Perhaps a conversation with its proprietor would yield some clues.\
\
The proprietor, Mutâz, can be found outside his shop in the Sail-haven of Umbar Baharbêl.","The Full Belly's import manifest looks shockingly similar to its rival's.\
\
Akhmâra can be found outside her wine shop, the Full Belly, in the Upper Ward of Umbar Baharbêl.","Talk to Akhmâra at The Drowned Prince in the Sail-haven"},
[13293]={"Scout Ost Crithlanc","Scout Dol Nendír","Dol Nendir lies to the south-west of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the ruins of Dol Nendír.","Scouted Dol Nendír","Kar Lak lies in the hills well to the east of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Earth-kin village of Kar Lak.","Ost Crithlanc lies to the north-east of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the Angmarim-outpost of Ost Crithlanc.","Scouted Kar Lak","The Ward of Esteldín","Scouted Ost Galumar","Scouted Ost Crithlanc","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. I fear that with all that has been happening in recent months we have been remiss in our own defence... just recently a small group of Orc-scouts were slain by our Rangers on the very doorstep of Esteldín. I need not tell you that it is only the secrecy of Esteldín that protects it from the full brunt of Angmar's assault. We cannot take any further risks!\
\
'I need you to patrol the lands immediately surrounding Esteldín and report back to me with any movements the Enemy makes.\
\
'I would stay clear of the large Orc-camp at Dol Dínen if I were you -- we have already lost too many scouts there, and I cannot afford to lose any more.'","Scout Ost Galumar","'So, we continue to be surrounded by enemies -- though the enemies that most concern me are those who lie to the east of us, as the Orcs continue to stream down out of the Ram Dúath.\
\
'In time, they will find us -- I only hope we are ready by then.'","Scout Kar Lak","Talk to Handarod","Handarod is concerned with the threatened safety of Esteldín.","Ost Galumar lies to the north-west of Esteldín, in the North Downs.\
\
Handarod has asked you to scout the ruins of Ost Galumar.","Handarod is at Esteldín in the North Downs.\
\
You should report to Handarod and tell him what you have seen during your patrol around Esteldín."},
[13294]={"Shanthar has asked you to return to Agalûnu and tell her to leave Arwáth.","Shanthar of the Kintai is the ever-vigilant protector of Arwáth. It is his sworn duty to protect the trees of the grove.","Talk to Agalûnu","You bow to the stranger and introduce yourself as an Elf-friend.\
\
'It does not interest me that you are a friend of the Eldar. Will you prove a friend of the Kintai? We are not the Elves that you know. Shanthar is my name. Whether you have my friendship will depend greatly on why you have come here. Tell me.'\
\
You tell him of Agalûnu, whom you found injured by an arrow, and ask Shanthar if he was the one who shot her.\
\
'It was. I dislike taking such actions, but this woman is resilient. Most Men do not come here at all. Those who do usually leave once they meet one of the Väiri, one of my departed elders. This woman is unafraid. I tried many times to cause her enough distress that she would leave the wood, but none of my efforts had borne fruit. I could not stand by idle while she felled trees of Arwáth. So yes, I loosed an arrow upon her. But know this Elf-friend, had I wanted to slay her, slain she would be. I only want her to leave.\
\
'I am the warden of this grove, and it is my sworn duty to my elders that the trees of Arwáth be protected from harm. I will ask you to please return to this Agalûnu and ask her to leave me and the trees of Arwáth in peace.'","'I ask you to please return to Agalûnu and tell her to leave me and the trees of Arwáth in peace.'","The Warden of the Grove","'Hashtal-gûr. Have you any news?'\
\
You tell Agalûnu about Shanthar and his duty to safe-guard the trees of Arwáth.\
\
'Kintai? I had thought those Elves to be only a legend, and long gone had they ever existed at all. This is absurd ${PLAYER}. Are you a woodworker? Have you ever tried to make furniture or chests with the wood of palms? The attempt brings nothing but misery, and the stuff dulls the sharpest of blades almost instantly. It is important to source quality hardwood. The trees of this grove are beautiful and perfect!\
\
'Not to mention, if this supposed Kinta only wanted me to depart, why did he not just talk to me and say so? Why the games, and then shooting me with an arrow of all things!'"},
[13295]={"'¿Te ha enviado Arohir? Bien. Necesitamos desesperadamente guerreros de confianza que nos ayuden contra la creciente amenaza de saqueadores y maleantes que han surgido en los últimos meses aquí. Somos pocos, y la situación amenaza con sobrepasarnos.'","Los Guardianes de Annúminas","Arohir de Esteldín te ha pedido que busques el campamento de Tinnudir, en la orilla oriental del Lago Evendim, y que allí hables con Cannuion.","'Habla con Cannuion en Tinnudír, a orillas del Lago Evendim, ${PLAYER}.'","Cannuion está en el campamento de los Montaraces en Tinnudir, en Evendim, al oeste de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Arohir te ha enviado a hablar con Cannuion en Evendim.","'¿Has oído hablar de los Guardianes de Annúminas? Son una rama de nuestra orden que vigila las antiguas tumbas y ruinas que marcan la antaño abandonada capital de Arnor.\
\
'Me ha llegado la noticia de que están en serios aprietos, pues bandidos y refugiados de las Quebradas del Norte han empezado a saquear las viejas tumbas en número creciente, y hay rumores aún más oscuros sobre la presencia de agentes angmarim que buscan entrar en la antigua ciudad.\
\
'Viaja al campamento de Tinnudir y encontrarás a Cannuion, quien agradecerá profundamente cualquier ayuda que puedas brindarle.'"},
[13296]={"Rhovandis te pidió atraer y derrotar al Maestro de Huargos.","'Durante mucho tiempo, Tham Celechir estuvo dominando el Bruinen, y ahora los Uruk-hai lo llaman hogar. Es hora de que recuperemos ese lugar y eliminemos la amenaza creciente de los huargos.\
\
'Al noreste de Tham Celechir, aguarda un maestro de bestias. Sus órdenes eran sembrar caos y oscuridad sobre la tierra, soltando huargos para que corrieran libres. Una vez eliminemos esta amenaza, podremos centrarnos en los Uruk-hai de Tham Celechir y recuperarlo. Pero no podemos perder más gente inocente.\
\
'Ve y reduce el número de huargos, y derrota al Maestro de Huargos de una vez por todas.'","Usa el Estandarte de la Mano Blanca para desafiar al Maestro de Huargos.","El campamento está ubicado al noreste de Tham Celechir.\
\
Derrotar a los huargos invasores podría atraer al Maestro de Huargos fuera de su escondite.","Derrota huargos invasores (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has derrotado a Kalugat, el maestro huargo.\
\
Debes regresar con Rhovandis en Idhobel y contarle tu éxito.","'Debemos detener al Maestro de Huargos de traer más Huargos a Eregion.'","Habla con Rhovandis","¡El Maestro de Huargos responde a tu desafío!","Huargos invasores derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'¿Has derrotado al Maestro de Huargos, ${PLAYER}? Esta es una noticia muy bienvenida. Por ahora, estas tierras están más seguras. Pero nuestro trabajo aún no ha terminado. Nuestros esfuerzos para arrebatar Tham Celechir a los Uruk-hai deben redoblarse. No permitiré que el sacrificio de los inocentes haya sido en vano. Cuando llegue el momento, espero poder contar contigo nuevamente, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Por ahora, agradezco tu ayuda y te estoy en deuda.'","El Huargo y el Maestro","Captura el Estandarte de la Mano Blanca para desafiar al Maestro de Huargos y hacer que salga de su escondite.\
\
El estandarte se encuentra en el campamento del Maestro de Huargos, ubicado al noreste de Tham Celechir."},
[13297]={"'¡Lobos en la Comarca! ¡Han estado ocurriendo tantas cosas extrañas últimamente!'","Laugfût se encuentra entre la manada de lobos en las ruinas al este de Bolgovado, más allá de la granja de Milo y Linda Bolger.\
\
Linda Bolger te envió a mostrar el collar a los Elfos en Casa del Bosque. Orthir reveló la identidad del lobo misterioso -- Laugfût, un Huargo de Angmar -- y te pidió que lo enfrentes y derrotes al jefe Huargo.","'Incluso aparte de sus amos en Angmar, este Huargo, Laugfût, es demasiado peligroso para permanecer sin obstáculos en estas tierras. Sin duda se ha impuesto como líder de la manada local de lobos, lo que significa que se ha convertido en una amenaza aún mayor.\
\
Deberías reunir aliados y buscarlo entre su manada. Pon fin a esta amenaza lo antes posible. Cuando la tarea esté hecha, deberías hablar con la hobbit, Linda Bolger.\
\
Laugfût será un enemigo peligroso, pero no se le puede permitir permanecer tan cerca de tantos hobbits pacíficos. Ya ha traído gran temor a estas tierras, y esto es solo el comienzo del daño que puede causar.'","'¿Vas a derrotar al líder de esos terribles lobos? ¡Buena suerte, ${PLAYER} -- no será demasiado pronto!'","'Encontrarás a Laugfût en el corazón de su manada, al este del pueblo de Bolgovado. Ya sea que siga bajo el yugo de Angmar o no, es demasiado peligroso para permanecer en la Comarca.'","'Angmar tiene muchos exploradores, pero no todos son Huargos.'","'Me pregunto si la gente hablará de los Lobos de Bolgovado de la misma manera que hablan del Invierno Terrible?'","'Has hecho muy bien, mi ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, pues el Huargo ya no existe. Si sus amos vienen a buscarlo, no debe preocuparnos hoy. Concéntrate por ahora en el bien que has traído a este lugar.'","'¿Mataste a ese gran lobo de aspecto malvado? ¡Eso es maravilloso! Espero que aceptes este pequeño símbolo de mi gratitud -- no es mucho, pero estoy segura de que has salvado Bolgovado y la Comarca de un destino terrible.'","El Huargo de Bolgovado","'¿Ese Elfo lo llamó Huargo, dices? Eso suena terriblemente desagradable. Será mejor que tengas cuidado -- está en esas ruinas, y no estará contento de verte.'","'¡Excelente trabajo, ${PLAYER}! Has dado un verdadero golpe a esos lobos malvados, ¡y no lo olvidarán pronto! Vuelve rápido a Bolgovado y dile a mi Linda las buenas noticias. ¡Estará encantada!'","'Los lobos necesitarán un líder fuerte si quieren representar una amenaza para nosotros.'","Linda Bolger está en Bolgovado, en el camino más abajo de la colina.\
\
Orthir te dijo que hablaras con Linda Bolger después de haber derrotado a Laugfût. Linda estará complacida de saber que la amenaza del Huargo ha sido eliminada.","'Los hobbits que habitan en estas tierras son afortunados de contar con la ayuda de buena gente.'","'La Comarca no es lugar para lobos. ¡Que se vayan a otro sitio!'","Orthir, el Elfo acampado sobre Casa del Bosque, reveló que el gran lobo era, en realidad, uno de los grandes y malvados Huargos de Angmar."},
[13298]={"Los huargos criados por trasgos ahora infestan Hîgropor, en lo profundo de Nan Wathren. Debes eliminar a los malvados huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Destruye barriles de comida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has derrotado a los huargos de Hîgropor, y te has asegurado de que no regresen al quemar sus fuentes de alimento.","Barriles de comida destruidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Los huargos criados por trasgos ahora infestan Hîgropor, en lo profundo de Nan Wathren. Debes eliminar a los malvados huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.","Se pueden encontrar huargos en Hîgropor, en el sureste de Nan Wathren.\
\
Debes derrotar a los huargos y destruir sus barriles de comida.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Comunidad.</rgb>","Los fosos de huargos de Hîgropor","Huargos derrotados en Hîgropor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota huargos en Hîgropor (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota huargos en Hîgropor"},
[13300]={"Ayuda a Thithrand a reducir el número de jinetes de huargos en la Gran Escalera","Ayuda a Thithrand a derrotar al líder de los jinetes de huargos","La Gran Escalera se alzaba antaño al pie de un gran cruce de caminos dentro de Moria. En la época de esplendor de la gran ciudad, conducía a todas las zonas de las salas y era una maravilla majestuosa de contemplar. Ahora ha pasado a estar bajo el control de Igash, un lugarteniente de Mazog, el líder de los orcos de Moria. Igash ha reunido en un solo lugar a las fuerzas de orcos y trolls de Moria y ha recaudado tributos de cada uno para entregarlos algún día al líder de los orcos. Por ahora, cada tribu compite por ganarse el favor del lugarteniente, un seguidor fanático de Mazog.","'La derrota de estos enemigos supondrá una gran ventaja para nosotros. Los jinetes de huargos ya no confiarán tanto en la protección ofrecida por el llamado rey de los orcos de Moria.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos son muy apreciados, ${PLAYER}.'","'Los jinetes de huargos atraviesan los pasos montañosos y las escarpas de las Montañas Nubladas. No es de extrañar que se hayan aliado con los orcos de Moria, pero esta es una alianza que no puede permitirse que continúe.\
\
'Tengo dos tareas para ti relacionadas con los jinetes de huargos de Moria. ¿Me escucharás?'","Habla con Thithrand en la Guardia Orca","'Hablaré bien de ti cuando hayas hecho todo lo que te pido, ${PLAYER}. Debemos detener la guerra de los orcos antes de que comience.'","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca, al suroeste de la Gran Escalera.\
\
Debes regresar con Thithrand y decirle que todas sus tareas relacionadas con los jinetes de huargos han sido completadas.","Los jinetes de huargos","Thithrand se encuentra en la Guardia Orca.\
\
Thithrand es responsable de vigilar y contener la amenaza que representan los jinetes de huargos en la Gran Escalera. Deberías ayudarlo completando las tareas que te encomiende."},
[13301]={"Derrota huargos en Nan Wathren (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los huargos de Hîgropor","Has derrotado a un buen número de huargos de Nan Wathren.","Completado","Los huargos de Hîgropor se encuentran en Nan Wathren, al sur de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Debes eliminar tantas de estas bestias corruptas como puedas, pues son malvadas.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>","Varios huargos, criados en Hîgropor, acechan ahora en los cañones de Nan Wathren.","Varios huargos, criados en Hîgropor, acechan ahora en los cañones de Nan Wathren.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Se recomienda una Pequeña Comunidad.</rgb>","Huargo derrotado (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13302]={"'Excellent work, ${PLAYER}. I could see your fighting skills from here! You are a true ally of the Beornings.'","Hertha, Keeper of the Pass, has asked you to clear out a pack of wargs that plague the road into the Beorning-lands.","Defeat Sháraha","Hertha can be found along the road to the High Pass in the Wolf-denes.\
\
You should talk to Hertha.","Defeat wargs at the clearing (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Warg Clearing can be found north-west of Vegbár.\
\
You should defeat the wargs and their leader.","Defeated wargs (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Hertha","Defeated Sháraha","The Wargs of the Wolf-denes","'I have a favour to ask of you, ${CLASS}. The Wargs of the Wolf-denes have long been a thorn in the side of the people in the Vales. They are a great enemy of my kin. I have watched most of the warg host move south, but a small pack of them remains to reinforce their allies, the goblins in the Misty Mountains.\
\
'I cannot leave my post to deal with them myself, but they are a plague upon travellers. Please, will you go and clear them out?'"},
[13303]={"Defeated Durkâr","Defeat Urcheron","The Warriors of Dol Guldur","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}. We have much to discuss. Our forces have encountered three champions of Dol Guldur: a sorcerer named Urcheron, the morroval-queen Carchrien, and the Gorthorog war-leader Durkâr. Dread follows in their wake...they must be dealt with, lest our hearts quail and our strength wavers.\
\
'Deep within the fortress of Dol Guldur is a sword-hall, which our scouts believe to be the training-grounds for the warriors of Dol Guldur. If this is so, Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr will surely be near at hand.\
\
'Enter Sâd-en-Dagor and slay these three champions.'","Defeat Carchrien","Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr in Sâd-en-Dagor in Dol Guldur, north-east of Helethir.\
\
Torist has asked you to slay Urcheron, Carchrien, and Durkâr, three champions of Dol Guldur.","Defeated Carchrien","'You have done it! Fine work, ${PLAYER}! These warriors posed a great threat to us, but no more.'","Sâd-en-Dagor, the training-grounds of Dol Guldur, are overseen by three champions of the Lieutenant of Dol Guldur.","Talk to Torist at Helethir","'Your prowess in battle is unmatched, ${PLAYER}.'","Defeated Urcheron","Defeat Durkâr","Torist is at Helethir, south-west from Dol Guldur.\
\
You should return to Torist for your reward.","'These are mighty warriors you will be facing...do not underestimate their strength!'"},
[13305]={"Talk to Arodor","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should look at the Morgul Vale from Faramir's Look-out.","Speak with Mírthel","You see the glow of Mordor rising over the mountains, casting a dim light on the Morgul Vale","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should speak with Gladhir at Faramir's Look-out.","'I was not sure I would see you again, but Gladhir speaks highly of you. He and I came to the cross-roads following a Haradrim chieftain. We lost him after he entered Osgiliath. Now my gaze has turned to the Morgul Vale, and the lands beyond. Look at the red skies of Mordor. The unearthly glow frightens me.'","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should talk to Arodor at Faramir's Look-out about what you saw.","You see the rubble and ruins of a once great city, now occupied by The Morgul-host","'${PLAYER}, it is good to see you again. My patrol and your errand have brought us to the same place.\
\
'This flag of Gondor, you see here, we fly as a beacon of hope to those trapped in Osgiliath. I hope that Faramir and his garrison are still alive. Look at the destruction down there in Osgiliath.'","'Now that you have spoken to the other Rangers here and have seen the destruction for yourself, you can understand how dire the situation is. Perhaps you will be able to assist us in devising a plan of action?'","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should talk to Mírthel at Faramir's Look-out about what you saw.","Faramir's Look-out is located south-east of Osgiliath.\
\
You should look at Osgiliath from Faramir's Look-out.","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>look</rgb> at the Morgul Vale","'The enemy gather all around us, yet we remain hidden. We are cut off from the Rangers of Northern Ithilien and those in Osgiliath. Speak with the other Rangers here and see for yourself what has become of this land.'","Speak with Gladhir","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at Osgiliath","This is a good place to <rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> at Osgiliath","<rgb=#FF0000>Look</rgb> towards the Morgul Vale","The Watch of the Cross-roads","Arodor asks you to survey the damage done by the Morgul-host."},
[13306]={"'¿Cruzarás el río y verás como está la gente de la Comarca? Las terribles criaturas nos derribaron, y temo pensar lo que podrían hacer a la gente pacífica al otro lado del río. Busca a Andy Tejonera y mira si aún vive; él vigila fuera de algunos de los vecindarios que están cerca de Cavada Grande.'","La vigilancia de la Comarca","'¿Los hobbits no reportan haber visto nada extraño? Esto no alivia mis preocupaciones, ${PLAYER}, porque significa que quien comanda a los terribles jinetes lo hace con un propósito más allá de solo matar. Debe haber separado a los jinetes para no atraer la atención. ¿Pero qué buscan si no es una batalla abierta lo que desean?\
\
'Me alegra que Andy y su gente aún vivan, pero no sé qué pensar de las criaturas que rompieron nuestras líneas y dispersaron a mi gente. Sí, digo criaturas: en la noche brumosa parecían hombres a mis ojos, pero mi corazón dice que son algo más, y maligno.\
\
'Ten cuidado mientras viajas por estas tierras. Algunas de las criaturas entraron en la Comarca, pero creo que algunas de ellas permanecieron aquí para molestar a los Montaraces y evitar que nos opongamos a ellas.'","Thornegil está en el cruce del Vado de Sarn, al sureste de la Comarca.","'¿Jinetes Negros? No, no he visto nada parecido. ¿Te golpeaste la cabeza? ¡Esto es la Comarca y estos son días de paz! Si alguien hubiera visto un gran grupo de Gente Grande a caballo, todos galopando juntos, ¡alguien habría dicho algo!\
\
'Ahora bien, es cierto que a veces un hobbit ve algo que lo asusta cuando sale a pasear por la noche, pero nueve de cada diez veces la sombra que parecía ocultar algo aterrador resulta ser un tronco caído en el camino, o un ciervo congelado entre los árboles... ¡y ese más asustado de él que él de eso!\
\
'Aprecio la preocupación, pero los hobbits sabemos cómo manejar nuestros propios asuntos. Vuelve con quien te envió aquí con tanta prisa y diles que todo está bien en la Comarca.'","'Aprecio la preocupación, pero los hobbits sabemos cómo manejar nuestros propios asuntos. Vuelve con quien te envió aquí con tanta prisa y diles que todo está bien en la Comarca.'","'Mi gente ha protegido durante mucho tiempo las fronteras de la Comarca de los peligros del mundo salvaje, pero nunca he visto tal maldad como la que dispersó a mi gente hace unos días. Terribles jinetes de negro dejaron a muchos Montaraces heridos o muertos, y algunos de ellos pasaron a la Comarca... no sé cuántos.\
\
'¿Cruzarás el río y verás como está la gente de la Comarca? Las terribles criaturas nos derribaron, y temo pensar lo que podrían hacer a la gente pacífica al otro lado del río. Busca a Andy Tejonera y mira si aún vive; él vigila fuera de algunos de los vecindarios que están cerca de Cavada Grande.'","Andy Tejonera es el vendedor de casas en Cavada Grande y se puede encontrar al noroeste del Vado de Sarn, junto a los Campos de Cavada.","Cruza el río al noroeste del Vado de Sarn y habla con Andy Tejonera en la Comarca","Thornegil teme que el terrible mal que cruzó a la Comarca ponga en peligro a los hobbits, y quiere que los visites.","Habla con Thornegil en el Vado de Sarn"},
[13308]={"'Brinda tu ayuda a tus compañeros Juglares, ${PLAYER}.'","'Has hecho bien, ${PLAYER}. Eres verdaderamente ${PLAYER:un amigo digno[m]|una amiga digna[f]} de los Juglares.'","Derrota a Dientefisura","Dientefisura derrotado","El Velador de la Determinación: Echando una Mano","Muchos Juglares desean convertirse en Veladores de la Determinación, pero no todos pueden alcanzar sus metas por sí solos.","Skûmfil está al este de las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Bassela te ha pedido ayudar a otro Juglar a completar su tarea final en Skûmfil.","'Saludos, ${PLAYER}. Muchos Juglares desean convertirse en Veladores de la Determinación, pero no todos pueden completar su tarea por su cuenta. Debes procurar ayudar a tus compañeros Juglares en su camino.\
\
'El mayor peligro al que se enfrentará tu camarada es el rascabismos Dientefisura, en Skûmfil.\
\
'Ve ahora y demuestra tu honor.'","Habla con Bassela","Bassela está justo afuera de Skûmfil, al este del Refugio Sombrío en las Fundaciones de Piedra.\
\
Con Dientefisura derrotado, debes regresar con Bassela con la noticia de tu éxito."},
[13309]={"'I do not think I can bow low enough to show you the honour I feel, ${PLAYER}. Truly, I cannot believe the extent of your success. The Dwarves of Khazad-dûm owe you much for what you have accomplished today!\
\
'Haldir may bear the message to Celeborn his lord that their Enemy is ours also. We have never varied in our defence of Lorien, but for their part in our recovery of the deeds of Durin's day, we shall be ever thankful.\
\
'Return to Haldir with that message and this also: war is coming. My kinsmen have unearthed much information as to the workings of our enemies; our forges and craft-halls are being used against us in preparation for a blow against Lothlórien. Something has stirred them, and now they seek revenge.'","'Have you gone yet to the great Nalâ-dûm? Have you seen the water-wheels or the menace that stops them from spinning?'","The Water-wheels: To Stagnant Nalâ-dûm","Investigate Nalâ-dûm for information","Nalâ-dûm is south of the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in the Water-works.\
\
Hrólfur wishes for you to investigate the ancient waterway of Nalâ-dûm and recover any lost information about the water-wheels that once fuelled Moria of old.","Hrólfur is in the Chamber of the Cross-roads, in Durin's Way.\
\
You should bring the ancient records you found to Hrólfur, who will be excited to find a ledger of records of the lore that was lost when Moria fell.","'The impertinence of the Elves is forgivable because of the hope Celeborn has kindled with the intent of his well-meaning message. I wish that I could invest every pair of hands in the expedition to re-igniting the lost lore of Durin's Day as our Elf-neighbour describes.\
\
'Alas that I cannot spare them, for I know that fell rumours hiss from the deep wells of Nalâ-dûm where the water-wheels once spun; long ago did Khazad-dûm hum with the murmur of great power surges leaping across the caves. Celeborn's message has put a warmth in my heart... there must be a way to solve this problem.\
\
'${PLAYER}, will you come to our aid again? I would ask you to travel to Nalâ-dûm with a small company and defeat whatever menace lurks there, for something has destroyed the works that once pumped life into these silent halls. If you find anything of value while you are there, I would give you a sturdy reward for such priceless knowledge.'","Haldir of Lórien has sent you to the aid of Hrólfur in Moria, a deed that may in turn provide some security for the Elves. Hrólfur and Haldir hope to see the legendary water-wheels of Nalâ-dûm functioning as they did long ago, in Durin's Day.","'Have you explored Nalâ-dûm yet, ${PLAYER}? It is <directions TBD> of the Chamber of the Crossroads.'","Bring the records to Hrólfur at the Chamber of the Cross-roads","Collected ancient records"},
[13310]={"Khaltâg has asked you to find his wife's necklace. Investigate Sektakhâb, the area of Khabârkhad Khaltâg described.","You are close to the area Khaltâg described","Khaltâg has asked you to inform Pharida, his daughter, that her mother's necklace has been found. She can be found working in the Dûlkar, in Dil-irmíz.","'Please, you look capable. I need the aid of someone strong to find my wife's necklace.\
\
'Please, just a moment of your time. Oh, you stopped. Excellent!\
\
'My wife was the most beautiful woman I have ever seen. She was taken from us too soon. I had given her a beautiful ruby necklace just months before she died. On the day we laid her to rest, I dressed her in her finest garb, with the necklace. But moments later, the necklace was gone. Some scoundrel must have made off with it!\
\
'It is the only thing I have to remember her by. Now I hear rumours that a similar-looking necklace has been seen in Sektakhâb, where the Dead walk. I tried to go there myself, but the Dead proved too much for me. I barely escaped with my life. Please, I do not have much, but what little coin I have is yours if you can find the necklace for me.'","Investigate Sektakhâb for Khaltâg's wife's necklace","Return to Mekab-kuphâr to give Khaltâg his wife's necklace","'Oh you found it! I never thought I would see the day. Oh thank you, thank you! Please, can you let my daughter Pharida know the good news?\
\
'This is the first happy day I have had since my wife's passing. So many shadowed days have crossed my face since then, without much light to scare them away. This is truly a joyous occasion!\
\
'You've done so much for me, but I wonder if you would do one more thing - could you tell my daughter, Pharida? She works in the Dûlkar, in Dil-irmíz. It is south-east of here. She needs to share this joy as well!'","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 1","Find Khaltâg's daughter Pharida and share the good news","Find and pick up Khaltâg's necklace","Investigate Sektakhâb for Khaltâg's wife's necklace. Sektakhâb is located west of Mekab-kuphâr in Khabârkhad.","'You found the necklace for Khaltâg? I do not believe it is so much a boon as he thinks.\
\
'My mother was always in poor health. Sickly, frequently bed-ridden, plagued by the Jin-ri, the Black Wind. My father bought that necklace to try to brighten her spirits, and because he was told it had healing properties. But after she wore it, I saw a change in her. She was a warm woman, always giving. But after wearing it, her heart hardened. Her words hardened, and stung as knives. She shut herself off from the world. From us.\
\
'I know not if it was the necklace or the knots of her mind, but my mother soon died after wearing that necklace. My father thinks it an artifact, a physical memory of her. I think it a cursed memory, and one that was better to have stayed lost.'","Search nearby for any sign of Khaltâg's wife's necklace.","The necklace feels ice-cold to the touch","Return to Mekab-kuphâr to give Khaltâg his wife's necklace."},
[13311]={"'Aye, I saw your man Khaltâg. He was causing quite an uproar a little while ago. Wouldn't stop shouting - Nûru tried to calm him, but he wasn't having it. Kept saying his wife was calling him home. I don't know what that means.\
\
'He ran off to the west. Said something about finding her.\
\
'She's dead? Khmêg. That is ill news, indeed. There are many buried in Sektakhâb, to the west. It's likely he fled there, if he intends to be with her.'","Return to Khaltâg in Mekab-kuphâr and relay Pharida's message","Ask Muntâkh, the merchant, if he knows where Khaltâg went.","'You should caution Khaltâg about the necklace. I know it is hard for him to see properly through eyes stained with grief, but holding on to the memory of my mother is causing him more pain than letting her go.\
\
'I do not want to sap his joy, but I do not see any good that can come from hanging on to that cursed past. He should return the necklace to where it was found. Some things are better left lost.'","Ask Khaltâg why he came to Sektakhâb.","Return to Khaltâg in Mekab-kuphâr and relay Pharida's message.","Pharida, Khaltâg's daughter, has asked you to relay her concerns about the necklace to her father. Khaltâg is in Mekab-kuphâr, in Khabârkhad.","Investigate Sektakhâb for signs of Khaltâg.","Save Khaltâg from being torn apart by crypt-walkers!","'I can't stop hearing them! The voices, my wife, she beckons me to join her!'","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 2","Khaltâg has disappeared from where you last spoke","Investigate Sektakhâb for signs of Khaltâg","Ask Muntâkh if he knows where Khaltâg went","Ask Khaltâg why he came to Sektakhâb"},
[13312]={"Defeat Sektakhâb Dead (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Throw the necklace into the Bay from the wharf past the harbour-warden's tower","Go to the Sail-haven. On the western docks past the Harbour-warden's tower there is a wharf jutting into the Bay. The deep waters of the Bay of Belfalas should hide the necklace for an age.","Aid Khaltâg","The necklace disappears from view, lost once more","Defeated Sektakhâb Dead (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Speak with Khaltâg.","'Khaltâg is dead? Oh no. Oh no...'\
\
She stares off into the distance behind you. Her grief is plain to see.\
\
'I hope he is at peace now. I knew that necklace was a curse! I knew it.\
\
'Thank you for trying to help him, and for throwing that... thing into the Bay. No one else need feel like this.'","The Way It Catches the Light, Part 3","Protect Khaltâg and fight off the crypt-walkers that have appeared!","Pick up the heavy necklace","'Throw this necklace into the bay. It is a curse. It is a curse!'","Speak with Pharida in the Dûlkar in Dil-irmíz about the fate of her father.","'One of the dead wounded me. I can't move. My strength fades.\
\
'Please, throw this necklace into the Bay. It is cursed. It lets you speak with the dead... by becoming one of them. No one should wear it.\
\
'Her voice is strong now, in my ear. She calls to me. My darling, I am coming home.'","Speak with Khaltâg","Pick up the heavy necklace.","Aid Khaltâg.","Speak with Pharida about the fate of her father","Khaltâg has run into Sektakhâb, claiming his wife is calling him to her. Help him if you can."},
[13313]={"You should take a stabled horse to the southern fortress of Rakhatâb. There you are to meet with the foreman, Nûrut. He has been told of your arrival and all the deeds you have done to assist the citizens of Jax Phanâl.","Speak with the stable-master and ride to Rakhatâb","'Friend, thank you for what you have done here. I will tell you that even further along the cape you will find others in need of assistance and the skills you possess. If you desire it, I will pay for your passage to Rakhatâb, a citadel to the south where you can continue to assist the people of Umbar. No? I knew I liked you, ${PLAYER}. But even so, it is to the stable-master you will want to go if you are to make the journey to Rakhatâb.\
\
'Know that the citizenry here will remember you. More importantly, it is I who will remember you and speak well of you to my lord. In a place such as Umbar, it is good to have friends in places both high and low. You are well on your way to acquiring both.\
\
'Good travels to you.'","'I offer you my sincerest thanks. Your efforts to assist our outpost will be on the lips of the citizens here for years to come.\
\
'An outsider, from lands afar, taking up arms against our former allies who are now foes! It is the mark of a hero to take on the woes of others, to assist those without the means to meet their struggles head on.\
\
'You are such a hero as this. The people of Jax Phanâl know it, and in time perhaps all of Umbar shall know it too. Go now, and in peace. Good travels to you.'","The Way South","Khôltekh's emissary suggests that you have done enough for the citizens of Jax Phanâl and directs you to the stable-master to journey to Rakhatâb to the south.","Speak with Nûrut","'Thank you, friend. What you have done for the people here in Jax Phanâl will not be forgotten. We are learning to be free and what it means to breathe the air fresh and new.\
\
'I know it seems that some of us are in a state of euphoria; perhaps we are. The shadow that long cast itself over these lands is no more; all around us there is light.'\
\
She smiles.\
\
'...and it seems that even outsiders can become our allies. Good travels to you. When you arrive in Rakhatâb speak with the overseer there. He has already been told that you are coming to their aid.'","Khôltekh's emissary directed you to the stable-master in Jax Phanâl to purchase a ride south along the road to Rakhatâb.","'Greetings, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Your arrival was foretold. You have already earned a reputation as a folk hero among some of the workers here. What you did for the citizens of Jax Phanâl reverberates in the halls of stone to be found here.\
\
'Welcome to Rakhatâb. We can only hope that your good nature and generosity will continue in our small, but bustling fort.'"},
[13314]={"El Camino de los Reyes","'¿Así que has mermado sus filas, localizado las entradas de las tumbas y conseguido sus llaves? Me parece que ha llegado el momento de que bajes al subsuelo.'","Ayuda a Nimbellas con \"La puerta este de Annúminas\"","Los montaraces del campamento del Camino de los Reyes necesitan ayuda para explorar los alrededores.","'Has hecho un trabajo excelente con los saqueadores de tumbas, ${PLAYER}. Creo que la ladera ya es segura y podemos empezar a movernos sin temor a que un contingente de angmarim nos esté esperando.\
\
'Antes de adentrarnos en las criptas y tumbas del Camino de los Reyes, debemos explorar el estado de los diversos edificios, así como la fuerza y la posición de las tropas apostadas aquí.\
\
'Habla con mis compañeros montaraces; ellos te guiarán en lo que queda por hacer.'","Los gobernantes de la gran ciudad de Annúminas están enterrados en el Camino de los Reyes.","Ayuda a Rodlam con \"Maldad de las profundidades\"","Ayuda a Maladan con \"Las llaves de las criptas\"","Habla con Nimbellas en el Camino de los Reyes","Nimbellas se alegrará de saber que el Camino de los Reyes ha sido explorado a fondo.","'¿Nos ayudarás, ${PLAYER}?'","Ayuda a Maladan con \"Portales al pasado\"","Ayuda a Nethrandir con \"Saqueadores de la historia\""},
[13315]={"'It is worse than I feared... the Enemy's forces have overrun the field! Orcs, evil Men, trolls... they number in the thousands to be certain!\
\
'Yet... despair not, my friend. The odds may be against us, but not so long ago at all, we faced down our foes side by side in Rohan! \
\
'We shall stand together once more and find victory!'","Travel to the summit of Amon Dîn","Talk to Hutha in Taur Drúadan","Amon Dîn can be found far to the south-east of the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Hutha has asked you to travel to the summit of Amon Dîn and light the extinguished beacon.","Hutha can be found within the War-stead of the King's Men.\
\
Burnoth has asked you to speak with Hutha about his plan for crossing through the Enemy's blockade beneath Amon Dîn.","'There is little time to speak, ${PLAYER}. Ulf, Hutha, and I shall soon set out into Taur Drúadan and ride southward towards the Pelennor Fields.\
\
'Hutha has mapped a swift, but deadly route to the fields, but our ride cannot succeed without your assistance.\
\
'Aid Hutha, and then meet us on the battlefield before Minas Tirith. It is there that we shall finally unmask our foe, for better or worse.\
\
'I regret that our paths must part for a time, but I shall count on having you at my side on the Fields!'","The Riders Three can be found at the Field of Onslaught.\
\
You have cleared a passage to the Pelennor Fields for the Riders Three and should now journey to their side.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Note: You must complete Book 5, Chapter 8 of Volume IV to advance this objective.</rgb>","'The time has come for us to depart the War-stead, ${PLAYER}. Many of our kinsmen have already ridden south through the valley, and we must reach them by the time we arrive at the Pelennor Fields.\
\
'Our route is dangerous, but we are without choice. We shall ride through their blockades and through the heart of their forces in Taur Drúadan!\
\
'But, if we are to succeed in such a bold manoeuvre, we shall have need of your skill.\
\
'Scale the beacon-hill Amon Dîn and light the beacon anew! The blaze will distract our foes and teach them well that Rohan does not surrender!'","Meet the Riders Three at the Field of Onslaught","Talk to Burnoth at the Field of Onslaught","The Way of the Enemy","A suitable torch can be found on the beacon at Amon Dîn.\
\
You have reached the summit of Amon Dîn and should now light the beacon to distract the Enemy's forces below.","As the pyre takes flame, your foes turn their attention to the newly-lit beacon","Light the beacon of Amon Dîn","Burnoth can be found somewhere on the Pelennor Fields.\
\
You have arrived at the Pelennor Fields and should now seek out the Riders Three.","If the Riders Three hope to rejoin their allies on the Pelennor Fields, they shall need to pass swiftly through the heart of the Enemy's forces in Taur Drúadan.","You have arrived at the summit of Amon Dîn and should now light the beacon!"},
[13317]={"'Well, were you able to find it?'\
\
You tell Sarnir that you found a carving on a nearby tree, but its appearance has been marred by several, deep slashes hewn into the tree's bark. However, despite being defaced by Egnir, you tell Sarnir that it still clearly read: 'E+D'.\
\
'Defaced? Perhaps I was mistaken. Maybe it was carved some time ago then, by another's hand or even Egnir's own. As you describe it, it seems to me a sort of lovers' mark, but I say some sorrow must lay heavy upon Egnir's heart. For what other reason would he travel so far from Morlad to try to rid himself of it?\
\
'I suppose the 'E' is meant to refer to Egnir, but 'D' could refer to countless people in the Vale. One thing is for certain, and that is that it does not refer to Dírion over there—I don't believe he and Egnir have ever exchanged a single word!'","'Might I trouble you with a more private matter, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'One of my bowmen, Egnir, has taken an unexpected leave of his duties here in Morlad. It is not like him, at least not as he was before he set off for the War with Lord Duinhir, but now... and it pains me to say it: I can scarcely recognize him. Before he left, few could contest that he was one of Lord Duinhir's most skilled bowmen—only equaled by the Lord himself and his two sons, Duilin and Derufin. When Egnir returned, I saw in his eyes a sorrow not unlike that of Lord Duinhir and Lady Rosfin, but I do not know why it has taken hold of him. I have asked him, but he will not answer... and now he has gone so far as to leave Morlad.\
\
'Do not misunderstand, my friend. I would not see him punished, but I worry for him... and I worry that he may not return to us at all.\
\
'From what I've heard, Egnir was last seen travelling southward toward Alagrant. Will you seek him out and ask him to come home to Morlad?'","The carving can be found on a tree to the south-west of Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Sarnir spied Egnir making a carving into a tree outside Alagrant. You should find the carving and examine it.","One of Lord Duinhir's most skilled bowmen, Egnir, has unexpectedly taken leave of his duties in Morlad.","Examine the defaced carving","Although the carving has been defaced by deep slashes, it still clearly reads: 'E+D'","Find the carving on a tree outside Alagrant","You see no sign of Egnir among the hunters of Alagrant...","Talk to Calennen","'What can I help you with, ${PLAYER}?'\
\
You ask Calennen if a man named Egnir came to Alagrant.\
\
'Egnir, you say? Yes, a man by that name did pass through the other day, but he left not long after he arrived. I must admit, I didn't take the time to speak with him. He had a grim look about him, and it seemed to me that he would not welcome a conversation.\
\
'Even so, Sarnir tried to talk with him. It seemed a bit one-sided, but I did hear Egnir answer him on a few occasions. Why don't you ask Sarnir if he knows where Egnir has gone?'","The defaced carving can be found on a tree to the south-west of Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have spotted the carving on a nearby tree outside Alagrant, but it has been defaced. You should examine it.","Find Egnir in Alagrant","The Wayward Bowman","'It has been some time, ${PLAYER}! I mean no insult, but I did not expect you to return to the Vale.\
\
'What business brings you to Alagrant?'\
\
You ask Sarnir if he spoke to a man named Egnir and if he knows where Egnir meant to go after leaving Alagrant. You inform him that Egnir is remiss in his duties and must return to Morlad.\
\
'Ah, yes, Egnir was here for a brief time. He told me he had a matter to attend to in the woods just outside Alagrant, but he would not say more of it. I must confess, my curiosity got the better of me, so I followed him at a great distance. I spied him carving something into one of the trees just to the west of Alagrant, but I dared not interrupt him and I made my way back to Alagrant before his work was finished.\
\
'I did speak to Egnir when he returned, and he said that he was going to meet someone, but I cannot remember the name of the man he mentioned. It started with an 'L', but... what was it?\
\
'I haven't been back to see his handiwork in the woods, so why don't you find out what he was carving? In the meantime, I'll try to remember that man's name.'","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
You have found a carving reading 'E+D', but it is unclear why Egnir defaced it. You should return to Sarnir.","Calennen can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Having found no sign of Egnir, you should talk to the hunters of Alagrant and learn if he passed through the hamlet on some errand. You should talk to Calennen.","You spot what appears to be a defaced carving on a nearby tree","Egnir can likely be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Uidor has asked you to find Egnir, one of Lord Duinhir's most skilled bowmen, after he took an unexpected leave of his duties in Morlad.","Sarnir can be found in Alagrant, in the Blackroot Vale.\
\
Calennen recalls that Egnir visited Alagrant, but left after a short time. He thinks Sarnir might know more about Egnir's whereabouts. You should talk to Sarnir.","Talk to Sarnir"},
[13318]={"'El mejor alce de mi rebaño lleva un tiempo sin aparecer. Temo que los peikko lo hayan devorado, pero no estoy seguro. Es un poderoso luchador y solía dar la voz de alarma cuando los peikko atacaban, pero por desgracia desde un tiempo esa voz lleva mucho tiempo en silencio.\
\
'La última vez lo vi pastando hacia las colinas del norte, más allá del rebaño de hirvi. Si fueras en esa dirección, quizá encuentres algún rastro que revele hacia dónde ha ido.\
\
'¡Encuentra al alce o averigua qué ha sido de él, y tu recompensa será grande!'","'¿Has encontrado a mi alce? Espero que simplemente se haya perdido y no lo haya atrapado una tormenta o algo peor. La última vez que lo vi estaba hacia el norte, cerca de las colinas al norte de Suri-kylä.'","Encuentra al alce descarriado","El alce descarriado","El alce descarriado podría estar cerca, en las montañas al norte de Suri-kylä y el campamento de Ilmo.\
\
Ilmo teme que su mejor alce haya sido víctima de los peikko y te ha pedido que lo busques.","Ilmo está en el exterior de Suri-kylä, al norte de sus puertas.\
\
Deberías volver a ver a Ilmo y hacerle saber que su alce ha vuelto sano y salvo.","El alce parece estar dispuesto a seguirte.","Habla con Ilmo","'¡Me has devuelto a mi alce sano y salvo! Te debo mucho. Difundiré la palabra de tus buenas acciones por los campamentos de los Lossoth. Eres verdaderamente excepcional.'","Ilmo ya te dio las gracias por tu ayuda contra los peikko, pero parece que los problemas le buscan constantemente.","Has escoltado con éxito al alce descarriado de vuelta a Ilmo"},
[13319]={"Pregunta a los niños hobbit cerca de la Posada El Codo Levantado","El hijo errante","Reúnete con Gildor fuera de Tham Amothir","No has obtenido información útil...","Gildor te está esperando en la puerta oeste de Campotieso.\
\
Comparte lo que has descubierto con él.","'Los Fronteros no han visto a Pervinca, lo que esperaba. Después de investigar un poco, he encontrado huellas apenas visibles que van hacia el oeste.\
\
'Si lo que has averiguado es cierto, debe haber corrido hacia Tham Amothir. 'Ese es un lugar oscuro, ¡donde ningún niño debería ir! Partamos; podemos cubrir más terreno si vamos hacia el suroeste, y reagruparnos fuera de las ruinas.'","Habla con Gildor en la puerta oeste de Campotieso","Gildor ha sugerido que os reagrupéis en el exterior de las ruinas de Tham Amothir, al suroeste de Campotieso.","'Pervinca es muy hábil escondiéndose. En las partidas anteriores, solo la encontramos una vez porque se aburrió y empezó a merodear. No me sorprendería que sea el caso de nuevo, pero si no la encuentras en ningún sitio de Campotieso, entonces la situación es grave de verdad.\
\
'Debería preguntar a los Fronteros si la han visto. Quizá puedas preguntar a los otros niños; han ido a jugar cerca de la posada.'","Gildor te asiente con la cabeza según te acercas","Has encontrado a Gildor en el exterior de Tham Amothir.\
\
Habla con él para decidir qué hacer a continuación.","Los otros niños podrían saber dónde ha ido Pervinca.\
\
Están todos jugando cerca de la Posada El Codo Levantado.","No has obtenido ninguna información útil...","'!${PLAYER}!'He visto a Pervinca escabullándose, aunque se me escapa de la vista la mayoría de las veces.'","El juego del escondite ha terminado mal. Os toca a Gildor y a ti encontrar a Pervinca.","Habla con Gildor","¡¡Oh, yo he visto a Pervinca! Vino a mi escondite y me preguntó si quería explorar las aterradoras ruinas cercanas. Le dije que no, y que se fuera, ¡antes de que nos encontraran! Creo que no se lo tomó muy bien...\
\
'¿Vais en busca de mathoms juntos? ¿Es por lo que he visto al Sr. Gildor esperando en la puerta oeste?'"},
[13320]={"Lagorlam, miembro de la compañía de elfos que vino al norte con Gildor Inglorion, entró en Taur Gonwaith buscando venganza contra los trolls que atacaron Lin Giliath. No ha regresado, lo que preocupa a Thaliollang.","El compañero extraviado","'Si Gildor y mi compañía hubieran llegado antes, Lachenn quizá seguiría vivo.'","Busca a Lagorlam en Taur Gonwaith","'Taur Gonwaith es un lugar maligno donde los trolls de piedra dominan.'","¡Has encontrado a Lagorlam!","'Cuando llegamos aquí, hubo mucho debate sobre qué debía hacerse con los trolls de piedra, y muchos pensaron, como yo, que debían ser expulsados de su fortaleza en Taur Gonwaith.\
\
'Algunos de nosotros, entre ellos Aglardir y Gildor, aconsejaron moderación. Lamento las duras palabras que les dirigí, pero en aquel momento su plan de reconstruir este lugar parecía una falta de respeto a la memoria de Lachenn.\
\
'Mi amigo Lagorlam pensaba como yo y partió para matar a los trolls de piedra, pero no ha regresado. Me tranquilizaría si pudieras encontrarlo. Búscalo en el bosque de Taur Gonwaith, al sureste.'","'La muerte de Lachenn nos ha afectado a todos, y Lagorlam puede que no actúe con tanta cautela como debería. Búscalo en Taur Gonwaith, al sureste, y bríndale toda la ayuda que necesite.'","Lagorlam ha ido al bosque de Taur Gonwaith, al sureste de Lin Giliath.\
\
Thaliollang te envió a buscar a Lagorlam y asegurarte de que está bien.","'Tuve palabras duras para Aglardir, y ahora las lamento. Su dolor no es menos verdadero que el mío.'"},
[13321]={"'¿Entonces te ha enviado Rhiangar? ¿Se ha rebajado por fin a volver a Cardolan? Bueno, has perdido el tiempo. No necesito que me protejan, ¡iba a destrozarles! ¡Escoria orca!\
\
'Me dejaron inconsciente, pero me defendí con mi bastón. ¡Los cobardes huyeron! Puede que haya perdido los estribos y haya lanzado mi bastón mientras huían. No ha acabado lejos. Recupéralo, ¿vale?'","Busca al alcalde desaparecido.","Has descubierto al alcalde desaparecido, pero parece que está inconsciente. Debes hablar con el alcalde.\
\
El alcalde está en Tharbad, en el sudeste de Cardolan.","Habla con el alcalde","Consigue el bastón del alcalde","Rhiangar Nevit te ha pedido que encuentres a su padre, el alcalde Cadwallon Nevit, en Tharbad.\
\
Tharbad se encuentra en el sudoeste de Cardolan.","¡Los gruñidos de los orcos se escuchan por doquier!","El alcalde tozudo","'¡Saludos! Por favor, necesito tu ayuda.\
\
'Me llamo Rhiangar Nevit. Mi padre, el alcalde de Herne, fue visto por última vez camino a las ruinas cercanas. ¡Siempre ha estado obsesionado con Tharbad, pero no hace mucho que la ciudad en ruinas ha sido infestada por los orcos! Temo por su vida, pero no soy ninguna guerrera.\
\
'Por favor, busca a mi padre en las ruinas. Voy a ir a su casa en Herne otra vez, a ver si ha vuelto.''","El alcalde Cadwallon Nevit te ha pedido que le traigas el bastón que ha lanzado.\
\
El bastón está en el camino cerca del alcalde, en Tharbad.","Has rescatado al alcalde tozudo, Cadwallon Nevit. Deberías hablar con el alcalde y decirle que su hija le espera.\
\
El alcalde Nevit está en Tharbad, en el sudeste de Cardolan.","'¡Bah! ¡Claro que exagera! Los enemigos me atacaron cuando me descuidé. Me las hubiera apañado. ¡Dame mi bastón!'","¡Has encontrado al alcalde!","Dale el bastón al alcalde","El alcalde de Herne ha desaparecido, y su hija está desesperada por encontrarle."},
[13322]={"'Ah, you have returned! I am pleased to see it.'\
\
Mokhlêsh looks slyly to the left and to the right, then lowers his voice.\
\
'I was thinking about what we talked about, my friend. You remember that I won a large sum of money on a wager at the Dahâl Huliz? Well, your words planted a seedling in my head: what if the Lady Hármelak thinks to take some portion of my winnings for her own? Such taxes were commonplace when Ordakh ruled, and I fear the Kindred may decide to take more coins of their own to add to their fortunes!\
\
'You are a trustworthy sort, I can tell, but better still you are recognizable... I am not afraid you will disappear on me. Will you speak with Khâhir the Quick and collect my winnings? You will be rewarded for doing this for me, and for keeping news of my success to yourself! Khâhir is outside the Dahâl Huliz, in the Tor-gardens. Give him my name and he will give you a hefty purse full of coin!'","Ighâz will not let you have the wager he 'rightfully' stole!","'You have returned! Now where are my winnings? Never fear, you will be given your share, my friend!'\
\
You explain the situation to Mokhlêsh and his face falls.\
\
'Wait... did I really place my money upon Othnâm? I meant to put it upon Uthmân, did I not? There should be a rule that no two fighters can be named so similarly!\
\
'This is not the joyous day I thought it was, friend. But at least I do not need to worry that Hármelak will take a large portion of my winnings....\
\
'Ah, I will still see you rewarded for your effort, though it will not be as large a sum as I planned. There is always next time, and I have a good feeling about Uthmân! Or is it Othnâm?'","Recover the wayward wager and defeat the upstart who stole it","Mokhlêsh is eager to receive his winnings from a recent wager.","The Wayward Wager","Talk to Khâhir the Quick outside the arena","The upstart who stole the wager can be found outside the Raven and Albatross in the Upper Ward.","Mokhlêsh asked you to collect his winnings from Khâhir the Quick outside the arena.","'Are you here to collect a winning wager? Well, I must tell you that we may not be able to satisfy that obligation at this time. You are here on behalf of Mokhlêsh? Well, we cannot pay either of you.\
\
'Some upstart Corsairs have taken to stealing records of the wagers made at Dahâl Huliz, hoping to modify the records and claim the winning as their own. Until Mokhlêsh's wager is recovered from the upstarts outside the Raven and Albatross, we of the arena cannot pay anything.'","Mokhlêsh is at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward.","Bring the wager to Mokhlêsh at the Baths of Ilmai Iforikh in the Upper Ward","Return the wayward wager to Khâhir the Quick outside the arena","'You recovered the wager? Mokhlêsh is fortunate on two counts, then: to have won his wager, and to call you his friend!'\
\
Khâhir takes the wager from you and examines it. He is about to put it back on the table when his eyebrows suddenly knit together. Then he looks up at you.\
\
'I take back what I said. Mokhlêsh may still be fortunate to call you his friend... but he has not won this wager. See here, where he placed his coins upon Othnâm? Well, Othnâm did not win that bout! The winner was Uthmân! It is true that their names are quite similar... but Mokhlêsh did not win this wager at all! There is nothing to pay him!\
\
'I am sorry you put yourself to all this trouble when he did not even win, friend. But there is nothing I can do about it. Tell Mokhlêsh to be more careful when he places a wager!'","'I am sorry you put yourself to all this trouble when he did not even win, friend. But there is nothing I can do about it. Tell Mokhlêsh to be more careful when he places a wager!'","Khâhir the Quick is outside the arena.","'You are a trustworthy sort, I can tell, but better still you are recognizable... I am not afraid you will disappear on me. Will you speak with Khâhir the Quick and collect my winnings? You will be rewarded for doing this for me, and for keeping news of my success to yourself! Khâhir is outside the Dahâl Huliz, in the Tor-gardens. Give him my name and he will give you a hefty purse full of coin!'","You have defeated Ighâz and recovered the wager he stole","'Some upstart Corsairs have taken to stealing records of the wagers made at Dahâl Huliz, hoping to modify the records and claim the winning as their own. Until Mokhlêsh's wager is recovered from the upstarts outside the Raven and Albatross, we of the arena cannot pay anything.'"},
[13323]={"Explora el Risco de Helva","'Veo que has cumplido con todo lo que te he pedido, y lo has hecho con buen criterio y conocimiento. ¿Crees que ya puedes unirte a la Liga del Hacha? No, porque aún debes demostrar tu destreza y tu ética de trabajo. La Liga funciona como una familia. Todos nos turnamos para reparar nuestras trampas, ya que sin ellas no habría Liga.\
\
'Te pido que repares las trampas para osos y las trampas para peces rotas, y que afiles los picos que hay esparcidos por el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes. Si cumples bien con todas estas tareas, formarás parte de la Liga del Hacha. Si no consigues reparar alguna, solo podrás venir aquí para comerciar con nosotros.'","'Me han impresionado tus habilidades y todo lo que has logrado por nosotros hoy. Te damos la bienvenida a la Liga del Hacha, ${PLAYER}. Ojalá te ganes nuestra confianza con el tiempo y todos prosperemos en el Bosque Salvaje.'","Los enemigos han invadido la Mina este","Consigue pieles de animales en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Explora el Mirador del Cazador","Repara trampas para peces rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Picos romos afilados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Explora la Mina oeste","La Liga del Hacha desea cazar en los bosques y extraer minerales de las colinas del Bosque Salvaje de la Tierra de Bree, una vez que se haya explorado debidamente el bosque.","Trampas para osos reparadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Habla con Enid Picortiga","Explora la Pradera de Blomley","Repara trampas para oso rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Explora la Mina este","Las manadas pastan en el Mirador del Cazador","Consigue muestras de mineral (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Trampas para peces reparadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","La Pradera de Blomley, el Risco de Helva, el Mirador del Cazador, la Mina este y la Mina oeste se encuentran en el Bosque Salvake.\
\
Mientras exploras el Bosque Salvaje, debes recoger muestras de minerales y pieles de alces, lobos, osos y jabalíes para la Liga del Hacha.","Los enemigos han asegurado la Mina oeste","'Aunque tus palabras me parecen convincentes, no me corresponde a mí decidir si te unes o no a la Liga del Hacha. No, serán tus propias habilidades y acciones las que lo determinen. Te haré una prueba para que demuestres que mereces unirte a la Liga.\
\
'Conocer el territorio es una habilidad importante para nuestra causa. Te pido que explores los terrenos de caza y las entradas a las minas del Bosque Salvaje. Pero hay más. Extraer recursos de estas tierras de una forma que no dañe el Bosque Salvaje es igual de importante para nuestra prosperidad y supervivencia. Te pido que regreses con pieles y muestras de mineral que consideres dignas de comercio.'","Las bestias campan a sus anchas en la Pradera de Blomley","Las bestias campan a sus anchas en el Risco de Helva","La confianza en la riqueza","En el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes se pueden encontrar trampas rotas y picos romos.\
\
Deberías reparar estos objetos para la Liga del Hacha.","Pieles de animales recogidas en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Enid Picortiga se encuentra en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes\
\
Deberías hablar con Enid Picortiga.","Afila picos romos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13324]={"Talk to the guard on the southern bridge out of Dale and find out if he has seen Bryn.","Talk to the southern bridge guard in Dale","You should speak with both King Bard II and Prince Bryn, who can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.","Look for a guard on the southern bridge","Erna draws you near and speaks in a hushed tone.\
\
'I would speak with you of Bryn, ${PLAYER}. You have seen that he is sullen and distant, but this was not always so. The death of his father and, I doubt not, kingship of his brother have been hard upon the boy.\
\
'Do you recall when I asked you to gather the items for my lecture? I found Bryn where I knew I would find him - outside the walls of Dale. He has gone out much of late, and the danger in doing so is grave. I think, perhaps, that he dreams of the wider world and adventures a young person might have there.\
\
'Would you talk to him of your own adventures? I do not know, yet I hope that may allay some of his restlessness.'","'It is hard to believe that my brother has forgiven me... or that he ever shall. I even told him about the knife. Now I must do all I can to make it up to him. Ah, what a fool I was! It is bitter, and I am ashamed, but I must hide from unpleasant truths no longer.'","'You have unravelled one more troubling scheme, ${PLAYER} - one that ran perilously close to my own blood. For that, I thank you.\
\
'And yet... and yet...'","Tell Bryn a <rgb=#FF0000>Story</rgb> of your adventures","Erna is worried about her son Bryn, who has become increasingly distant and sullen.","Talk to the guard on the southern bridge out of Dale.","'The prince? No, I...'\
\
The guard sighs.\
\
'No, I speak the lie. He did come this way, and paid me not to tell a soul. I was a fool to accept the bribe, and will pay a steeper price, I know. But you must go after the prince, and see that no harm comes to him. That is the greater matter!'","Talk to Prince Bryn","You should speak with Queen Regent Erna, who can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.","Talk to Erna","You see the guard, but Bryn is nowhere to be seen","Talk to King Bard II","'I am glad to hear that my brother is no longer in danger. It will... take longer to forgive him, but I am sure that I shall. Much like the rebuilding of Dale and of Lake-town. It is hard work, and long, but we know it must be done.'","Bryn fled to the south in Dale.\
\
Look for a guard on the southern bridge of Dale to see if he has stopped Bryn.","Bryn can be found in the Great-keep in Dale.\
\
You should tell Prince Bryn stories of your adventures.","You attempt to tell Bryn a great tale","The Weeping Warrior","'He crossed the bridge just now. If you hurry, I am sure you will be able to catch up with him.'"},
[13327]={"Return to Dale.","Talk to the Easterling Man","The young King's face darkens and emotions struggle unconcealed across it as you describe all you saw and heard among his folk. He looks to you, then back to his mother in doubt.\
\
Before he can speak, a messenger appears, bowing low.","You should go to the location where you heard shouting, in the lower markets, in the south-eastern quarter of Dale.","Discouraged harassers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'These Easterlings come seeking shelter and aid, yet why have they come to us? Are we not ourselves beleaguered from war and strife?\
\
'We have hardly patched our walls and gates, which the Jangovar shattered. Jangovar raiders linger yet in the wilder corners of the valley, sapping off our trade and slowing the commerce we'll have to rebuild.\
\
'You cannot help someone up, I say, while you yourself are on your hands and knees!'","'Asking a foreigner to talk to our townsfolk about other foreigners? How does that help, brother?'","Hear what's going on in Dale","Talk to Dale-folk (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","The Dale-men have encircled the unarmed Easterling man in the lower markets, in the south-east of Dale.\
\
You should persuade the Dale-men to leave the Easterling man alone.","'Those poor bedraggled souls? I have seen them and seen the sorrow on their faces. My grandmam held me on her knee and told of the sorrow on the faces of our own people during the Desolation of Smaug... and the hope we felt when first we returned here to Dale.\
\
'If you ask me, we ought to do all we can to offer them comfort and shelter.'","You should return to King Bard II, who can be found in the Great-keep in the north of Dale, and bring word of all you saw and heard among the Dale-folk.","'They say they come in peace, but I know what these Easterlings are: nothing but a new Jangovar ruse! Behind every tattered cloak you will find sharpened swords and shining mail.\
\
'They wait only 'til we welcome them into Dale, when they will draw their blades and cut our throats!'","'I have travelled far and wide, and traded many times with the Men of Dorwinion. Many of those refugees who arrived in rags at our gates are from that Eastern land, and I know them to be Women and Men of principles, learning, and laws just as we are.\
\
'But among the refuge-seekers are others, the Chayasír, and I have never done trade with these. They are wanderers, I am told, with no writing, building, or craft.'","'These refugees who have come out of the East speak of ruin in their homelands, but I say it is retribution for siding with the Dark Lord against the Free Peoples.\
\
'Let them go back from whence they came and suffer their due!'","Return to King Bard II","'I thank you, stranger. I knew that I took a risk upon myself when I ventured into Dale, but the need was great.\
\
'I thought to myself, is this not known to the ends of all roads as a place of trade, yes even as far as my land of Dorwinion? And am I not myself a man of trade and tallies? There is hunger and need among the camps, I thought, and so I will find what has value that cannot be eaten or worn, and trade it for what can.\
\
'Yet alas, I have found no fellow merchants, only ill-will. Now I fear I must turn back and find some other way. There will be another way, I am certain. We have come leagues upon leagues from our lands and survived greater travails than these.'","'The refugees? I do not know whether they mean well or ill, but many among us Dale-folk trust not these new Easterlings. Not in such numbers, nor so soon after the Jangovar assault!'","Talk to folk in Dale about the Easterling refugees.","Discourage harassers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'What do you know of the Chayasír, who are among these new-arrived Easterlings? Here is what I have heard: that they themselves claim they dwelled here by the Long Lake once, and have returned to claim it as their own.\
\
'Even if their tales be true, have we not held this place, built it and rebuilt it again through plagues, dragons, and Jangovar swords?\
\
'Let them try and claim it. They'll get nought so long as Dale stands and thrives!'","The Welcoming of Guests","Learn how the folk of Dale feel about newly-arrived Easterling refugees.","Talked to Dale-folk (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Do you know how our battle against the Jangovar was won? I do, for I was there.\
\
'In truth, we thought ourselves outmatched. Dale was taken and our dear king, Brand, slain, and the King of Dwarves as well. And yet we fought on, for what else could we do? So there we were, readying ourselves for death with our swords in our hands, when the ground began shaking and the sky changed, and lo! An Eagle came and it spoke glad tidings to the Good Peoples of Middle-earth.\
\
'The enemy then quailed before us and we pressed our advantage, driving them before us in a great rout.\
\
'What do I think of these refugees? That if we treat our guests and supplicants poorly, we are no better than evil Men, and I had rather belong to the good!'","Find the cause of the shouting","'Please, I mean no harm! Can you persuade them to leave me be?'","Several Dale-men stand around an unarmed Easterling","Shouts rise up from lower markets, in the south-east quarter of Dale","'We are most pleased to welcome you to Dale, ${PLAYER}. Many roads and many peoples find their way hither, and with them, of late, come the most remarkable rumours. It is said that the Dark Lord has fallen in Mordor and that Gondor has a King!'\
\
The young man glances hastily back at the woman beside him, as if afraid he has said too much. You assure him that the rumours are true, and his eyes widen.\
\
'You are well-spoken and worldly-wise. There is a goodness in your eyes. Might I... ask you to help serve Dale in a matter most suited to your virtues?\
\
'We have lately weathered our own assault from the Dark Lord's forces, in the form of the warlike Jangovar, coming out of the east. Their strength was broken, though our losses were great and a remnant clings to this valley, intent on harrying what they cannot conquer. But this is not the matter of which I spoke.\
\
'After the Jangovar, other Easterlings appeared. These bore not armour but rags, not arms or battle-standards but meagre satchels with scant belongings. They came scared, and hungry, and speaking of strange and terrible tidings to the east. They have gathered in some small camps in the wilderness outside Dale and I wish to welcome them into our gates... but the Folk of Dale have endured much in recent days, and I would know their hearts before I act. I fear that if I or my known agents asked among them, they would tell us what we wished to hear, not the truth of their hearts.\
\
'Would you go among the Dale-folk and hear their true thoughts on these new Easterlings who have come to our doors, seeking refuge?'","You should talk to the Easterling refugee, whom you rescued in the south-eastern quarter of Dale.","'Please, will you go among the Dale-folk and hear their thoughts about the refugees?'"},
[13329]={"Patch the stones seeping noxious blight (${NUMBER}/3)","A noxious blight is seeping from these broken stones. Patch up the stones and seal the wellspring!","Investigate the southern cliffs near the Mâkhda Khorbo","'Stranger, you said you wanted to aid us. If ever an oath was to be uttered, now is the time. If you are who you say you are, and you can help us, your name will be sung through the halls of Khûtra long after you've passed through here.\
\
'Will you help us? Will you help us heal Khûtra?'","Talk to Elder Roshat","'This terrible disease must be coming from the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo. Go to the hills east of here, to the ruins. The air there is thick with malevolence, and the dead roam free. I am sure that this must be the source of all our trouble. Please, investigate the ruins. Find and seal up the source of this malady!'","Elder Roshat has asked you to go to the hills east of Khûtra, to the cliffs facing south near the ruins of the Mâkhda Khorbo and investigate the source of the disease.","The Wellspring","Talk to Heshra, the herbalist in the Elder Hall.","'The blight is sealed! That is welcome news indeed! That will dry the source of evil coming into Khûtra. Now we just need to heal Khûtra's afflicted. Hurry, we've not a moment to lose!'","Talk to Heshra, the herbalist","Talk to Elder Roshat in the Elder Hall.","Elder Roshat has tasked you with going into the hills to the east, near the Mâkhda Khorbo, to a cliff where purple honeywort grows. Heshra is convinced that is where the disease originates. Find the source of the disease and seal it up if you can.","Sealed the stones seeping noxious blight (${NUMBER}/3)"},
[13331]={"'The West Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.'","There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The West Gate: Enhancements I","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'"},
[13332]={"'The West Gate has been rebuilt and now stands firmly, but there is much to do to finish it. Banners, flags, shields, and places for the warriors who will man it and stand to defend us against assault must all be set up and built.'","There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar","The West Gate: Enhancements II","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'"},
[13333]={"There is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.","'Hytbold only has two gates: one in the east and one in the west. Both of the gates still stand, but the timbers are burnt out and would not hold against any concerted assault. The West Gate must be replaced and rebuilt if we are to have any security.'","Bring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg","Gather Tokens of Hytbold (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The West Gate: Rebuild","'Hytbold is one step closer to being rebuilt and restored.'"},
[13334]={"Return to Cúfaron and tell him of your success","'Well done, ${PLAYER}! Now, if we must, my band can travel west into the Sutcrofts. I know Hestil does not wish to, but there may be no other way. The huge gathering of Orcs in the East Wall may require us to deal with the horsemen of Rohan instead.\
\
'I will bring us back to Hestil's camp with my secret hunter knowledge of the best paths and trails to take throughout this land. I think I may remember the way... if you keep your eyes open and help me look for our footprints....'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You will automatically travel to Parth Galen in the East Wall when you complete this quest.</rgb>","The West Option","Hestil asked Cúfaron to find another route through the East Wall that will improve their chances of survival.","Defeat an Orc-leader at the Sutcrofts barricade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The pass to the Sutcrofts is located south-west of Parth Galen and has been barricaded by the Orcs.\
\
You need to defeat the Orcs to allow Hestil's company to pass.","'Now that these lands are full of Orcs and other dangers, Hestil has asked me to find another route through the East Wall. We had planned to keep going north, but that does not seem as safe as it would have been if this land were empty. Instead, it is crawling with Orcs, and those unnatural swert-hounds are not to be trifled with either. Of course, you know that: you fought some of them too.\
\
'There may be another way through this land, ${PLAYER}. There is a canyon to the west that leads into an area of the Kingdom of Rohan known as the Sutcrofts. From a distance I saw the Orcs working to barricade that pass. I will go there with you, taking you by secret paths that I alone, as a hunter, can find!\
\
'Then you will defeat some of the Orcs at the barricade. That way, if we remain unable to progress north, at least we will have another option available to us. Hestil is sure to be pleased with that possibility, even if it means going into Rohan. Better the horsemen than more Orcs!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>You will automatically travel to the Sutcrofts Barricade in the East Wall when you accept this quest.</rgb>","'See? I have brought you here by hidden paths! I am a hunter of great skill and know how to move quickly through the wilderness.\
\
'The barricade is just over there, ${PLAYER}. Defeat the Orcs that guard it, then return here to me when you are done.'","You have spoken with Cúfaron","Defeated Orcs at the Sutcrofts barricade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeated an Orc-leader at the Sutcrofts barricade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Go to the pass into the Sutcrofts and defeat the Orcs at the barricade there. We need to keep that pass open to us in case we are not able to proceed north as Hestil had planned.'","Defeat Orcs at the Sutcrofts barricade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cúfaron is waiting to speak with you.\
\
You have defeated Orcs at the barricade into the Sutcrofts and should return to tell Cúfaron.","'You have returned from the pass into the Sutcrofts? I am glad you ran into little trouble there...only a few Orcs is all, correct?'\
\
Cúfaron looks uncomfortable.\
\
'While you were gone, I spoke with Hestil, and it appears that she does not want to explore the west option at all. It seems that she is willing to risk the northward journey and does not want to go into Rohan at all. She says the horsemen do not treat outsiders very kindly.\
\
'I am sorry you went to the barricade for naught. I am all ready to rescue Drafli, if everybody else is ready.'"},
[13335]={"You have spotted a gathering of people on the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should speak with someone in this company to get word of Gandalf or King Théoden.","King Théoden, along with Éomer, Aragorn, Legolas, and Gimli, have begun a journey towards the Fords of Isen.\
\
You should meet the king and his company upon the east-to-west road in the Westfold to lend them aid at the brink of war.","Search the road in the Westfold for signs of Théoden's company","'Hello there, fellow traveller! You look to be in quite a rush, and I do not blame you.'","The Westfold: To the King's Aid","Search for Théoden at Helm's Dike","The terrified people make for Helm's Deep, the last stronghold -- perhaps the king did the same.","Ask the refugees if they need any assistance","King Théoden indicated upon leaving Edoras that he would ride to the Fords of Isen. You should ride to the road in the Westfold and meet the king's company and search for Gandalf.","You have spotted a gathering of people on the road in the centre of the Westfold.\
\
You should ask the refugees if they need assistance.","'King Théoden has ridden to Helm's Deep in a great change of plan -- but I have not time to explain.\
\
'I must search for Erkenbrand, Grimbold, Elfhelm, and their company, for they are missing since the Fords fell to the enemy. Ride along the road and find the king, ${PLAYER}. Help him if he needs help, and then help me find the lords of the Westfold.'","You ask the man if he or his fellows need any assistance.\
\
'I thank you, stranger, but no. We hope to reach the Hornburg by nightfall. The enemy will not dare to strike us there!\
\
'We shall make good time when our horses are rested.'","Helm's Deep is in the valley in the south-western corner of the Westfold.\
\
You should ride with all speed to the gate of the stronghold of Helm's Deep.","You have found a small gathering of people upon the road","Speak with someone in the small company on the road","'A stranger on the road at such a time? How can this be? You had best go back to where you came from. This is no place to be wandering.\
\
'We make for Helm's Deep, the last great stronghold in the Westfold; the Fords of Isen are lost. Have you not heard? Erkenbrand is gone, as are Grimbold and Elfhelm! Our last hope is at the mighty Hornburg.'\
\
If the people of the Westfold make for Helm's Deep, then perhaps Théoden's company did as well...for you do not see any sign of them upon the road.","'Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}.'","These hardy folk decline your aid -- you should now make for Helm's Deep, and seek the king!","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! I did not expect to see you here on the eve of the greatest assault Rohan has ever endured. I am glad you are here to aid us, and not trapped beyond the gate when it locks behind us.\
\
'I trust the rest of my realm does not fare so badly as the Westfold, with doughty warriors such as yourself to defend it. Tell me: what news of the Westemnet?'","You spot a small gathering of people upon the road"},
[13336]={"Follow the trail of felled trees leading north-west (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Something on the western side of Marton has been felling trees north-west of town. This does not bode well for the western route to Helm's Deep.","The source of the felled trees can be found north-west of Marton.\
\
You should discover the source of the felled trees.","Felled trees can be found north-west of Marton.\
\
You should follow the trail of felled trees to discover what has been destroying them.","The Westward Path","Examined a broken tree (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completado","Trolls...a huge camp of them, too near the western route to Helm's Deep","Follow the trail of felled trees leading north-west","You have discovered a large encampment of trolls, too close to Marton for your comfort. This path is certainly not safe for the refugees.","Discover the source of the felled trees"},
[13337]={"You have left a mark upon those that remain in Madh-fushaum, having seen their fellows soundly defeated. You took them by surprise, and they will not soon forget this day.","The army gathered within Madh-fushaum is mostly comprised of ragtag Dunlendings, but they are mingled with Orcs and Uruk-hai. You should defeat as many as possible.","Defeat enemies in Madh-fushaum (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Defeat enemies in Madh-fushaum (0/24)","Defeated enemies in Madh-fushaum (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The White Hand Army in Madh-fushaum","Completado","There are far too many of the enemy gathered in Madh-fushaum for one to handle alone. However, those that remain will never forget the day the you stepped foot in Madh-fushaum.","The army that built and now resides within Madh-fushaum has destroyed Flodgeheld and is responsible for the attacks and siege on Brockbridge. The time has come to go on the offensive."},
[13338]={"The White Hand Reaches Far","The enemies in this part of the forest bear the mark of Saruman. You wish to expose the Wizard's fall to evil to anyone who will take notice, and thus collect tokens of proof as you slay his minions.","Defeat a servant of Saruman","Symbols of the White Hand are on the Orcs and Uruks at the pond near Oldheart's meadow.\
\
You should collect tokens of proof of the Wizard's betrayal while you rid the forest of his servants.","Collect proof of Saruman's folly (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Bring the evidence to Oldheart","Oldheart is in his meadow at the foot of a flower-spotted hill in Fangorn's western eaves.\
\
You should bring the proof of Saruman's wrongdoing to Oldheart.","Símbolo de la Mano Blanca conseguido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Ent stares with some shock at the burdens you present.\
\
'Sa...ru...man....'\
\
Oldheart understands.","The emblems and marks of Saruman are plain to see on all of his fell servants.\
\
You should collect tokens of proof of the Wizard's betrayal while you rid the forest of his servants.","Defeated a servant of Saruman"},
[13339]={"Has obtenido una piel de Huargo.","Rhovandis puede encontrarse en Idhobel, ubicado en el Eregion Occidental y al noreste de Echad Terthas.\
\
Duindil te ha pedido entregar la piel de Huargo a Rhovandis.","Habla con Duindil","Has obtenido una piel de Huargo. Esto debería ser útil para la investigación de Duindil. Duindil puede encontrarse en Echad Terthas, fuera de Caras Gelebren.\
\
Regresa con Duindil.","El sitio de los ataques de Huargos puede encontrarse al norte de Echad Terthas, al otro lado del río.\
\
Duindil te ha pedido derrotar cualquier Huargo en la zona.","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis en Idhobel.","'Los Huargos devastan las tierras al norte de aquí. Por favor ayúdanos a reducir su número.'","Huargos invasores derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis","Entrega la piel a Rhovandis en Idhobel","Le diste la piel a Rhovandis","El Acercamiento de la Mano Blanca","'Si no tienes asunto conmigo, déjame en paz.'","'Duindil y yo hemos estado intercambiando notas, vigilando el avance de la sombra en ambos lados del Glanduin. Crece, y seguirá creciendo hasta que la luz ya no pueda resistir.\
\
'Me alegra oír que Duindil ha progresado en su investigación de las incursiones más recientes. Esta piel pertenece a un Huargo, pero las marcas son lo que me preocupa. Permíteme examinarla más a fondo.'","Probablemente debas obtener una prueba de tu éxito.","'Esta piel. Debí haberlo sabido. Estos no son huargos comunes. Es tal como sugerían los rumores. Estas bestias atroces son una plaga para estas tierras. Temo que será difícil contener esta amenaza si no actuamos con rapidez.\
\
'Lleva esta piel a Rhovandis en Idhobel, al noreste de aquí. Sigue el camino principal y cruza el puente hacia el norte.\
\
'Ella ha estado vigilando en el Eregion Occidental. Y mis sospechas sobre esta nueva amenaza provienen de sus informes más recientes.\
\
'Esto debería resultarle valioso. Ella tendrá más información para ti.'","Obtén una piel de Huargo como prueba","'Muchos viajeros han sido atacados por huargos últimamente. He estado vigilando estas tierras durante bastante tiempo, y me preocupa que la sombra se torne cada vez más audaz. Debemos mantenernos vigilantes, o la sombra consumirá estas tierras.\
\
'Quisiera pedirte que investigues las colinas al norte, al otro lado del río. Ese es el sitio del ataque más reciente. Lo más probable es que encuentres huargos. Y cuando lo hagas, elimínalos.\
\
'Los rumores se han extendido y temo que la Mano Blanca se aproxima.'","Duindil está preocupado por los recientes ataques de Huargos en la zona."},
[13340]={"Flechas recogidas del cadáver del ciervo blanco","'Es un placer conocerte, ${PLAYER}. Justo le estaba contando a Indor mi última presa: un poderoso y noble ciervo blanco, como ninguno que haya visto antes ni volveré a ver. Lo seguí desde el Gladdalf hasta Nan Tornaeth, pero se asustó y perdí el rastro. Volví a encontrarlo en las Gargantas del Bruinen y lo seguí hacia el sur, hasta las colinas junto a este campamento. La luz se desvanecía y, mientras avanzaba hacia el oeste con yo detrás, le disparé varias de mis flechas. Sé que lo derribé, ${PLAYER}, pero no pude seguirlo en la oscuridad.\
\
'Está ahí fuera, amigo mío: ¡la mayor presa del cazador Wistan! Si encuentras el cuerpo del ciervo blanco, recoge mis flechas y la carcasa y tráemelas. Mi caza del ciervo blanco dará para más de un buen relato junto al fuego, ¡y habrá un lugar para ti también!\
\
'El ciervo se dirigía hacia el oeste, pero aun en sus últimos pasos habría evitado a los Gauredain o a los trolls silvanos. Busca el cuerpo al oeste de Echad Candelleth y entre los lugares donde habitan esas criaturas.'","Wistan te habló del ciervo blanco al que siguió por muchas tierras y cree haberlo abatido al fin, aunque no pudo encontrar el cuerpo.","Recoge flechas del cadáver del ciervo blanco","Wistan cree que la carcasa debe de estar en algún lugar al oeste de Echad Candelleth, entre los asentamientos de los Gauredain y los trolls silvanos.\
\
Wistan te ha pedido que busques la carcasa del ciervo blanco, al que siguió por todo el Bosque de los Trolls, y que regreses a Echad Candelleth con ella y con las flechas con las que lo abatió.","El Ciervo Blanco"},
[13341]={"You paid your respects to Edsig, Gárferth, and both of their families. Hereswith will appreciate your help.","Pick up Gárferth's shield","Acquired Gárferth's shield","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","Hereswith is inside Edsig's house, near the stables and centre of Forlaw. Hereswith is trying to stay busy with household tasks, and not focus on the events of the day.","Speak to Hereswith","Place Gárferth's shield at Edsig's grave","'Forlaw has lost too many good men of late. My husband was one of those men. Edsig, and his twin brother Gárferth, were beloved by this town. They protected Forlaw in the Battle at the Gate, but fell to that seemingly indestructible giant. \
\
'Please pay respect to my husband. Edsig loved his brother, and would do anything for him. It is a fitting tribute since Gárferth was always Edsig's protector. Please take Gárferth's shield and place it on Edsig's grave.'","One of the three widows is Hereswith. She cannot fathom life without her husband, Edsig, who fell in the Battle at Forlaw's Gate. However, she must find a way to go on as she is now raising their two daughters, Luba and Sigburga, alone.","Respects have been paid to Edsig.","Completado","Gárferth's shield is kept in the bedroom of Edsig's home.","'Hereswith was devastated at the funeral earlier, and I imagine she is having a hard time today. Please check on Hereswith, who is now the widow of Edsig.'","The Widow of Edsig"},
[13342]={"'Ebba cares for the orphans, but has no children of her own. Now, with Gárferth's death, she will find it hard to not feel alone. Please check on Ebba.'","Place Edsig's helmet at Gárferth's grave","Take Edsig's helmet","One of the three widows is Ebba. She is reeling from the death of her husband, Gárferth, who fell in the Battle at Forlaw's Gate. Her kindness is unwavering as she cares for the orphans, Ansith and Cuthmar, as if they were her own children.","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","'My husband, Gárferth, was a pillar of strength for Forlaw. Much like Thrymm, he was a great warrior, but nobody could match Thrymm. Gárferth's twin Edsig was wise beyond his years, and kept him focused on his goals and helping people. There was no one Gárferth cared for more than his twin brother.\
\
'Could you help me honour Gárferth? He and I would be honoured if you placed Edsig's helmet at Gárferth's grave.'","Edsig's helmet is kept on a shelf in the main room of Gárferth's home.","Acquired Edsig's helmet","Respects have been paid to Gárferth.","The Widow of Gárferth","Completado","You paid your respects to Gárferth, Edsig, and both of their families. Ebba will appreciate your help.","Ebba is inside Gárferth's house, near the centre of Forlaw. Ebba and Ansith are preparing dinner after the long day.","Speak to Ebba"},
[13343]={"Speak to Burghild","You paid your respects to Gársig for his family. Burghild will appreciate your help.","One of the three widows is Burghild. She and her youngest son Gárwald were devastated by losing three of their family in the Battle at Scylfig.","The path to the graveyard of Forlaw is just outside Forlaw's southern gate.","Take Gársig's sword","Acquired Gársig's sword","Respects have been paid to Gársig.","Place Gársig's sword at his grave","Gársig's sword is kept on the dresser in the sleeping quarters of Gársig's Home.","'Burghild was especially hard hit by recent events. She lost her husband and two sons in a matter of days! There is not much one can do for someone in her state, but nevertheless, please see if she needs anything.'","Completado","Burghild is inside Gársig's house on the western side of Forlaw. Burghild is doing anything she can to keep herself from falling apart entirely, as she must keep it together for her only remaining son.","The Widow of Gársig","'Are we doomed to wait for our death, as Gárwig is resigned to do? I don't fault him. He has lost everything he held dear. But today, we put what was left of our hope in the ground. Is there anyone left who could possibly save us from Núrzum? \
\
'I lost almost everything in the battle at Scylfig. My husband, Gársig, and our two sons; Humbald and Grimgar.\
\
'I cannot go back to the graveyard today. Could you pay respect to Gársig and place his sword at his grave?'"},
[13344]={"<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild was defeated</rgb>","You have successfully defended Reeve Fríthild from Cledwun and his minions","Use the camp-fire to summon Reeve Fríthild and her companions","'I confess that I am distressed, ${PLAYER}. The assaults on Stoke continue, and more Uruks and half-orcs arrive at Bardh-dorám every day. We must find a way of halting their advance....'","'The folk we fought in the south were of my own kind -- half of Dunlending blood, half with blood of the Mark, and likely from the Stonedeans. I find it offensive that they should be slaughtered so, and without the opportunity to explain themselves... all because they were not of pure Rohirrim blood.\
\
'The true evil comes from the west: the Dunlendings who invade our lands and fill the minds of my people with lies and deceit. The Dunlending captain who leads the invaders at Bardh-dorám oft leads assaults against the gates of Stoke or rides the plains with his guards... slay him, and the foe shall be put to flight.'","The Wild Captain","Reeve Fríthild's encampment lies to the west of Stoke.\
\
Reeve Fríthild instructed you to meet her party at her encampment.","The Council of Stoke determined that Reeve Fríthild would take to the field and lead her people against their aggressors, but now it must chose what front to focus upon.","Reeve Fríthild is at her encampment, west of Stoke.\
\
You should speak with Reeve Fríthild regarding the recent battle.","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! We have found Cledwun and have drawn him to this place... on your guard! Here he comes!'","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke.\
\
You should bring Dudsig's recommendation to Reeve Fríthild's attention.","Talk to Reeve Fríthild","Reeve Fríthild is in the Mead Hall of Stoke, east of her encampment.\
\
Reeve Fríthild has asked you to speak with her in Stoke.","<rgb=#FF0000>Reeve Fríthild must not be defeated</rgb>","'Grimmar is avenged, but I fear that the invasion has not been hindered. I will return at once to Stoke and consider our next action. Meet me there.'","Talk to Reeve Fríthild in Stoke","'I understand Dudsig's frustrations, but I do not ask pardon for protecting my Riding. I grant, however, that he is correct in that the true responsibility for this evil belongs to this Cledwun.\
\
'Therefore, I have decided to bring the justice of Grimmar down upon his barbarian head. Ordlac and I will set camp to the west... meet us there, and we will watch for Cledwun's appearance.'"},
[13345]={"'Speak not with me, but the Wild Huntsman instead.'","The Wild Huntsman is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
Having completed the Wild Hunt, you should return and speak with the Huntsman on behalf of the Dúnedain.","Hunt Lavaneth's spirit","Hunt Gwenaewen's spirit","Arassiel is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
One last spirit remains to be challenged. You should speak with Arassiel and hunt as she bids you.","The servants of the Wild Huntsman are in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
The Huntsman has bidden you complete the tasks that the his hand-maidens set before you.","Hunt Arassiel's spirit","Talk to the Wild Huntsman in the Huntsman's Hall","'One last hunt remains...speak with Arassiel.'","Having finally found an entrance to the court of the Wild Huntsman, you have come upon a number of powerful spirits -- some of whom look upon you with disdain. Now you must prove yourself before them if you are to find a way through the haunted forests of the Mournshaws for the Grey Company.","'Welcome to the Huntsman's Hall, mortal. There are few who dare this place in these latter days, and fewer still who stand here worthy of the fate that brought them hence. What brings you here, I wonder?\
\
'So you come in the name of the Dúnedain? Such glory as they held was forfeit in long ages past, and now they come to slink through our lord's realm as thieves might?\
\
'Yet it is not for me to judge, for the Huntsman has forbidden us to decide the fate of mortals here. Speak with him if you would buy passage for the lost lordlings of Númenór, if this is indeed their final call to battle.'","The Wild Huntsman resides in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You have been instructed to approach the Huntsman and ask that the Grey Company be allowed to pass through the southern Mournshaws into Dunland.","'So you have completed the Wild hunt. It seems there is some spark of valour left within your kind, ${RACE}. Very well then. The Dúnedain lordlings may pass through my forests unmolested. The spies of the Enemy will not see them here beneath these boughs.\
\
'But be wary nonetheless: evil things creep here now, though they be blind before my power, nor can I see what fate awaits the Men of the West as they march to meet their doom. But I do know this: few days remain before the decisive battles are joined. The eyes of the Uttermost West watch keenly the struggle here, for its outcome will soon be decided.\
\
'Take care, little one, and may your hunt be fruitful.'","Hunt Munfaeril's spirit","The Wild Hunt","'You have done your part...return to the Huntsman.'","'Ye are not welcome here, ${PLAYER}. The peoples of Middle-earth have proven their weakness as many times as needed to convince me of their folly.\
\
'Yet ever and again my lord in the Uttermost West has bidden me be patient. He tells me that it may yet come to pass that my bow need not be nocked ere the Darkness ends -- and yet I remain against that eventuality.\
\
'And so I challenge thee, remind me again of the myriad faults of Men, the hubris of the Elves, the greed of the dwarves, and the timid cowardice of halflings. Or prove to me that there is some mettle left in the folk of Middle-earth to take their fate into their own hands. Join my hunt and see it through, that I may judge you worthy or not.'","'Do the bidding of my servants, and I may grant your Dúnedain friends safe passage through my lands.'"},
[13346]={"'Three spirits you have faced and overcome. Now ye must hunt the fourth and last.\
\
'Go forth and prove thy wisdom, and the Huntsman's favour shall be thine, mortal.\
\
'Take my blessings with thee, for I would see the glory of the Free Peoples rekindled in the age to come, and much rests upon thee and thy friends.'","The stag-spirit of Arassiel dwells in the southern reaches of the Mournshaws.\
\
Arassiel has charged you with challenging her stag-spirit servant.","Arassiel is in the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Arassiel with news of your success.","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The Wild Hunt: Arassiel's Spirit","Challenge Arassiel's spirit","'You must challenge the stag-spirit to fulfil your task.'","'Thus concludes the Wild Hunt, ${PLAYER}. Thou hast proven thy virtue in this ancient test.\
\
'Thou hast earned the Huntsman's favour, but watch thy tongue in his presence, for his patience with the chatter of mortals is brief indeed.'","Talk to Arassiel at the Huntsman's Hall","Arassiel has sent you forth to challenge the last of the spirits of the Wild Hunt in a test of wisdom."},
[13347]={"Challenge Gwenaewen's spirit","Talk to Gwenaewen at the Huntsman's Hall","'Go forth and challenge the falcon-spirit.'","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","Gwenaewen's spirit dwells in the heart of the Mournshaws.\
\
Gwenaewen has charged you with hunting her falcon-spirit servant.","The Wild Hunt: Gwenaewen's Spirit","'You have faced my challenge and prevailed, ${PLAYER}. Go forth and complete the Wild Hunt and earn the Huntsman's favour, if you would win passage for your allies.'","'You would take up the Wild Hunt, ${PLAYER}?\
\
'I warn you that it is not for the faint of heart -- but if you would complete it, you must face an ancient beast, fast as the wind and of a tempest's mood. Seek it out, if you will, in the  heart of the Mournshaws and challenge it.\
\
'I shall await your return here, should you survive.'","Gwenaewen is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Gwenaewen and tell her that you have overcome her challenge.","Gwenaewen has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit as a test of quickness in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you."},
[13348]={"Lavaneth is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Lavaneth and tell her of your successful challenge against the boar-spirit.","Talk to Lavaneth at the Huntsman's Hall","'I see that the Huntsman has set you upon the Wild Hunt. I wonder if he truly believes you ready, or if he simply amuses himself at your expense?\
\
'So be it. You must take up my challenge and hunt an ancient spirit -- a wild beast whose strength and aggression may prove your end if you are careless or weak.\
\
'Its anger is such that the forest itself is awakened and wroth in its presence, so guard yourself well, lest you be overcome.'","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The Wild Hunt: Lavaneth's Spirit","'I see. So perhaps the Huntsman was right to gauge you in this matter. I must say that I have had my doubts.\
\
'Go then, ${PLAYER}, and complete the Wild Hunt. Should the Huntsman's favour fall upon you, then perhaps there is some hope that the strength of Men and the Free Peoples of Middle-earth will yet prevail against the darkness.'","'Go forth to my pool and challenge my spirit.'","Lavaneth's spirit roams in the north-west eaves of the Mournshaws.\
\
Lavaneth has bidden you hunt her boar-spirit.","The Wild Huntsman has tasked you with hunting the spirit servants of his hand-maidens.","Challenge Lavaneth's spirit"},
[13349]={"'Save those whom you can, endure the passing of those you cannot. Strive ever forwards if you wish to see light upon the world again, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Such is the way of this world.'","Munfaeril is at the Huntsman's Hall.\
\
You should return to Munfaeril and tell her of your success in the challenge of endurance.","As you kneel by the waters of the pool, a strangely mesmerizing glow emanates from the waters.\
\
Feeling dazed as you stare into the glowing water, you reach down to cup a handful and bring it to your lips....\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>This is a Solo quest, and cannot be completed with a Fellowship.</rgb>","The ox-spirit dwells beneath the north-east eaves of the Mournshaws.\
\
Munfaeril has bidden you challenge her ox-spirit servant.","Munfaeril has bidden you challenge an ancient spirit as a test of endurance in the Wild Hunt that the Huntsman has set before you.","Challenge Munfaeril's Spirit","Talk to Munfaeril at the Huntsman's Hall","'You must challenge the ox-spirit to complete your test.'","'You have endured much, but fate can be most cruel to those who dare stand athwart its path. Are you prepared to endure the Darkness ahead? The loss of allies and friends, of home and liege?\
\
'Go forth and seek the ox-spirit of endurance and face your challenge. Perhaps you are ready...perhaps not.\
\
'Look for the ox-spirit beneath the north-east eaves of the Mournshaws.'","The Wild Hunt: Munfaeril's Spirit"},
[13350]={"'Nuestros amigos de aquí hablan de bestias poderosas que vagan por el Bosque Salvaje, algunas de las cuales atacan a todo lo que se cruza en su camino con total desenfreno. He seguido el rastro de algunas de ellas y estoy convencido de que su comportamiento no es natural. Sea cual sea la enfermedad que ha llevado a estos animales a tal violencia, no debe propagarse al resto del bosque.\
\
'Vine aquí en busca de gloria, pero soy lo suficientemente sensata como para saber cuándo me superan. Si acabas con esas criaturas enfermas, me aseguraré de que los bardos conozcan tu nombre.'","Derrota a las legendarias bestias del Bosque Salvaje","Linnet Encinarroja se plantea el reto de cazar las presas más feroces y escasas del Bosque Salvaje.","Vuelve con Linnet","Linnet se encuentra en la zona centro-sur del Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Deberías volver con Linnet.","La caza del Bosque Salvaje","Las grandes bestias se encuentran por todo el Bosque Salvaje.\
\
Linnet te ha pedido que derrotes al ciervo blanco Gwengorn, al gran jabalí Brundurch, al alce negro Dúgar y al huargo plateado Lhudblath.","'Excelente trabajo. Puede que incluso llegue a admitir que se te da mejor la caza que a mí... Algún día.'"},
[13351]={"Habla con Aran Verduno","El Bosque Salvaje es una zona salvaje poco transitada, situada mucho más allá de los Campos de Bree, que rebosa de recursos sin explotar.","'¿Crees que eres capaz de convertirte en miembro de la Liga del Hacha? No lo tengo tan claro. Cuéntame las penurias que has sufrido en tu vida. Cuéntame las dificultades a las que has tenido que enfrentarte para llegar a fin de mes, ya sea por falta de comida en la mesa o de un lugar donde dormir.\
\
'Nosotros, en la Liga, hemos soportado mucho. Por eso nos hemos unido, para hacernos un nombre en nuestro hogar, en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.'","El Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree","Habla con Enid Picortiga","'La Hermandad de los Leñadores siempre está buscando nuevos miembros que se unan a nuestra causa. ¿Qué es lo que queremos lograr? ¡Pues la reconstrucción de Puente de Caballetes! Sí, este pueblo es muy importante para nosotros y ha pasado por muchas penurias y tristezas. Ahora queremos revitalizar Puente de Caballetes, convertirlo de nuevo en un próspero núcleo comercial y devolverle la alegría a la comunidad.\
\
'¿Qué me dices? ¿Te unirás a la Hermandad de los Leñadores y te sumarás a nuestra causa?'","'Soy Enid Picortiga, líder de la Liga del Hacha, ¿y tú quién eres? ¿Has venido al Embarcadero de los Comerciantes para comerciar o crees que tienes lo que hace falta para ser miembro de la Liga? Hemos conquistado gran parte del Bosque Salvaje, pero lo mismo ha hecho la Hermandad de los Leñadores, que reside en Puente de Caballetes.'","'Saludos. Soy Aran Verduno, líder de la Hermandad de los Leñadores. ¿Qué te trae por aquí, a Puente de Caballetes? ¿Has venido a echarnos una mano en el Bosque Salvaje? Debo decir que no somos los únicos que reclamamos este bosque. También lo hace la Liga del Hacha, que reside a orillas del Brandivino.'","Aran Verduno puede encontrarse en Puente de Caballetes y Enid Picortiga puede encontrarse en el Embarcadero de los Comerciantes.\
\
Deberías hablar con Aran Verduno y Enid Picortiga."},
[13352]={"'According to these orders, Ugrukhôr's forces make for Barad Cúron at all cost.\
\
'Lhaereth and her merrevail shall serve to harry Gothmog's forces, and Ugrukhôr's forces will shatter the doors of the Tower of the Crescent Moon. When that is done, there is little hope of escape for Gothmog, but it seems foolhardy to treat his downfall as a certainty.\
\
'There is little mention of the Rangers in these orders... so perhaps they do not think us a threat. That will prove to be a grave mistake, I think!'","You find nothing of note","The Will of Ugrukhôr","Deliver the orders from Ugrukhôr to Dornach","Ugrukhôr's Orcs have made a series of unsuccessful forays into the Circle of Despair, and Dornach hopes they might still hold orders from the Captain of Pit.","Search slain Orcs and Uruk-hai for orders from Ugrukhôr","Dornach can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You have found orders from Ugrukhôr carried by a slain Uruk-hai. You should deliver them to Dornach.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","Slain Orcs and Uruk-hai can be found in the Circle of Despair.\
\
You should search fallen Orcs and Uruk-hai for orders from Ugrukhôr.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>NOTE: If you lose sight of Dornach, you can summon him to your side with his horn.</rgb>","You find a crumpled missive!","'It seems Ugrukhôr's forces do not know what to make of the Circle of Despair.\
\
'Many of them have fallen to the cruel shades that linger here, and it is likely that some among those that have fallen might still carry orders from Ugrukhôr. If we can learn more of what he has planned in his war against Gothmog, we might better counter the both of them.\
\
'We should search the slain while we explore the Circle.'","Search slain Orcs and uruks for orders from Ugrukhôr"},
[13353]={"Wárr está probablemente inquieto por recibir noticias del resto de los enanos de la expedición. Un gran pasaje natural y serpenteante conecta la Sala Vigesimoprimera con la Cámara de los Cruces.","¡Has alcanzado la puerta occidental de la Sala Vigesimoprimera!","Wárr se encuentra en la Cámara de Mazarbul, al norte de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, muy al este de la Cámara de los Cruces.\
\
Líkmund te ha pedido que hables con Wárr y le transmitas lo que sabes sobre los acontecimientos recientes en la Cámara de los Cruces.","'Nos has sido de gran ayuda, ${PLAYER}, y si aún no has ido por allí, quizá quieras dirigirte al este hacia la Sala Vigesimoprimera y ver nuestro campamento allí. La Sala Vigesimoprimera fue uno de los mayores salones de toda Moria en su época, ¡y pronto volverá a serlo si tenemos éxito!\
\
'La forma más directa de llegar es por el camino que parte hacia el este desde aquí: puedes alcanzarla por el pasaje que sale hacia el sudeste desde la Cámara de los Cruces. Es una amplia vía construida en un pasaje natural sinuoso entre la roca. La suerte está de nuestro lado, pues parece que los trasgos apenas la utilizan, y el camino es tan seguro como cualquiera de los que hay aquí abajo... al menos mientras podamos vigilarlo.\
\
'Cuando llegues a la sala, busca a Wárr y cuéntale cómo nos va por aquí; es el supervisor de la expedición de la Sala Vigesimoprimera y estará deseoso de recibir noticias. Probablemente se encuentre en la Cámara de Mazarbul, justo al norte de la Sala Vigesimoprimera.'","Encuentra la puerta occidental de la Sala Vigesimoprimera","'¿Qué es esto? ¿Líkmund envía noticias desde las salas occidentales del Camino de Durin? Bien. Me alegra saber que sigue con vida, pues estas salas son mortales.\
\
'Supongo que has venido a echar una mano, y no solo a hacer turismo, aunque no faltan cosas dignas de ver.'","'Deberías hacer saber a Wárr, en la Sala Vigesimoprimera, cómo progresa nuestra expedición.'","El sendero serpenteante","Wárr se encuentra en la Cámara de Mazarbul, justo al norte de la Sala Vigesimoprimera, muy al este de la Cámara de los Cruces.\
\
Debes viajar hacia el este desde la Cámara de los Cruces, a través del gran camino serpenteante que conduce a la Sala Vigesimoprimera."},
[13354]={"Dornach can be found along the road to the north of Aelin Veren in North Ithilien.\
\
Dornach has asked you to sit near him, so he can blindfold you for your journey to Henneth Annûn.","Travel with Dornach to Henneth Annûn","Talk to Dornach at Henneth Annûn","Dornach is leading you to the hidden refuge of Henneth Annûn.","Dornach has agreed to bring you to Henneth Annûn, but only by secret ways.","The Window of the Sunset","<rgb=#FF00FF>Sit</rgb> near Dornach and allow him to blindfold you","'Halt!\
\
'Stay where you are, ${CLASS}, and tell me your purpose in Ithilien at once.'\
\
You inform the Ranger that you are a friend of Anborn, Mablung, and Damrod. You then tell him that you sought to join Thurindol at Henneth Annûn, but became separated after passing through Aelin Veren.\
\
'I see...\
\
'You know many of my brethren, but a resourceful foe might also learn such things...'\
\
You tell the Ranger of the great battle on the Pelennor Fields and of Faramir's rest in the Houses of Healing.\
\
'Lord Faramir lives still! I... I suspect that you speak the truth, for to know that my captain heals even now brings me great relief, and no foe of the Rangers would desire to give us even the faintest hope.\
\
'Still, you must do as I say if you are to come to Henneth Annûn.\
\
'Sit near me, and I will blindfold you. As long as you heed my words, I swear no harm will come to you. Only by hidden paths will I lead you to the refuge of Henneth Annûn.\
\
'Am I understood?'","Dornach pulls a cloth from his armour and begins to blindfold you...","Dornach can be found within Henneth Annûn.\
\
Dornach has led you to the hidden refuge of Henneth Annûn. You should now speak to him.","'I hope you did not hear too many chuckles as we arrived...'\
\
You inform Dornach that you heard a few, but did not understand their context.\
\
'I did not realize that so many of my brethren knew of you and your deeds. They think me a bit of a fool for taking such precautions with a friend of Anborn and Mablung. They all looked so amused as I led you in, but how was I to know? There have been too many travellers in Ithilien as of late...\
\
'I stand by my decision, and I hope you can understand the wisdom in it.\
\
'Welcome to Henneth Annûn, the Window of the Sunset... and our last refuge.'","You have arrived at Henneth Annûn!","'Do not fear, ${PLAYER}. The path to Henneth Annûn cannot be known to outsiders, but you will not come to harm.'"},
[13356]={"La Hueste Alada","'Tú ${PLAYERNAME:solo[m]|sola[f]} lograste lo que nosotros no pudimos, . Somos muy pocos, y sin Golodir para guiarnos, temíamos lo peor.\
\
'Sólo espero que tengas el valor para enfrentar una amenaza aún mayor. Debe haber alguien que guíe a estas Merrevail hasta nuestra puerta.'","Himbar está plagado por las merrevail y sus parientes, los murciélagos. Estas criaturas atacan sin piedad a los Montaraces de Gath Forthnír.","'¡Te estás ganando un nombre entre los míos, ${PLAYER}!'","Merrevail derrotadas en Himbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Bien hecho. ¡Sin embargo, aún queda mucho por hacer respecto a las Merrevail!'","Derrota a las merrevail en Himbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Las merrevail y los murciélagos cazan por todo Himbar, las tierras al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Thoriel te advirtió sobre las merrevail, monstruos alados al servicio del Enemigo. Atacan a los Montaraces y deben ser destruidos, junto con sus parientes menores, los murciélagos.","Thoriel te espera en Gath Forthnír, el campamento oculto de los Montaraces al este de Himbar.\
\
Has derrotado a los sirvientes alados del Enemigo y ahora puedes regresar para reclamar la victoria.","'Son días oscuros, ${CLASS}. La plaga de las merrevail acecha a mis hombres, los arrebata mientras duermen y los lleva a sus guaridas.\
\
'Encontrarás a las merrevail merodeando por las tierras de Himbar al oeste. Son los ojos de Angmar, observan nuestros movimientos y nos atacan. Mátalas ahora, antes de que regresen a Gath Forthnír.\
\
'Cuidado con los espías de las merrevail, sus parientes, los murciélagos.'","Murciélagos derrotados en Himbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Si deseas ayudarnos en nuestra lucha, viaja al oeste y derrota a los sirvientes alados del Enemigo.'","Derrota a los murciélagos en Himbar (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13357]={"'We are too late, ${PLAYER}. I wish it had not come to this....'\
\
Gimli sighs sorrowfully.\
\
'These were fine dwarves and they did not deserve such a sorry fate. Even after his downfall, Sauron has brought his ruin upon them. The Ring twisted Váskmun's mind, and now his people share his obsession with wielding its power. Whatever remains of it, that is...\
\
'Where now has Váskmun led them? To ruin, surely, but where in this blasted land does he now search for the dwarf-ring?\
\
'Wait a moment! Zôreth kept many notes in her own search for the Rings, didn't she? We are here in her old chambers, so let us search for them. With all that has happened, I should say they'll be of more use to us!'","'What have you learned? I beg you - let me see those pages!'\
\
You offer the pages of Zôreth's research to Spakorth, and he reads for a time. Upon reaching the notes about the terrible creatures beneath Barad-dûr, he pauses a moment. When at last he comes to the names of the four rings that bear Zôreth's marks, he seems at once stunned.\
\
'What is this?!'","After defeating the Firehorns within the Oath-taker's Horn, Gimli and Spakorth now hope to discover where King Greytooth has led his folk in search of the Dwarf-ring, Manthríf.","The Wisdom of Zôreth","This page makes reference to a passage within Barad-dûr that leads into the Mordath...","Spakorth can be found in Zôreth's chambers within the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
You have found much of Zôreth's research into the locations of Sauron's artifacts. You should deliver the pages you recovered to Spakorth.","Gather pages of research in Zôreth's chambers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","This page lists the names of the seven dwarf-rings, but four are marked with unsettling notes...","Zôreth's chambers can be found upon the highest level of the Oath-taker's Horn.\
\
Gimli has asked you to seek out Zôreth's research in her chambers of old in the hope that it might lead you to King Greytooth and the Firehorns.","This page makes note of the key King Greytooth bore during his imprisonment...","This page speaks of a vault within the depths of the Black Pits of Mordath...","Deliver to Zôreth's research to Spakorth in the Oath-taker's Horn"},
[13358]={"Find Dejeni's father Mulúgu by the throne of Furukzahar","Talk to Dejeni in the feast-hall of Furukzahar","'My father was sleeping? Yes, I should have realized. He is old, and while I treasure his wisdom and the tales he tells, he does spend much of his day sleeping by the throne. Of all the places in Furukzahar, that is his favourite chamber; he told me once it reminds him of the Court of King Jegín the Enduring, ruler of the Temámir Dwarves.\
\
'But I promised you would learn of the Battle of Azanulbizar! More than two hundred years ago, all the dwarf clans answered the summons of King Thráin of the Longbeards, and assembled on the very threshold of Khazad-dûm to answer the violence of the Orcs with vengeance of our own. My father Mulúgu, very young in those days, served King Jegín and fought bravely among the ranks of her Temámir in skirmish after skirmish. Many of those who followed her have now passed on, but my father Mulúgu still lives, as does the King herself; Jegín remains King of the Temámir in our lands far to the south-east.\
\
'Every clan of the dwarves suffered terribly during the war and at Azanulbizar, and King Jegín was not alone in demanding some recompense for the losses her people had suffered. For their service during the War of Dwarves and Orcs, the Longbeards granted to the Temámir some of the mountain strongholds they could no longer maintain, including this fortress. And so Furukzahar became a home for the Temámir. We have gotten along with the neighbouring kingdom of Gondor for many years, and I hope that will continue for years to come.\
\
'The Temámir have always been the wise voyagers of the dwarves, walking long roads and sailing the vast seas in search of opportunity, quite unlike those of other dwarf-families. Like them, however, we are also loyal to our friends and deadly to our enemies. It has been a pleasure to speak with you about my people, and perhaps some day I will introduce you properly to my father. Until then farewell, my fellow student of history!'","The Wise Voyagers","Dejeni's father Mulúgu fought in the Battle of Azanulbizar and will tell you about it if you find him by the throne of Furukzahar.","Dejeni, historian of the Temámir, is eager for you to learn more about his people during your stay in Furukzahar.","Mulúgu was sleeping, and you chose not to bother him. Perhaps Dejeni will tell you about the Battle of Azanulbizar instead.","Mulúgu sleeps peacefully on one of the benches, and you decide not to wake him","'Do you have an interest in history? You should hear my father Mulúgu's account of the battle from one who fought in it! Seek him by the throne of Furukzahar, for he often goes there to advise Hámisar about matters of importance to our folk.'","'Welcome to Furukzahar! The fortress has not had many visitors of late, due to the war in Gondor, but I am pleased to see that Hámisar has ordered the gates open once again. A number of noteworthy visitors have come to the fortress since then, friends from near lands and distant. This is a city of the Temámir, wisest of the dwarves, and we have made this home for ourselves far from our ancestral lands.\
\
'It was not always home to the Temámir. Are you familiar with the Battle of Azanulbizar? Yes, the last great conflict in the War of Dwarves and Orcs. Two hundred years ago it was, but it was so momentous a battle that it is still spoken of by all the clans of the dwarves, including my people! My own father Mulúgu fought in it and achieved glory, when he was young... I am fortunate he survived the fighting, or I would not be here today!\
\
'Do you have an interest in history? You should hear my father's account of the battle from one who fought in it! Seek him by the throne of Furukzahar, for he often goes there to advise Hámisar about matters of importance to our folk.'"},
[13359]={"Lirio Sotomonte está preocupada por el informe que le llevaste de parte de Longo Daegmund.","'Esta agua huele realmente horrible. Dime, ${RACE}, ¿por qué me la has traído?'","El pozo del pueblo de Entibo está en el centro del pueblo. Para encontrar el Manantial de Aguas Plateadas, toma el camino al este desde la plaza hasta la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, luego al sur hasta la casa del Condestable Bolger. El manantial está al sureste de allí.\
\
Saca un cubo de agua del pozo y llévalo a Cancióndesauce.","'Date prisa con ese cubo... ¡y no derrames nada!'","Cancióndesauce está en el Manantial de Aguas Plateadas.\
\
Sacaste un cubo de agua del pozo del pueblo de Entibo y lo llevaste a Cancióndesauce.","'¿Llevaste el cubo de agua a Cancióndesauce, verdad? ¿Qué dijo? ¿Puede ayudarnos?'","Saca agua del pozo del pueblo de Entibo","La Mujer Sabia","Lleva el cubo de agua envenenada a Cancióndesauce","'Hay una sabia llamada Cancióndesauce, que vive junto al Manantial de Aguas Plateadas. Puede que sepa cómo limpiar el agua contaminada. Saca un cubo de agua del pozo y llévaselo. Quizás sepa qué hacer.\
\
'Toma el camino al este desde la plaza del pueblo hasta la granja de la Viuda Froghorn, luego al sur hasta la casa del Condestable Bolger. El Manantial de Aguas Plateadas está al sureste de allí.'"},
[13360]={"Completed The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","'I never thought it would come to this, but perhaps we are more lost than I could have imagined. The Lords have agreed on a location for the Witan, and they are to have it here.\
\
'The Witan is an ancient rite, a meeting among the leadership of the plains. Calling it is a privilege granted only to the King. If they are actually having one on their own, they must have lost faith and trust in his leadership.\
\
'The Lords will be here soon, and we will be prepared for them. Today will be an important day in the history of Rohan, though I do not know if it will be remembered for good...or for evil.'","The Lords of the Eastemnet have decided to hold a Witan in the newly rebuilt Hytbold.","Complete The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","'Hytbold is under assault! Are you prepared to stand and defend it?'","Completed The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","The Witan is being held at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
The Lords of Rohan have decided to hold a Witan in Hytbold to determine the fate of the Eastemnet.","Edgal is at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
Edgal will want to speak to you about what has just happened.","Complete The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","'Are you prepared to attend the Witan?'","'We have suffered great losses...far beyond what I could have ever imagined from a single battle. However, Athelward and his betrayal was routed out.\
\
'Perhaps now we will have a chance to unite the Eastemnet.'","Edgal is at the Mead Hall of Hytbold.\
\
Hytbold has come under assault from an unknown enemy.","The Witan","Talk to Edgal"},
[13361]={"The Witan has begun and the Lords are discussing the future of the Eastemnet.","The Lords of the Eastemnet are holding a Witan to decide the fate of their lands.","The Witan has been interrupted. Something is happening outside","Attend and observe the Witan","The Witan: Lords of the Eastemnet","'As Hytbold is your town, upon your permission I will open the Witan, and we shall decide if we will stand up for our people and defend the Eastemnet.'","The Witan is being held in Hytbold.","The Witan has begun","'It is time to stand and defend all you have built here.'","Talk to Harding to signal the beginning of the Witan"},
[13362]={"Derrota al troll","Join Ingbert on the south flank","Defend the south flank","'Are you prepared to join us on the field of battle this day?'","Defend Hytbold at all costs.","Talk to Harding","Athelward has weakend the troll. Defeat it","Hytbold -- and the Witan -- have fallen under siege by a great army of the Enemy.","Defend the south flank with Ingbert, Fastred, Elfmar, and Mildrith","'Are you prepared to vacate the field of battle?'","'The battle is over, our enemy is routed, and Hytbold is secured. Can we really declare that we won this battle, though? Béortnoth, Radwig, Gísil, Athelward... we have paid a high price for this victory. Perhaps too high.'","Harding waits to speak with you.","Join Ides in the centre","Radwig and Gísil have fallen! Join Ides in defending the centre","Ingbert calls out for aid on the south flank","Defend the north flank with Harding, Gísling, Edgal, and Winsig","The troll has fallen. Hytbold is saved, though the cost was great.","Regroup with the Lords of the Eastemnet","The Witan: The Battle for Hytbold","Join Harding on the north flank","Defend the centre","Defend the north flank"},
[13364]={"Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Fourth Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Investigate the Fourth Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","Destroy the parchment containing the new pass-words","The Withered Tree","Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Second Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Deliver the new pass-word to Linharn at the Gate of the Citadel","'Show those pass-words to the guards and then destroy this parchment. Perhaps that will hinder the movement of the Withered Tree into the upper levels.\
\
'After the pass-words have been set, Lamlor wants you to find members of the Withered Tree urging dissent in the lower Circles? If you will be able to recognize them, I suppose. They have become more brazen in recent days, and now that the siege has begun I suppose they have nothing more to lose. They may be obvious to you now, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Go with haste, and remain loyal to the Council and to the Steward!'","'Supporters of the Withered Tree may be lurking within the lower Circles of the city. Search among the citizenry for such dangerous men!'","'The armies of the Enemy press close about the walls! How can there be any victory against such numbers?'","You destroy the parchment containing the new-passwords","Some of the citizens of Gondor in the Third Circle may actually be supporters of the Withered Tree.","Deliver the new pass-word to Doronir at the Gate of Stars","'There is no hope for us! The Council of Gondor and the Steward have failed, and doomed this city to fall! Can you not hear the harsh cries from beyond the walls?\
\
'We should have listened to the Withered Tree, and cast these leaders from the highest level of Minas Tirith! Perhaps then we would have been spared!'","Lamlor, the Captain of Tidings and Spy-master of Gondor, has come down to the gate in the First Circle.","Deliver the new pass-word to Garthor at the Gate of Stones","'We must open the gates! Have you not seen the parchments that the Withered Tree has placed throughout the city? The host of Mordor will spare us if we open the gates! The Orcs only want the Steward and the Council; they will allow the common folk to live if we let them in!\
\
'It is wisdom! We must open the gates! I will kill you if you try to stop me!'","Investigate the Third Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","'Already a new pass-word? Very well, ${PLAYER}. I recognize Húrin's mark, and I will see to it that no one passes this gate save those who know the pass-word: <rgb=#00FF00>Light of Hope</rgb>.\
\
'It is an appropriate pass-word. May we still possess that of which it speaks when the night ends!'","'Captain of Tidings is not my only title. I am also the Spy-master of Minas Tirith, and I know how a group like the Withered Tree operates. They must have gained some of the pass-words for the upper Circles of the city. Húrin must change the pass-words, ${PLAYER}. We have not used the current set for as long as usual, but in time of war three hours may seem like days! Ask him for new pass-words, and give them to the guards at the gates in the upper Circles. Then find members of the Withered Tree in the lower Circles and make them cease their hateful whisperings! I will meet you in the First Circle when you have proved successful.'","'You found supporters of the Withered Tree throughout the lower Circles of the city? I knew you would, ${PLAYER}. There are more and more of them with every passing hour! I have been kept quite busy keeping them away from the gate. Can you believe they think they will find mercy with the armies of Mordor? They are disloyal and foolish both!\
\
'Keep fighting for Gondor, ${PLAYER}, and I will do the same, 'gainst any and all foes!'","'Will the gates hold? I have never seen such evil, not in all my days!'","You carry new pass-words for the Gate of the Citadel, the Gate of Stones, and the Gate of Stars.\
\
Húrin has sent you to deliver new pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","You carry new pass-words for the Gate of the Citadel, the Gate of Stones, and the Gate of Stars.\
\
Húrin has sent you to deliver the new pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","'I have already written a new set of pass-words for the gates into the upper Circles of the city. Show them to the guards and then destroy this parchment. Perhaps that will hinder the movement of the Withered Tree into the upper levels.\
\
'After the pass-words have been set, Lamlor wants you to find members of the Withered Tree urging dissent in the lower Circles? If you will be able to recognize them, I suppose. They have become more brazen in recent days, and now that the siege has begun I suppose they have nothing more to lose. They may be obvious to you now, ${PLAYER}.\
\
'Go with haste, and remain loyal to the Council and to the Steward!'","'The siege is well and truly begun, ${PLAYER}. We must hope that our preparations were enough, and that the gate stands strong. It should hold the enemies outside at bay for some hours, I hope, but it is the enemies within our walls that concern me right now.\
\
'Look at the model of the city, and the scroll that now decorates it. This message is the work of the Withered Tree. 'The End Has Come?' That may be so, but I am going to ensure that the Withered Tree reaches its end before we do! Some member of that group gained access to the Dome of the Sun and committed this act while we were busy elsewhere.\
\
'I am the Captain of Tidings, and I send forth errand-riders throughout the city and to other parts of Gondor, but that is not my only title. I am also the Spy-master of Minas Tirith, and I know how a group like the Withered Tree operates. They must have gained some of the pass-words for the upper Circles of the city. Húrin must change the pass-words, ${PLAYER}. We have not used the current set for as long as usual, but in time of war three hours may seem like days! Ask him for new pass-words, and give them to the guards at the gates in the upper Circles. Then find members of the Withered Tree in the lower Circles and make them cease their hateful whisperings! I will meet you in the First Circle when you have proved successful.'","'The Steward is a fool! He has sold the city to our enemies, and now he asks us to die for him? None of us will see the dawn!\
\
'Die, ${PLAYER}, and know that the Withered Tree has ended your tale!'","Talk to Húrin in the besieged city, in the Dome of the Sun","'I believed we would soon need new pass-words. This is Húrin's mark, and now I will recognize only the new pass-word: <rgb=#00FF00>Flame of Victory</rgb>.\
\
'I hope it is our victory, and not the victory of Mordor, that this pass-word presages!'","'How will we survive the coming storm? Can there be any hope?'","Investigate the Second Circle of the city for supporters of the Withered Tree","Húrin is in the besieged city, in the Dome of the Sun.\
\
Lamlor believes you should ask Húrin to change the pass-words for the gates in the upper Circles of the city.\
\
<rgb=#00FF00>Minas Tirith is besieged! You may examine the model of the city in the Dome of the Sun to travel between states of the city.</rgb>","Talk to Lamlor at the City Gates, in the First Circle","With the siege now fully underway, the group calling itself the Withered Tree has become even more brazen. The Council of Gondor has tasked you with helping curb its rise.","'A new pass-word, already? I think the time for pass-words is behind us, ${PLAYER}! The Orcs of Mordor will not turn away from my gate because they lack the pass-word! But this is Húrin's mark, and I am bound to obey. The new pass-word will be: <rgb=#00FF00>Triumphant</rgb>.\
\
'But whose triumph will it be, I wonder?'"},
[13366]={"Receive the formal welcome of the Thane","'Ah... the famous wandering ${CLASS}! Your reputation precedes you, ${PLAYER}. I bid you welcome to Langhold. I am sure you will find plenty to keep you busy here, for we are often beset by ruffians and wild creatures.'","You have received a summons to go to Rohan, and the first city you encountered here was Langhold.","El Páramo","Thane Utred, leader of the northernmost town of the Wold, is in the Mead Hall of Langhold.\
\
You should speak with Thane Utred at once to receive a proper welcome to the town.","'We have had word from our kindred in the Great River of a heroic traveller who passed through Stangard. I can see that you are this same ${RACE} of whom such praise was spoken.\
\
'The Thane of Langhold would receive you in the Mead Hall without delay. This part of the Wold welcomes guests with open arms, but enemies of the Mark beware! It is my duty to warn you thus.'","'You should be able to find the Mead Hall without getting too lost. It is only the largest structure in Langhold.'"},
[13367]={"Dora Rizopardo piensa que un admirador suyo ha ido a intentar matar al líder exiliado de los lobos cerca de El Cruce.","'Ha habido rumores de un lobo viejo y marcado visto alejado del resto de la manada -- de hecho, al otro lado de la carretera de la guarida del lobo al norte de mi granja. No sé qué pudo haber pasado, pero creo que es justo decir que este viejo lobo debe ser su líder, exiliado por alguna razón.\
\
'Ahora, creo que he hecho algo terriblemente tonto, ${PLAYER}! ¡Mi vecino, Jolly Madriguera, es un verdadero hobbit gentil, y sospecho que es algo así como un admirador mío! Desafortunadamente, mencioné este asunto del lobo delante de él, ¡y él juró encargarse de ello!\
\
'Si no te importa, ¿podrías por favor encontrar a Jolly antes de que lo haga el lobo? ¡Me sentiría terrible si algo le pasara!'","'He oído que las cosas están volviendo a la normalidad en el Cruce. Eso es bueno.'","'Jolly tiene buenas intenciones, pero siempre intenta impresionarme. ¡Espero que lo encuentres antes que ese temible lobo!'","Jolly Madriguera puede estar tras el lobo que fue visto al otro lado de la carretera de la guarida del lobo, al norte de la granja de Dora Rizopardo.\
\
Dora Rizopardo está preocupada porque su vecino, Jolly Madriguera, puede estar en problemas y le ha pedido que lo encuentre.","Dora Rizopardo está en el centro de El Cruce.\
\
A Dora le alegrará saber que has rescatado a Jolly Madriguera y derrotado al líder marcado de los lobos que han estado acosando su granja y su pueblo.","'¿Dora estaba preocupada por mí? ¿De verdad? ¡Quizá sí siente algo por mí! Bueno, la verdad es que yo también estaba algo preocupado por lo que pasaría cuando ese lobo asomara el hocico por aquí.\
\
Estaba seguro de que mi cubo de carne de jabalí atraería a la bestia de su escondite. Bueno... Quizá no era carne de jabalí lo suficientemente apestosa...\
\
Limpiaré esto y podremos ir a hablar con Dora juntos...'","El lobo en exilio","'¡Les hemos dado una lección a esos lobos, sin duda!'","'¡Has rescatado a Jolly, ${PLAYER}, y gracias a los cielos! Sabía que ningún viejo lobo podría contigo, aunque no estoy seguro de que pueda decir lo mismo del pobre y bienintencionado Sr. Madriguera.\
\
Aún no he decidido si aceptar su invitación a cenar. ¡Sí, vino corriendo a pedírmelo antes de que regresaras!'","'¡Cuanto menos veamos lobos en la Comarca, mejor!'","'¡Qué emoción! ¡El Cruce no suele ser así, te lo puedo asegurar!'","Encuentra a Jolly Madriguera"},
[13368]={"Habla con Fimgris","Estos lobos parecen venir del sur de Thorenhad y sus huellas regresan hacia la carretera principal","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el sur, fuera de la carretera","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Parece que has encontrado la guarida de los lobos. Sientes un escalofrío, como si un gran mal estuviera presente aquí. Deberías avanzar más en la guarida","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el este por la carretera","La guarida continúa hacia el oeste, hacia los acantilados.\
\
Deberías buscar más adentro en las guaridas el origen de la presencia maligna.","El sendero gira hacia el sur, alejándose de la carretera principal","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad. Su rastro ha girado hacia el sur, alejándose del camino.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Fimgris está en el campamento de Narlinn, al oeste por la carretera principal desde la entrada a Drauglad.\
\
Deberías regresar con Fimgris con noticias de tu descubrimiento en Drauglad.","'Dices que te encontraste con un lobo de origen antinatural? No es algo que no se haya oído antes, pues los lobos son criaturas malignas desde el principio, burlas retorcidas de los grandes sabuesos de antaño. Los Huargos y los de su calaña están poseídos por espíritus viles, pero considero que esta criatura era en sí misma algún tipo de espíritu.\
\
'Hay que llevar la noticia a los hijos de Elrond...'","Ante ti ves un lobo como ninguno que hayas visto antes. Sin duda, esta terrible criatura es la fuente del mal que percibiste","Los lobos parecen venir de algún lugar al sur de Thorenhad. Su rastro parece continuar hacia el este a lo largo de la carretera.\
\
Deberías seguir a los lobos hasta su guarida.","Los lobos han dejado cadáveres casi enteros esparcidos alrededor de su guarida. Esto no es propio de ellos; algo terrible ocurre aquí","El sendero continúa hacia el este a lo largo del camino","Cazaste a los lobos en el valle entre la carretera y Thorenhad y descubriste que no eran de ese valle: venían de algún lugar al sur.","Has derrotado al lobo sombrío anciano","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hacia el sur, hasta la carretera principal","Los Lobos de Drauglad","Derrota al lobo sombrío anciano","Sigue el rastro de los lobos hasta su guarida","El lobo sombrío anciano está en Drauglad, al este del campamento de Narlinn y al sur de la carretera.\
\
Deberías intentar derrotar al lobo sombrío anciano.","Busca más adentro en la guarida de los lobos el origen del mal"},
[13369]={"Hojas de Reyes recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recolecta Hojas de Reyes (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Iach puede encontrarse cerca de la puerta oriental de Musgovilla.\
\
Regresa con Iach.","'Gracias. Con esto debería tener más que suficiente para seguir atendiendo a los heridos, quizá incluso con un poco extra por si surge una emergencia...'","El sanador Iach te pide recoger más Hoja de Reyes. Desafortunadamente, se encuentra en el hábitat de los lobos.","Las Hojas de Reyes de los Lobos","'¡Esta hierba de Hojas de Reyes hace maravillas! Estoy agradecido de que Meneldir compartiera su conocimiento con nosotros, aunque ojalá no hubiera esperado hasta una crisis para hacerlo. En cualquier caso, necesitamos más si esperamos continuar tratando a los heridos con tanta eficacia.\
\
'Ahora que sé cómo se ve, me doy cuenta de que las Hojas de Reyes crecen en abundancia en las Piedras Aullantes, al sureste. Te agradecería que recogieras más. Solo... ten cuidado con los lobos. He oído que están de mal humor últimamente.'","Habla con Iach","'Las Hojas de Reyes pueden encontrarse en las ruinas al sureste. ¡Ten cuidado con los lobos!'","Las Hojas de Reyes pueden encontrarse en las Piedras Aullantes al sureste de Musgovilla.\
\
Recolecta Hojas de Reyes."},
[13370]={"Derrota a Nûkhud, maestro de lobos","El maestro de los lobos","'¡Gracias a ti, los lobos de Saruman aprenderán a temernos!'","'La derrota de Nûkhud debería infundir terror en los corazones de los semiorcos en Barad Morlas. Ve ahora y asegúrate de su muerte.'","'Aunque tus esfuerzos contra los guardianes de lobos en Barad Morlas sin duda han obstaculizado los planes de la Mano Blanca, no han detenido su búsqueda. Están dirigidos por el jefe de sus guardianes, una criatura que se hace llamar Nûkhud, maestro-lobo.\
\
'Quisiera que regresaras a Barad Morlas y derrotaras a Nûkhud. Su derrota debería infundir miedo en los corazones de los semiorcos y sus aliados lobos.\
\
'Nûkhud fue visto por última vez merodeando más allá de las ruinas al oeste del puente en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de aquí. Ten cuidado, ${PLAYER}... seguro que es un enemigo peligroso.'","'¡Ah! ¡La muerte de Nûkhud debería hacer que los semiorcos lo piensen dos veces! Bien hecho, ${PLAYER}.'","Nûkhud, maestro de lobos derrotado","Nûkhud, maestro de lobos, se encuentra en Barad Morlas, al suroeste de Echad Eregion.\
\
Dornhador te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Nûkhud, maestro de lobos, el líder de los guardianes de lobos en Barad Morlas.","Dornhador se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al noreste de Barad Morlas.\
\
Debes regresar a Dornhador con noticias de la caída de Nûkhud.","Habla con Dornhador en Echad Eregion","Has derrotado a muchos guardianes de lobos en Barad Morlas, pero Dornhador aún tiene una tarea más para ti."},
[13371]={"Planted saplings (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'The time has come to plant these saplings which have been growing strong under my care. Will you help me by gathering the saplings and planting them within the forest? You may need to clear some of the dead trees, which are too far gone. Such is nature's way. \
\
'A wood of greenleaves is upon us, my friend. We need but put our elbows into it to see it through.'","Gathered saplings (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gather saplings (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Cleared dead trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Return to Radagast","Plant saplings in fertile soil (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Clear dead trees (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Fertile soil and dead trees can both be found throughout Eryn Lasgalen.\
\
You should clear away the dead trees and plant the saplings in fertile soil around the forest.","'The trees were planted well? Good, good! I knew I could count on you. Really, you must come and visit me in Rhosgobel one of these days!'","You should return to Radagast, who can be found at the tree nursery just outside of Felegoth.","The saplings Radagast has been cultivating are ready for replanting.","The Wood of Greenleaves","Saplings can be found just south of Felegoth.\
\
You should gather saplings that are to be planted around the forest."},
[13372]={"Lleva los hongos, la savia y la madera a Toly Tejonera","'¡Estos son tiempos extraños! La mayoría de los hobbits se mantiene alejados del Bosque Viejo, pero de eso depende mi sustento, y nunca había tenido problemas... hasta ahora. Las criaturas del bosque se han vuelto extrañas. Juro que las propias raíces de los árboles se movieron para hacerme tropezar, y ahora me he torcido el tobillo.\
\
'Todavía necesito recolectar algunos hongos: crecen en la parte oeste del bosque, entre el Claro de la Hoguera y la Colina Calva. Además, tráeme madera de mi pila de secado; la pila está al este, más allá del Claro de la Hoguera y un poco al sur. Y necesito savia del viejo arce que crece en la Colina Calva, al este del Claro de la Hoguera.\
\
'¡Con gusto te doy parte de mi pago! Toma mi balde para la savia, ¡y muchas gracias!'","Has recogido hongos sabrosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Gracias, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]}, por todo tu... ¿qué es esto? ¡Esta savia ya está mala! ¡Y mi madera sazonada... está podrida! Y estos hongos... son venenosos! ${PLAYERNAME:Amigo[m]|Amiga[f]}, no puedes ser ${PLAYERNAME:culpado[m]|culpada[f]}, pero con todo esto... ¡no me sirve de nada!'","Has recogido un balde de savia de arce","Los hongos se encuentran en la parte occidental del Bosque Viejo, entre el Claro de la Hoguera y la Colina Calva. La madera se puede recolectar de la pila de secado del leñador, al este del Claro de la Hoguera y un poco al sur. La savia se puede recoger del viejo arce que crece en la Colina Calva, al este del Claro de la Hoguera.\
\
Como Toly Tejonera, el leñador, se ha torcido el tobillo, te ha pedido que recolectes hongos, madera y savia de arce para él.","Recoge madera sazonada","Has recogido madera sazonada","Recoge un balde de savia de arce","Recoge hongos sabrosos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entrega la savia, la madera y los hongos a Toly Tejonera junto a los establos fuera de Casa Brandi.\
\
El Bosque Viejo te ha cedido su botín; ahora debes regresar con Toly Tejonera.","'¿Ya encontraste todo?'","El leñador se ha torcido el tobillo y no puede terminar sus tareas del día. Jura que el Bosque Viejo lo hizo tropezar a propósito.","El relato del leñador"},
[13374]={"La Hermandad de los Leñadores (Diaria)","'El éxito de la Hermandad de los Leñadores depende de cada uno de sus miembros, y no podemos permitirnos el lujo de estar desprevenidos cuando el pueblo de Puente de Caballetes depende de nosotros.'\
\
'Ayuda a la Hermandad de los Leñadores en nuestras tareas y me encargaré de que tus esfuerzos sean recompensados.'","Completa misiones en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has ayudado a la Hermandad de los Leñadores en sus labores por todo el Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree. Todos los miembros de la Hermandad te agradecen tu ayuda.","Misiones completadas en el Bosque Salvaje (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Completa misiones sin facción en el Bosque Salvaje para ayudar a la Hermandad de los Leñadores.","La Hermandad de los Leñadores necesita ayuda con sus actividades en el Bosque Salvaje de las Tierras de Bree.","Has ayudado a la Hermandad de los Leñadores.","Completado"},
[13375]={"The villagers of Arhaim have taken notice of your deeds","The chieftain of Arhaim, Garsind, has asked you to help the village.\
\
You should complete quests in Duskenvale to earn the villagers' trust. Lúfred, Ingelfled, Goslim and Tassila may have quests for you.","'Who are you, outsider? Why does that Elf look at me like that? I do not trust you. Go talk to the chieftain if you need something.'","'Very well, if they require proof of our noble intentions, they shall have it. See if anyone in the village requires our aid. I will do my best to explain to the chieftain why I have come.'","Talk to the suspicious villager","Complete quests in Duskenvale (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Baradal has asked you to gather information from the villagers in Arhaim.\
\
You should attempt to talk to the villagers.","'Don't go into the forest! The Shadow Hunter will steal you away, and you'll never be seen again!'","'A dwarf fort? There is one to the west, but you must not go near! The wilds are filled with terrible demons! Many have lost their lives seeking treasures of dwarf-make!'","Baradal can be found in Arhaim, the woodmen village in Duskenvale.\
\
You should tell Baradal that the woodmen need to be convinced of your trustworthiness.","'Demons, indeed. Superstitions will get us nowhere. Perhaps the dwarf ruin is inhabited by Orcs or the like, but it will not sway me from my charge. Prepare yourself, we will be heading west at once.'","Garsind can be found in Arhaim, the woodmen village in Duskenvale.\
\
You should talk to Garsind.","Garsind has told you of Shathur-munzu, the dwarf ruin to the west, and of the monster known as the Shadow Hunter.\
\
You should relay this information to Baradal.","Talk to the superstitious villager","'I am Garsind, Chieftain of Arhaim. You come seeking information, but we have no reason to trust you. Help the village, and we will help you. That is a fair exchange.'","'You have helped my people, so I will give you the information you seek. The dwarf ruin the Elf speaks of must be Shathur-munzu. It lies to the west. To find it, you must cross the territory of the Shadow Hunter.\
\
'No one has seen his true form and lived. The few that have returned to us say he is shadow itself, slinking among the trees. They describe huge glinting fangs and glowing eyes, and his children stalk the woods as well, terrible demons all.'\
\
'I understand the Elf's mission, but be warned: you continue at your own peril.'","Talk to Garsind","Talk to Baradal","Talk to the frightened villager","One of the villagers suggested that you speak to Arhaim's chieftain for information.\
\
You should talk to Garsind.","You have travelled with Baradal to the village of Arhaim. The Woodfolk of the village are distrustful of strangers, and will need to be convinced of your intentions.","The Woodfolk of Arhaim","'I was told that Arwen's brothers found Lady Celebrían in a ruined dwarf fort south of the Gladden Fields, and little else. It would be wise to gather more information before we venture into the wilderness in search of it. We should try speaking with the villagers here. They may be willing to share what they know.'"},
[13376]={"Defeated Shapag-hai at Lúlstrok (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Shapag-hai can be found at Lúlstrok in the north-western reaches of the Gladden Fields.\
\
You have encountered more of the Shapag-hai in the Gladden Fields. You should defeat them and drive them back into Moria.","After discovering an encampment of Shapag-hai in the Gladden Fields, you recall Mazog's last words in the Tower of Dol Guldur:\
\
'Wherever your people catch a glint of gold, or silver, or gems beneath the mountains there will be an Orc to slay him, every one. That is my vow! That is the word of Mazog!'\
\
It seems that Mazog's words have not gone unheeded by the Orcs of Moria. You should defeat them and drive them from the Vales of Anduin.","Even after his defeat at Dol Guldur, the word of Mazog has not gone unheeded by the Pûlpum and Shapag-hai who now seek to slay the dwarves of Middle-earth.","You have defeated many of the Shapag-hai at Lúlstrok.","Completado","Defeat Shapag-hai at Lúlstrok (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Word of Mazog","With many of the Shapag-hai slain or driven back into Moria, you have helped to make safe the Vales of Anduin."},
[13377]={"'El enano Huldar es un Maestro Rúnico de habilidad excepcional, y puede que sea capaz de enseñarte las runas de sanación más beneficiosas. Búscalo en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte. Si queda impresionado por tu comprensión de los misterios, puede resultar ser un buen maestro.'","Habla con Huldar y ayuda en la defensa de Othrikar","El Maestro Rúnico Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Se te ha dicho que el enano Huldar podría enseñarte sobre las runas de sanación más beneficiosas.","Los Maestros Rúnicos son expertos en la palabra escrita, y las palabras de sanación capturadas en forma rúnica son especialmente poderosas y útiles en un mundo peligroso.","'Aún hay mucho que no comprendes, , aunque seas ${PLAYERNAME:un Maestro Rúnico[m]|una Maestra Rúnica[f]} de considerable habilidad. Las runas de sanación pueden emplearse de formas aún más poderosas de lo que imaginas; sin embargo, necesitas un maestro que te instruya en estos usos.\
\
'El enano Huldar es un Maestro Rúnico de habilidad excepcional, y puede que sea capaz de enseñarte estos usos. Búscalo en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte. Si queda impresionado por tu comprensión de los misterios, puede resultar ser un buen maestro.'","Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
El enano Huldar ha accedido a enseñarte lo que sabe sobre las runas de sanación si lo ayudas a repeler un ataque de los Duramano.","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:Maestro Rúnico[m]|Maestra Rúnica[f]}! Te agradezco nuevamente por tu ayuda.'","'¡La palabra de un sanador es algo a lo que los Sabios prestan gran atención!'","'Estoy bastante avergonzado, ${PLAYER}, de haber sido herido de esta manera durante el ataque y tener que pedir tu ayuda así. Aun así, me alegra que hayas estado allí, ¡y a los demás enanos de Othrikar también!\
\
'Te enseñaré lo que sé de las runas de sanación, ${PLAYER}. Si nos guiamos por tu desempeño durante el ataque de los Duramano, ¡sin duda sabrás usarlas con eficacia!'","'¿Te dijeron que podía contarte más sobre las runas de sanación? No te mintieron, ${PLAYER}, pero me temo que ahora mismo no tengo tiempo libre. ¡Nos ha llegado el rumor de que los Duramano podrían estar planeando otro ataque!\
\
'Si nos ayudas durante el ataque, te enseñaré lo que sé sobre las runas de sanación cuando tengamos un respiro.\
\
'Dime si este acuerdo te parece bien.'","'¿Nos ayudarás a repeler el próximo ataque de los Hachetón, ? ¡Muy bien! ¡Siempre nos viene bien ${PLAYERNAME:otro Maestro Rúnico[m]|otra Maestra Rúnica[f]}!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión individual y no puede completarse con una Comunidad.</rgb>","La Palabra de un Sanador","Huldar está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Fuiste de gran ayuda para los enanos de Othrikar durante el ataque de los Duramano, y ahora deberías hablar con Huldar, tal como acordaron.","Habla con Huldar en Othrikar"},
[13378]={"'If we were to head north from Avabárg, that path would take us past the Beorninghús. Perhaps it would be in our best interest to check in with Grimbeorn. I do not wish to overstay my welcome in these lands!'","Habla con Grimbeorn","Grimbeorn's three tasks can be found in and around the Beorninghús as well as close by in the Beorninglands.\
\
You should complete the three tasks that Grimbeorn has asked you to complete.","Grimbeorn can be found at the Beorninghús.\
\
You should talk to Grimbeorn.","The path for Léothred leads north from Avabárg, where a stop at the Beorninghús is in order.","'Must I explain everything?! There is wood to be chopped right here at the Beorninghús. I am sure that ripe wild berries grow nearby in the Beorninglands. You will find them. As for the chickens, well the last place I saw them was in the bee pastures around us. Right then, get to it.'","Complete the quest \\qCatching Chickens\\q","Complete the quest \\qChopping Wood\\q","'You have returned. Is Léothred finished with his history? Oh, I see, he needs to travel north. I am afraid I can not allow that at the moment. I recently asked for one of the Eagles to gather news from the northern Beorning outpost of Limlók. I should think the Eagle will return with news in a day or two.\
\
'Now that you are here, why not pitch in with the daily work? There is always much to do. I need wood chopped, berries picked, and some lost chickens tracked down.'","Complete the quest \\qPicking Berries\\q","The Work is Never Done","'Ah, you have done all the day's work? Good, good! I would say you deserve a rest and some honey cake. Ha!'","Talk to Grimbeorn at the Beorninghús"},
[13380]={"'Machan es un cazador valiente. Quizás demasiado valiente. Juró regresar con las pieles de los sierpes de fuego de sus guaridas en Sálgaitë al sureste, y no ha regresado a tiempo.\
\
'¿Buscarías a Machan? Puede que necesite ayuda. Te recompensaré por tus esfuerzos...'","Machan el cazador debería estar en algún lugar de la región de Sálgaitë al sureste.\
\
El cazador Murdaigán te ha pedido que localices a Machan, que estaba cazando sierpes de fuego en Malenhad.","Encuentra al cazador Machan","Has encontrado a Machan","Machan el cazador ha desaparecido después de jurar regresar con las pieles de los temibles sierpes de Malenhad.","El cazador de sierpes"},
[13381]={"El Lamento del Cazasierpes","'La fortaleza de Helegrod ha estado vacía durante incontables años, ${PLAYER}, pero ahora se ha convertido en hogar de sierpes y dragonzuelos, un vil laberinto lleno de nidadas de huevos y custodiado por los ojos vigilantes de esas grandes bestias.\
\
'Pocos de los Corcur o de los Angmarim que hemos visto a la distancia parecen dispuestos a desafiar la fortaleza. Quizá el aliento ígneo de las criaturas mantenga a los Hombres alejados, o estén bajo órdenes estrictas de no molestarlas. Uno de los Angmarim, un hombre de gran importancia, parece no temer a los gusanos ni a los dragonzuelos y cruza a menudo las puertas de la fortaleza. Es curioso.\
\
'¡Pero no tenemos tiempo para meditar sobre ello! Ormulf Cazagusan, un enano de Othrikar en las Quebradas del Norte, debe ser informado de la infestación de gusanos y dragonzuelos que acechan ahora en la fortaleza de Helegrod. Él sabrá mejor que nadie cómo enfrentarse a esas criaturas. Ve con presteza y deja el misterio del Angmarim amigo de los gusanos en manos de Greip y mías.'","'Ormulf Cazasierpes y yo cazamos juntos los gusanos de Dol Dínen en tiempos pasados. Es de corazón firme.'","'La fortaleza central de Helegrod está llena de sierpes y dragonzuelos, y por tanto, de peligro.'","Sigrun te ha hablado de Ormulf Cazasierpes, un enano de Othrikar conocido por su valentía frente a los gusanos y dragonzuelos que merodean entre las grietas de las Quebradas del Norte.","'Ormulf Cazasierpes está en Othrikar, en las Quebradas del Norte, ${PLAYER}. ¡Él sabrá qué hacer respecto a los gusanos y dragonzuelos que ahora se arrastran dentro de la fortaleza interior de Helegrod!'","'Ormulf Cazasierpes es un buen enano, valiente y leal, aunque un tanto temerario.'","'No sé qué poder posee ese misterioso Angmarim para caminar sin daño entre sierpes y dragonzuelos.'","'¿sierpes en Helegrod? Sigrun hizo bien en enviarte conmigo, ${PLAYER}, ¡pues nadie sabe tanto de luchar contra esas criaturas terribles como yo!\
\
'Y me preocupa ese Hombre de Angmar del que hablaste. Si puede caminar sin sufrir daño entre dragonzuelos y gusanos, debe poseer un poder mucho mayor que cualquiera de los enemigos que he enfrentado. Pero la situación aquí, en las Quebradas del Norte, requiere toda mi atención, ¡y no puedo viajar hasta Helegrod! Ojalá fuera de otro modo, pero di mi palabra de que no abandonaría mi puesto, ¡y la palabra de un enano es más fuerte incluso que cadenas de mithril!\
\
'Espero que no llegue ningún mal a causa de esto, pero no puedo hacer nada más. Intentaré sacarlo de mi mente. Si estás dispuesto a combatir la amenaza de los gusanos y dragonzuelos de Helegrod en mi nombre, dame tu palabra de que lo harás y de que no te acobardarás ante el misterioso poder que ese Hombre parece manejar. Si no estás preparado para tal peligro, ¡no gastaré más aliento en ti!'","Ormulf Cazasierpes está en Othrikar, muy al oeste, en la zona norte-central de las Quebradas del Norte.\
\
Sigrun ha visto a la distancia que la fortaleza de Helegrod parece estar infestada de gusanos y dragonzuelos, y te ha pedido que consultes a Ormulf Cazagusanos sobre lo que debe hacerse."},
[13382]={"'Gracias de nuevo, ${PLAYER}. Tus esfuerzos contra los semiorcos no serán olvidados.'","Arzgât derrotado y nota recogida","'Has lidiado con la chusma de semiorcos aquí en el norte de Eregion, ${PLAYER}, pero su verdadero propósito apenas comienza a hacerse claro.\
\
'Recientemente, nuestros exploradores han indicado que un semiorco con cierta habilidad para entrenar a los sierpes está intentando someter a las viles bestias a su voluntad. Si tiene éxito, podría construir un ejército terrible en Eregion.\
\
'Regresa al este y busca una pequeña cadena montañosa al sur del camino a Rivendel. Entre ellas se encuentra Carchres. Si encuentras a Arzgât allí, pon fin a sus viles ambiciones.'","El guardián de los sierpes","Arzgât habita cerca de una pequeña cadena montañosa, en la ladera de Carchres al sur del camino a Rivendel, al este de Gwingris.\
\
Calelloth te ha instruido para que vayas y derrotes al semiorco Arzgât.","Los semiorcos ladrones de huevos están siendo supervisados por una criatura particularmente viciosa llamada Arzgât.\
\
Calelloth te ha pedido que te dirijas a la ladera norte de Carchres y mates a Arzgât.","'Arzgât fue visto por última vez en el lado norte de una pequeña cadena montañosa al este, justo al sur del camino a Rivendel.'","'¿Arzgât ha perecido? Es una noticia bienvenida, ${PLAYER}. Quizás el mal que ha causado pronto llegue a su fin.'","Lleva la nota a Calelloth en Gwingris","Derrota a Arzgât y registra su cuerpo"},
[13383]={"Brunanc derrotado","Habla con Daegennan en Gwingris","Los huevos de sierpe pertenecientes a la prole de Brunanc se encuentran en las laderas al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Daegennan te ha pedido que destruyas los huevos de los gusanos para atraer a su líder, Brunanc.","'¿Ha sido derrotado Brunanc, ${PLAYER}?'","Daegennan se encuentra en Gwingris, al noroeste del nido de Brunanc.\
\
Debes regresar a Daegennan con noticias de tu victoria.","El sierpe Brunanc y su prole aterrorizan los caminos que van de Rivendel a Gwingris.","El señor de los sierpes","'Gracias a tus esfuerzos, las entregas desde Rivendel se han reanudado. Gracias, ${PLAYER}.'","'No puedo agradecerte lo suficiente por lidiar con los sierpes que amenazan nuestros suministros de Rivendel, pero tengo otra tarea para ti que debería ser un paso más decisivo para proteger nuestras entregas.\
\
'Al sur de Pend Eregion en el este, hay un pequeño grupo de grandes colinas. En el lado norte de estas colinas hay una serie de madrigueras que los gusanos usan para criar a sus crías. Es aquí donde encontrarás a Brunanc, señor de los gusanos de Pend Eregion.\
\
'Quiero que lo atraigas destruyendo cualquier huevo que puedas encontrar en el lado norte de esas colinas. Atrae a Brunanc y mátalo, luego regresa aquí conmigo.'","'¡Excelente trabajo! Es poco probable que los sierpes se recuperen de su pérdida en el corto plazo.\
\
'Esto debería darnos un breve respiro para reunir nuestras fuerzas. Los Elfos de Gwingris te deben su gratitud, ${PLAYER}. Gracias.'","Derrota a Brunanc"},
[13384]={"Thrymm is concerned about the the damage the prolonged cold and snow has had on the Writhendowns, and would like to see how severe its impact upon the region has been.","Ponds can be found near Thrymm's Camp in the north-eastern Writhendowns.\
\
You should investigate the effects of the cold and snow around the frozen ponds of the Writhendowns.","This pond is frozen solid -- an unusual occurrence in this area of Middle-earth","Thrymm's face is lined with worry as you relay your findings to him.\
\
'I do not like this at all. I am a warrior, and I will drive the Orcs off. But we are a simple farming folk here in Wildermore. We live off of this land. Even if we are safe from Orcs, we cannot escape this strange weather.'","Investigate the effects of winter at Writhendowns ponds (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Speak with Thrymm Red-beard","This situation appears more dire than originally thought. Thrymm Red-beard will be waiting back at his camp.","The Worst Winter in Memory","Unused to this harsh new climate, this tree has died","'Wildermore has always been a green land with mild winters. We have never encountered snows such as these, as long as I can remember.\
\
'I must prepare these men for battle against Orcs, for they have crept in with the cold, but if you are offering your aid, you may investigate the effects of the weather on our land.\
\
'It cannot be coincidence that the Orcs and cold have arrived together.'","This creature appears to have succumbed to the cold, lying frozen in the snow"},
[13386]={"'Well I think that's quite enough adventure for me. I had a lovely time but I don't know how you have the energy to do this every day! This ought to give me enough inspiration to come up with new lyrics.\
\
'I'm going to take that whistle back from you now and head back to Halrax. Come find me when next you're in town.'","Anyâmat rushes to your side","The Would-be Shanty-man","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'Fightin' Freebooters'","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'Zamarzîr Treasure Hunt'","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and talk to her","Summon Anyâmat with the whistle and complete 'What if We Fight a Giant Crab?'","Anyâmat has asked you to help her become a great shanty-caller by bringing her along for some adventures.","Anyâmat runs off to await your whistle","Anyâmat harbours aspirations of being a great shanty-man.","Anyâmat has asked you to help her become a great shanty-caller by bringing her along for some adventures.\
\
While in Zamarzîr, use Anyâmat's whistle from your inventory to summon Anyâmat to your side.","'O'er the waves, we shall set sail...\
\
'To the horizon with the help of a tail... wind.\
\
'No no that's terrible!\
\
'Oh! You! Hello! My name is Anyâmat, the greatest shanty-man there ever was! Or at least, that's what they will call me some day. You see, I have such a deep love of song and the romanticism of sailing, but aside from the trip from Minas Tirith to here, I will confess I don't have much sea-faring experience.\
\
'What if I were to follow you around and observe you on your adventures? Perhaps that will provide the inspiration I need!'\
\
She hands you a small whistle.\
\
'Use this to call me as you travel about Zamarzîr. Oh, we are going to have so much fun together!'","Wait a moment"},
[13387]={"You should now work to heal the glade with the water of the Gilrain","Talk to Roamingstar","'I have brought you here because I sense goodness within you, ${RACE}. You seek an end to the conflict that ravages my lands and burdens my people, as do I.\
\
'Few still hold sincere belief in my sisters and fewer still have looked upon me in many long years. Of those that did... one came to regret it and I feel the shame still.\
\
'Now these wounds lay bare as the Men from Umbar pollute and defile my lands. My waters can heal their destruction, but I cannot do this alone. Aid me, and I shall aid you in turn!'","Search for a bucket near the mere outside Roamingstar's glade","The Wounded Glade","Heal war-torn earth near Roamingstar's glade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","War-torn earth can be found in and around Roamingstar's glade.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to aid her in healing the lands of Dor-en-Ernil.","Healed war-torn earth near Roamingstar's glade (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","A bucket can be found on the banks of the Gilrain in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
Roamingstar has asked you to aid her in healing the lands of Dor-en-Ernil by using the waters of the Gilrain.","DNT -- will not be seen","Saddened by the harm inflicted on the Gilrain's banks, Roamingstar hopes to heal the lands of Gondor before confronting the Ruthless Dead.","'You have done well to heal the wounds of Men, ${PLAYER}. These outsiders have no love for our lands or the people within and will not stop until it all lies wilted and dead, but I shall do all I can to hold them back from the innocent.\
\
'In all I have witnessed, few other times have come with such destruction and bloodshed. Let us hope that this one shall soon come to an end....'","Roamingstar can be found in her glade in north-eastern Dor-en-Ernil.\
\
You have healed the earth wounded by the war in Gondor and should now return to Roamingstar."},
[13390]={"Examine the chamber of Narchraw again","Escape Barad-dûr","It would seem Narchraw has indeed escaped Barad-dûr and perhaps escaped from Dor Amarth as well. At a dead end, you decide to examine your surroundings again in the hope that more information about Narchraw's destination surfaces.","Escape Barad-dûr and fight off Glúrugoth's guards.","Defeated Glúrugoth's guards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Where is Narchraw?'\
\
'Speak your purpose or die!\
\
'Very well then!'","You notice that on your way into the chamber you forgot to inspect the door","At a dead end, you decide to inspect your surroundings again.","You should escape while Glúrugoth is incapacitated","Talk to Lômazar","Inspect the chamber door","Defeat Glúrugoth's guards (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Barad-dûr is located in eastern Dor Amarth.\
\
You should examine the chamber of Narchraw again.","The Wrath of Glúrugoth","Lômazar can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth.\
\
You should speak with Lômazar.","'Narchraw has escaped then? This outcome may be the most favourable to all. It is very likely that Narchraw will return to his realm in Nan Ogol, the fell-vale in the far western reaches of Mordor. He may try to retake his former throne.'\
\
You ask Lômazar about the creature known as Narchraw.\
\
'It is difficult to explain in this tongue. He is neither man nor beast. He is both, yet something different.'","While you inspect the door, you hear footsteps coming around the corner"},
[13393]={"Approach the largest Mirk-huorn and attempt to speak with it","'Ah, ${PLAYER}! I am surprised to see you and very pleased that Nenedhel sent you back to me. When we passed through the swamp-lands, we all heard it -- the wrath and pain from deep within the hearts of the trees. The others took a wide detour to avoid the glade that seemed to be the very heart of malice.\
\
'I have a way with trees, but I fear these Huorns. I am no warrior, you see, so I have been watching their movements from this outlook. But perhaps you, a worthy ${CLASS}, will have better luck if you approach them.\
\
'Try to speak with them, but do not let yourself come to harm! You might be met with much hostility if you dare this task. Be wary, friend.'","The Wrathful Huorn stands in Sâd Meryrn.\
\
One Mirk-huorn does not seem as malicious as the rest; you should approach it and learn what you can from it.","'That is a sad tale, ${PLAYER}! Most of the creatures you will find as you wander this dour forest are evil and have always been evil. But trees have long, long memories, unlike the other children of this Middle-earth -- that is why they are so familiar to me, I think.\
\
'It is long since these trees have had any hope, but they have not forgotten the brighter days. Poor creatures! Perhaps I can devise a way to help them, if you could give me a moment to think....'","'Please hasten to Nífdir's aid, mellon. The Malledhrim will not march while one of their host remains behind. He can be found to the west of here.'","Habla con Nífdir en su campamento","'Go, ${PLAYER}, and speak with the trees of Sâd Meryrn if you can! But you must defend yourself if they attempt to attack you, for I would not have you come to harm on my behalf.'","Nífdir can be found at a small camp to the west of Estolad Mernael.\
\
Nenedhel has asked you once again to seek out Nífdir in the heart of the Drownholt.","This Huorn's twigs shiver menacingly as you draw near, but it does not attack. It is a very old tree, and its will is strong. Surely this is the tree that the Elves perceived as they passed Sâd Meryrn.\
\
As you stand at its roots, your mind is impressed with recollections of a fair green forest full of new life, and of a shadow of fear, ever-growing. The green life withers, blackens, and dies. Evil poisons consume the very water and air.","Approach Mirk-huorns (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Huorns can be found in Sâd Meryrn, due south of Nífdir's small camp. You should travel north and west to reach their glade.\
\
You should approach Huorns and attempt to speak with them, but Nífdir has advised you to be prepared for much open hostility.","Nífdir wishes to learn what ails the violent trees of the Drownholt, and help them if it is possible to do so.","The Writhing Glade","'My host of the Malledhrim will not be marching without Nífdir among them; I will wait for him, but he must not tarry long. Please make sure he knows this. If you can find a way to assist him so that his work does not delay him overlong, you will be helping me also.\
\
'Go back to Nífdir, ${PLAYER}, and lend what aid you can. I do not know if there is much that can be done for the poor inhabitants of this foreboding swamp. Many of my folk feel that there is no hope or heart left in the swamp-lands...but you should not despair.\
\
'The fear from Dol Guldur has thrown a long shadow across these once-fair woods, yet the power of the Elves is strong also. Do not give up hope.'","Nífdir is at the camp overlooking Sâd Meryrn from the north.\
\
You should speak with Nífdir and tell him of the strange conversation of sorts that passed between yourself and the Mirk-huorn.","Mirk-huorn defeated (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13394]={"Visit Ona Kay, the Eating Contest Announcer","Your tour has finished, but there is more of the town to be seen ahead....","'What do you want, O Revered Patron?  Have you come to show off your silver and gold and your fat belly?  Well, show away. We earn our meagre bread while you stuff your faces and play in the snow.\
\
'You are not welcome in Winter-home, not to all of its residents. We slave so that the Mayor can be rich, and so that he can throw marvellous parties for you all. Begone! We are not welcome among you, and you are not welcome among us!'","'Oh my goodness! I'm sorry, I'm only a servant. The Mayor surely doesn't need you to talk to me.\
\
'I'll not take up any more of your time; but perhaps you'd like to see the games we have to offer? It's a bit of a walk, but you should go talk to Cecil Voller, the host of the Snowball Fight.\
\
'Cecil is a ways north of the town, but I've heard that the snowball fights are well worth the trip.'","Explore the other corner of Winter-home, for it looks interesting","The mayor and his wife, hosts of the Yule Festivities, are in the centre of the celebration.\
\
You should speak with the mayor about the various events of the festival, for he wishes to greet all who arrive.","'Continue your tour of our beautiful town and the yule festivities!'","'Greetings, greetings. You are most welcome here, to be sure. I am Carolyn Goodnough, and my husband and I are very thrilled to have so many interested patrons and patronesses here at our Yule Celebration this year.\
\
'I'll not take up any more of your time; you should continue your tour around our beautiful town.'","Cecil Voller is at the Snowball Field, north of the town.","It seems you've not explored the south-west corner of the town; you should explore it before returning to the mayor....","You have arrived in Winter-home, and Guard Kember has offered to give you a tour of the many sights to be seen.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000> NOTE: This quest will be removed from your quest log when the current festival ends. </rgb>","'Oh, hello! Are you interested in the theatre? We have quite a show that we're putting on this Yule, and we've travelled all the way from the Shire!\
\
'Make sure you come back and see the show when you're finished with your tour of town. I know you won't be disappointed.\
\
'Well, I am the last stop on your tour. You should return to the mayor. Do come back to see our wonderful show!'","'Be careful if you wander in to the south-west corner of town... there's unsavoury folk among the workers.'","Mayor Goodnough is in the centre of town.\
\
You should return to Mayor Goodnough now that you have finished your tour of Winter-home's many events.","'Good day to you! I'm Ona, the Announcer for the first station at the Eating Contest. There are many more stations, of course, and I hope you will be able to visit all of them before you get too full.\
\
'What is a festival without wonderfully excessive amounts of food? I doubt you will find a bigger feast anywhere in Middle-earth than here in Winter-home.\
\
'You should speak next to the mayor. The Festival is here thanks to his efforts, and he wishes to greet all of his guests personally.'","Return to Mayor Goodnough to finish your tour","The mayor's wife is standing near the mayor, Winston Goodnough, watching over the festivities.\
\
The mayor's wife wishes to speak with you.","'Hello there! New to the Frostbluff, are you? Well, you've come at the finest time of year. I just hope you behave yourself, or else you'll be hearing from me!\
\
'I'm sure you'll have a wonderful time, though. The mayor employs me to see to it that everyone keeps the peace so that you patrons can have the best possible experience during Yule.\
\
'You should begin by speaking to Ona Kay who runs the Eating Contest. All good celebrations should start with a full belly of delicious food!'","Speak with the mayor's wife","A man standing near Gareth Rust beckons you.\
\
You should speak with the man near Gareth Rust.","Speak with Cecil Voller at the Snowball Field","You should return to the mayor, for you have now seen more of Winter-home than intended....","Speak with someone from Winter-home to continue your tour","The Eating Contest begins at Ona Kay, the first Announcer.","Speak with the hobbit-announcer about the Theatre Event","'You should speak with Cecil Voller at the Snowball Field... I must go now!'","Speak with the man near Gareth Rust; he seems to have something to say","'Hail, Travelling ${CLASS}! Welcome, welcome! And pray, tell all your friends to come visit as well! We have spared no expense for this Yule's festival.\
\
'I am Winston Goodnough, the mayor of this town. Please, stay as long as you like! Try everything, taste everything!\
\
'Why don't you go take a look at all the events? Come back and see me when you have explored.'","You are welcomed with open arms to the fine Yule Festival of Winter-home","You should find your next destination on your tour of the town. Maybe one of the helpful servants knows what you should look at next?","'Go ahead, my friend. Familiarize yourself with the activities of a fine Yule. You may want to speak with Mayor Goodnough first.'","'Ah, hello! I see you've trekked down to the Snowball Field during your tour of town! This is where folks come to throw freezing missiles at one another. \
\
'I hope you'll come back when you've finished your tour. The mayor is most particular about all patrons seeing all there is to see before they get distracted....'","'Please, pardon my friend. It is a hard winter, and there is less money and bread to go around than usual. But that is no cause to be uncivil to the guests of this town.\
\
'Life can be cruel here, as you can plainly see, but I count myself among the lucky. Those who cannot work go even colder and hungrier than we.\
\
'I am sure you are more welcome among us than Gareth implied; we are a friendly folk. You are welcome to visit any time you wish. I hope you enjoy your time in our little town!'","'So, you've seen all of the events? We have a wonderful little town, do we not? Perfectly suited for all your festival needs. You don't need to waste any more time talking to me. Go enjoy! Eat! Play! Watch theatre!'","Mabel Mitford has suggested that you might like to visit the Snowball Fight","The hobbit-announcer of the travelling theatre can be found in Winter-home.\
\
You should speak with the hobbit-announcer about the Theatre event.","'When you speak again with Mayor Goodnough, you shouldn't mention talking to me... it would not be to your benefit.'","'You should head to the theatre and speak with the representative of G.L.O.B.E.'","The Yule Celebration of Winter-home","'Perhaps Daley will speak with you, but I have no desire to.'","Speak with the mayor of Winter-home about the festivities","'You should speak with Mrs. Goodnough. She has had a great hand in putting together this year's festival!'","'Speak with Ona Kay at the Eating Contest to begin your tour!'","The workers here seem bitter cold, and their faces show signs of hunger"},
[13397]={"The Uruk-hai named Matum, Urbhár, and Golb can be found somewhere within the Ring of Isengard.","'Ah, that was just the thing. Nothing like a good fight to make you feel alive!\
\
'I have some more names for you: Matum, Urbhár, and Golb. Choose one of them to punish and remind the other two why it is wisest not to cross the boss. You'll find any of them within the Ring.'","You have defeated your opponent","Morflak's lackey is waiting to speak with you.","The Uruk-hai named Gluthrak, Hoital, and Farmak can be found somewhere within the Ring of Isengard.\
\
Morflak's lackey wants you to fight one of the Uruk-hai named by his boss in order to quell any challenges to his power.","Morflak's lackey has some more names for you.","'You heard the boss. As long as we stay in line, he treats us well and everybody wins. But if you cross him, that's another story.\
\
'Sometimes, an Uruk-hai gets it into his head to try and displace Morflak. He thinks maybe if he's in charge, he'll get noticed by the Old Man and be given some treat. He sees what Morflak has, and he wants it. It's in his best interest not to cross the boss, but he forgets it.\
\
'The boss gave me the names of some of the boys who might be planning on acting up. The names are Gluthrak, Hoital, and Farmak. Let's pay one of them a visit. That might put the fear of Morflak back in the others, where it should be. I could use a fight.'","'Do you think you can defeat me? You have no chance! Morflak should have come himself and done his own dirty work!'","Morflak's lackey has given you the names of some Uruk-hai his boss does not trust and that he wants you to punish.","Find and challenge Gluthrak, Hoital, or Farmak","Their Best Interests","Find and challenge Matum, Urbhár, or Golb","'You're one of Morflak's new pets, are you? Well, the way I see it, you'll end up the same way as all the others. And maybe I'll be the one to help you on your way!'","'That was well done! Morflak will be pleased, and when Morflak is pleased, it is good for all of us.'","Talk to Morflak's lackey"},
[13398]={"Apuñala sacos de huevos trampilla con colmillos roñecarne (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sacos de huevos trampilla apuñalados con colmillos roñecarne (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Sacos de huevos roñecarne apuñalados con colmillos trampilla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Envenena los sacos de huevos de las arañas","Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados","Sus Propias Armas","Los sacos de huevos de las proles trampilla y roñecarne se encuentran en los Valles Trenzados, en la esquina noroeste del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados","Los sacos de huevos de las proles trampilla y roñecarne se encuentran en los Valles Trenzados, en la esquina noroeste del Bosque de los Trolls Norte, al norte del campamento de Thoroniel.\
\
Deberías usar los colmillos que recogiste para envenenar los sacos de huevos de las arañas de los Valles Trenzados\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Las proles de los Valles Trenzados podrían ser vulnerables al veneno de la otra.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Nota: Esta misión está pensada para una comunidad completa.</rgb>","Apuñala sacos de huevos roñecarne con colmillos trampilla (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13399]={"Culang el montaraz ha sabido de un gran tesoro enterrado hace mucho tiempo por un terrateniente Dúnadan y quiere recuperarlo antes de que lo encuentren los saqueadores de tumbas.","Percibes algo en lo que no reparaste en tu primer examen del hito de piedra... un pequeño bloque extraíble de la parte trasera del mismo hito.\
\
Dentro del hueco hay un libro mohoso.","'¿Otro acertijo? ¡Espero que este sea el último! ¿Cómo dice? \
\
   \\qEl final de tu búsqueda está donde empezaste.\
   Mi tesoro siempre estuvo ahí, pero en él no reparaste.\\q\
\
'No sé qué significa esto, ${PLAYER}. ¿El tesoro está en el primer hito que encontraste, el que estaba en la encrucijada de Canadiach? No sé. Quizás el tesoro ya había sido encontrado, después de todo.'","Lleva el libro mohoso a Culang","'¡Te doy las gracias de nuevo por recuperar el tesoro, ${PLAYER}!'","Libro mohoso recuperado","'Los tesoros de verdad son los que no esperamos encontrar.'","La inscripción de este hito de piedra es apenas legible, pero consigues descrifrar estas palabras:\
\
   \\qEl final de tu búsqueda está donde empezaste.\
   Mi tesoro siempre estuvo ahí, pero en él no reparaste.\\q\
\
Este nuevo acertijo podría revelar la verdadera localización del tesoro.","Encuentra la solución al acertijo","'¿Qué es eso que tienes ahí? ¿Un libro, que se encontraba bajo el hito de piedra? ¡Asombroso, ${PLAYER}! ¡Dámelo para que lo examine!\
\
'El tiempo no ha sido amable con este libro, pero parte de él parece ser legible, el diario de algún miembro de la familia del terrateniente. Una hija, si no me equivoco.\
\
'Esto es un verdadero tesoro, ${PLAYER}... ¡un fragmento de nuestro pasado! ¡Esto es mucho más valioso que lo que esperaba que encontraras! Te agradezco tus esfuerzos y la fatiga de tanto caminar... ha sido un largo viaje, pero este hallazgo sacado de la oscuridad merece la pena. Por favor, acepta esta recompensa junto con mi más sincero agradecimiento.'","'¿No has recuperado el tesoro, ${PLAYER}?'","El tesoro podría estar bajo otro hito de piedra en algún lugar de Evendim, según dice este acertijo:\
\
   \\qEl final de tu búsqueda está donde empezaste.\
   Mi tesoro siempre estuvo ahí, pero en él no reparaste.\\q\
\
Debes examinar el hito cuando lo encuentres en busca de alguna pista sobre la localización del tesoro.","Culang está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, al oeste de la encrucijada de Canadiach.\
\
Has encontrado un compartimento en el interior del hito de piedra que creías que marcaba la localización del tesoro y has recuperado un libro mohoso del escondite. Deberías llevar este libro a Culang.","Historia de una ida y una vuelta"},
[13401]={"Viaja a La Carroca","Viaja a Erebor, La Montaña Solitaria","¡Estar más cerca de grandes plumas te llena de orgullo!","¡Llega a Ciudad del Lago!","Erebor es un lugar encantador.","Historia de un Cacareo ida y vuelta","¡Un oso que no come gallinas es sin duda un buen oso!","¡No hay dragones aquí!","El Granjero Arenilla no está mirando. Ahora es tu oportunidad de escapar.","¡Será mejor que sigas tu camino, ya que este lugar parece peligroso para las gallinas!","Este puede ser un momento maravilloso para explorar la Tierra Media.","Encuentra la Casa de Beorn","Siéntate en el trono bajo la montaña","Bueno, entonces es hora de volver a casa","Los Valles del Anduin son un lugar encantador."},
[13402]={"'A powerful and ancient weapon, you say, found here in the hills of Thrór's Coomb, which is to be used to stand against the Wizard Saruman? I may indeed be able to help you.'","Frithgeir is at Zudrugund in Thror's Coomb in Enedwaith.\
\
Ariene found a powerful weapon in the hills of Enedwaith and believes Frithgeir may know where to find more.","Talk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund","'Saruman is growing in power by the day. The clans here have all fallen to him and soon they will be forced to march to war for him. They will be slaughtered in the plains of Rohan for no reward, while the Wizard reaps all the benefit.\
\
'My clan, the Boar-clan, has done all it can to stand against him, but our efforts have not yielded any true victory. We simply do not have the power to stand against him, but I believe I have found a way. In the hills to the north, past the borders of our lands and into the forests of Thrór's Coomb, I found a weapon. It is ancient and powerful. If there are more to be found, then we might be able to stand against the Wizard.\
\
'However, I do not know where to look for more such weapons -- there were no others in the area around this one. Seek out Frithgeir the Dwarf at Zudrugund and learn whether he can help us. He has been sympathetic to our cause in the past.'","There is Gold in the Hills","There are tales of powerful weapons and armour in the hills of Enedwaith that might prove to be useful in the battles to come.","'If we can find more of these weapons, we can make an earnest stand against Saruman of Many Colours.'"},
[13403]={"'Bienvenido, ${PLAYER}. Veo que has elegido establecerte en Falathlorn. Quizás desees realzar la belleza natural de tu hogar, y con gusto puedo ayudarte en ese empeño.\
\
'Además de las mercaderías y existencias generales que ofrezco, también me gustaría obsequiarte un pequeño regalo para celebrar tu decisión de unirte a nosotros.'","'Ah, ${PLAYER}, me alegra que hayas encontrado un buen lugar donde vivir. Me temo, sin embargo, que el mobiliario pueda parecerte un poco, bueno, austero.\
\
'Deberías hablar con Barthavron en la plaza del mercado de la comunidad. Él te ayudará en lo que pueda para que tu hogar sea más cómodo.'","Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero se vería aún mejor con algunas bonitas decoraciones.","Barthavron se encuentra en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Falathlorn.\
\
Barchiril te ha enviado para que hables con su amigo Barthavron.","No hay lugar como el hogar"},
[13404]={"'Lamento si ha sido desagradable, pero realmente era lo mejor.\
\
'Esto permitirá a los enanos ocuparnos de nuestros asuntos sin tener que lidiar con tantos gusanos de las profundidades en las Profundidades Llameantes.'","Los gusanos de las profundidades de las Profundidades Llameantes se han estado reproduciendo a un ritmo alarmante. La población de estas criaturas debe mantenerse bajo control.","Ölfun está en el Cruce de las Cenizas, al sureste de Tanunshush.\
\
Ölfun querrá saber que has destruido muchos huevos de gusanos de las profundidades, contribuyendo a reducir su población en las Profundidades Llameantes.","Ahí está el problema","'Los gusanos de las profundidades se han estado reproduciendo a un ritmo alarmante últimamente. Por fin hemos localizado el lugar donde guardan sus huevos.\
\
'Los mantienen en un sitio al que llamamos Tanunshush. Dirígete al noroeste hasta llegar a La Escalera Ardiente, justo antes de las Obras Hidráulicas. Tanunshush se encuentra justo al norte de allí.\
\
'Destruye varios de sus huevos para que podamos mantener bajo control la población de gusanos de las profundidades en las Profundidades Llameantes.'","Destruye huevos de gusanos de las profundidades en Tanunshush (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has destruido un huevo de gusano de las profundidades (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Puede que no sea el acto más noble, pero es la única forma de mantener bajo control la población de gusanos de las profundidades.'","Los gusanos de las profundidades guardan sus huevos en Tanunshush, al noroeste del Cruce de las Cenizas, al norte de La Escalera Ardiente.\
\
La población de gusanos de las profundidades debe mantenerse bajo control destruyendo sus huevos.","Habla con Ölfun en el Cruce de las Cenizas"},
[13405]={"'Tal y como pensaba, son robustas y tienen la punta afilada necesaria para perforar agujeros en piedras gruesas. Los orcos prefieren usar sus espadas y hachas. \
\
'Es una mala noticia, sin duda, pero pone de manifiesto un problema que lleva mucho tiempo acosando a los Duramano y que probablemente podamos detener aquí y ahora. Logi se encargará del asunto con nuestros desafortunados primos. \
\
'Quiero centrarme en los orcos y asegurarme de que fracasen en cualquier propósito malvado que tengan aquí.'","Recolecta picos enanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hay algo dentro de estas murallas, algo valioso. ¡Puedo sentirlo! Probablemente los orcos también lo sientan, y por supuesto los Duramano lo saben, pero parecen más interesados en las ruinas del norte y el oeste.\
\
'Los orcos son buenos fabricando armas y herramientas rudimentarias, pero si mi intuición es correcta, necesitan herramientas específicas. Apuesto a que eso es lo que les están dando los Duramano.\
\
'Persigue a los orcos y averigua qué están obteniendo de los Duramano. Vuelve cuando tengas pruebas de que hay algo entre los Duramano y los orcos en estas ruinas.'","Entrega los picos enanos a Henir en Iorvinas.","Picos de enanos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los orcos se pueden encontrar en Iorvinas.\
\
Henir cree que hay algo de valor dentro de las ruinas donde se esconde. No cree que los orcos puedan conseguir los materiales por sí mismos y quiere saber si los Duramano les están proporcionando las herramientas necesarias para su trabajo.","'¿Has encontrado algo? Estoy seguro de que los orcos que habitan estas ruinas habrán dejado algún tipo de evidencia de su presencia.'","Preocupados por la posibilidad de que los Duramano y los orcos hayan llegado a algún acuerdo, los enanos de una expedición a Rivendel han venido hacia el oeste para investigar unas ruinas.","Hay algo en estos pasillos"},
[13407]={"Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún mejor con algunas buenas decoraciones","Rambi se encuentra en la plaza del mercado dentro de la residencia del Mansión de Thorin.\
\
Rúni te ha dicho que hables con su amigo Rambi sobre cómo adquirir bienes para tu casa.","'Ahora que vives en un hogar adecuado, ¿probablemente querrás decorarlo un poco? Mi buen amigo Rambi sin duda puede ayudarte; lo encontrarás en la plaza del mercado dentro de la comunidad. ¡Rambi tiene muchas cosas finas a la venta!'","'¡Saludos, , y ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} a nuestra excelente comunidad! Por supuesto, un hogar no es realmente un hogar hasta que ha sido debidamente amueblado y decorado.\
\
'¡Ahí es donde entro yo! Para que la gente comience, me gusta ofrecer un pequeño obsequio a nuestros clientes más nuevos; considéralo un regalo de inauguración de mi parte para ti.'","No hay lugar como el hogar"},
[13408]={"'¡Saludos, , y ${PLAYERNAME:bienvenido[m]|bienvenida[f]} a las residencias de Cavada Grande! Sin duda querrás empezar a hacer tu nuevo agujero un poco más cómodo. Bueno, yo soy el encargado de ayudarte con eso.\
\
'Para empezar, tengo un pequeño obsequio de inauguración para ti.'","Ahora tienes un sitio al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún mejor con unas buenas decoraciones.","'No te decepcionarás con tu nuevo hogar, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo mío[m]|amiga mía[f]}, pero viene con muy pocas comodidades. Para eso, deberías hablar con Rolf Ciñatiesa, a quien puedes encontrar en la plaza del mercado dentro de la comunidad.'","Rolf Ciñatiesa está en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Cavada Grande\
\
Andy Tejonera te ha pedido que hables con Rolf Ciñatiesa, un decorador que podría ayudarte a amueblar tu hogar.","No hay lugar como el hogar"},
[13409]={"'Bueno, ahora que tienes un lugar donde vivir, ${PLAYER}, sin duda deberías considerar comprar algunos muebles y otras comodidades para él. Te recomiendo que hables con Bill Ramaje. Puedes encontrar su tienda en la plaza del mercado de la residencia... estoy seguro de que podrá ayudarte.'","'¿Cómo? ¿Compraste una casa? ¡Maravilloso!\
\
'Lo siento, pero las cosas han estado terriblemente ocupadas por aquí últimamente, y tengo algo de trabajo atrasado que resolver, ¡pero no temas! ¡El viejo Bill siempre cumple con sus clientes, sí señor!\
\
'¡Aquí tienes! Un pequeño obsequio para que empieces con tu flamante nuevo hogar.'","Ahora tienes un lugar al que llamar hogar, pero sería aún más agradable con algunas buenas decoraciones.","Bill Ramaje está en la plaza del mercado de la residencia de Bree.\
\
Nan Pollomadera te ha enviado a hablar con Bill Ramaje con la esperanza de que pueda ayudarte a amueblar tu casa.","No hay lugar como el hogar"},
[13412]={"A piece of falling stone nearly misses you!","Examine the first site","Examine the third site","These braces are under stress","Return to Birási","The stone has shifted, but the brace is holding","This wall is stable","Examine the fourth site","Examine the fifth site","'You return! What have you found?'\
\
You tell him which spots look like they need immediate attention.\
\
'Ah, thank you! I will send workers to these locations once my head stops spinning. With a reminder for them to all wear their helmets. Ooof.'","Though the repair crew has worked tirelessly to shore up the walls and crumbled buildings of the Harlond, time, weather, and underlying issues can still lead to instabilities.","An angry buzzing fills the air!","You have examined Birási's assigned inspection sites. You should let him know what you found.\
\
Birási is in the Harlond.","This wall looks structurally sound","They All Fall Down","Examine the second site","Examine the sixth site","Birási has asked you to inspect the braces supporting walls and other stonework at various sites in the Harlond.","'Hail, ${CLASS}. You must forgive me for not rising to greet you, as I am not steady enough yet on my feet. My name is Birási, and it falls to me to do a daily check of the integrity of the various buildings and walls across the Harlond. Many are the bolsters we have placed to brace the damaged stones, but stone shifts as weather and time work their ways.\
\
'I was inspecting this location when a stone came loose and struck me on the head. I should wear my helmet, I know. I was in a rush, though. Do not tell Dingási, eh?\
\
'I am in no shape to continue today's inspections, but if you have the time, I could pass this task on to you. 'Tis an easy one, and I can tell you what to look for. I do advise you wear your helmet. What say you?'"},
[13413]={"Free the farmers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","'Those good men did everything they could to maintain those farms, and tried to help Forlaw the only way they knew how. But, the enemy has made sure our farms remain smouldering, and those brave men were lucky to live through their ordeal. I will try to help them find work here inside the city.\
\
'Your efforts to help them were courageous, and they owe their lives to you. The people of Forlaw appreciate when we can see good men return alive, when so many do not.'","Return to Forlaw and speak with the farmers (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Free the farmers (0/4)","The farmers have been through enough and should be freed from captivity. Their captor, Laudh, must be close by. Perhaps the farmers can sneak out unnoticed once freed.","After being freed, the farmers have likely made their way back to the safety of Forlaw. You should head to the tavern since after surviving such an ordeal, some ale would look promising to anyone.","'Thank you, ${CLASS}. We would not have made it without you.'","They Deserve a Better Fate","Farmers freed (${CURRENT}/${MAX})","Speak with Gárwig in Lornsettle","Gárwig is in Lornsettle, the mead hall of Forlaw. He will be happy to know the farmers have safely returned.","'I think you have saved me three times over by now, or have I lost count? Thank you, ${PLAYER}. We all owe you our lives.'","The farmers of the Fallows were captured by the Lieutenant of Núrzum at Thrymm's Farm. If they still live, they are probably being held captive somewhere in Gárnoth's Farm.","The farmers survived their capture at Thrymm's Farm. They appear to be relatively healthy, all things considered. After all they have been through, they should at least have their freedom.","'Things didn't quite go as planned, but we appreciate your help through it all.'","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}, for everything you've done for us. We will find a way to make a living here inside the city.\
\
'My heart lives out on the land, on the plains... I was stubborn to give up that freedom before, when it was probably more wise to run to Forlaw. Trying to salvage that farm almost got us all killed. I would rather live, even if it's within these walls.'"},
[13414]={"Habla con Gufi en Menem-berej","'¡Por el hacha y la espada, ${PLAYER}! Te pido mil disculpas. No me había dado cuenta de lo mal que estaban realmente las cosas aquí abajo. Necesitaremos toda una guarnición para limpiar estas minas como es debido.'","Gufi se encuentra en el campamento de Menem-berej, en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gufi para viajar hasta el posible yacimiento minero.","Gufi se encuentra en el campamento de Menem-berej, en el centro de las Vetas del Cuerno de Plata.\
\
Deberías hablar con Gufi sobre la expedición de exploración.","Habla con Gufi para viajar a la mina","A pesar del miedo que sentiste, Gufi quiere que explores una antigua mina que fue asaltada por la expedición de Balin.","'¡Muy bien entonces! Ya verás; ¡encontraremos vetas de mithril y racimos de gemas en un santiamén!'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Esta es una misión en solitario y no se puede completar con una comunidad.</rgb>","'Según nuestros mapas y los propios registros de Balin, hay una mina a lo largo del túnel donde empezaste a preocuparte por tu seguridad.\
\
'Deberías intentar superar tu inquietud y ver qué puedes encontrar allí de la expedición de Balin. ¡Espero que esa mina tenga un gran potencial para nuestros propios enanos!\
\
'Avísame de lo que encuentres, ${PLAYER}. ¡Cuento contigo!'","Minaron demasiado rápido"},
[13415]={"'Los saqueadores de tumbas no pueden aguantar eternamente. Pronto serán derrotados.'","Naethmunn está en el campamento de montaraces de la isla de Tinnudir, en Evendim, al suroeste de Barad Rath.\
\
Debes informar de tu victoria sobre Jabo Sotosombrío a Naethmunn.","'¿Sotosombrío ya no existe? Estas son excelentes noticias, ${PLAYER}, y empiezo a creer tu historia.\
\
'Todavía no es suficiente, me temo, pero quizá estés diciendo la verdad. ¡Si tienes éxito en mi siguiente tarea, quedaré libre de duda!'","'Calenglad es un montaraz sabio que ha visto muchos veranos, y confío en su juicio. Si no está convencido de tu honestidad, yo tampoco.\
\
'Al norte de Tinnudir, en Tyrn Fornech, una antigua roca se alza entre las más altas colinas. Desde las alturas, Jabo Sotosombrío, el líder de una de las bandas de ladrones que nos han causado tantos problemas, planea las actividades de su banda.\
\
'Si quieres probar ante mí y Calenglad que eres de confianza, terminarás con Jabo Sotosombrío. Encontrarás Barad Rath, la plataforma plana de piedra en lo alto de las colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al noreste de Tinnudir y al norte de Tham Ornen. También encontrarás allí a Jabo.'","'Barad Rath está sobre una de las colinas más altas de Tyrn Fornech, al noreste de Tinnudir y al norte de Tham Ornen. Encontrarás a Jabo Sotosombrío allí, planificando las acciones de su banda de saqueadores.","Naethmunn te ha pedido que derrotes a Jabo Sotosombrío, un líder de los saqueadores de tumbas que a menudo planea sus actividades desde lo alto de Barad Rath, en Tyrn Fornech.","'Jabo Sotosombrío ya no existe, y siento que los vientos empiezan a soplar a nuestro favor.'","Jabo Sotosombrío planea los ataques de su banda desde lo alto de Barad Rath, un promontorio plano de piedra sobre las altas colinas de Tyrn Fornech, al noreste de Tinnudir y al norte de Tham Ornen.\
\
El montaraz Naethmunn te ha pedido que encuentres y derrotes a Jabo Sotosombrío, el líder de una banda de los saqueadores de tumbas que han sido una plaga para los montaraces de Evendim durante mucho tiempo.","Espían desde las alturas"},
[13417]={"Habla con Eliot Bencroft en Rantost","'Rantost es nuestra y las reliquias aquí han sido aseguradas. Mientras hablamos, los saqueadores de tumbas están huyendo... con suerte, no volveremos a oír de ellos.\
\
'Has realizado una hazaña digna de ${PLAYERNAME:un héroe[m]|una heroína[f]} hoy; no olvidaremos tu ayuda pronto. Acepta esta recompensa con mi agradecimiento, .'","'Tienes mi agradecimiento por tus acciones en Rantost, ${PLAYER}.'","'¡Saludos, ${PLAYERNAME:Héroe[m]|heroína[f]} de Rantost, ${PLAYERNAME:amigo[m]|amiga[f]} de los Montaraces y ${PLAYERNAME:enemigo[m]|enemiga[f]} de los saqueadores de tumbas!'","Habla con Leighton Kipps y ayuda a los Montaraces","'¡La información que me trajiste me dice que ha llegado el momento de lanzar un asalto sobre Rantost, !\
\
'He enviado aviso a los Montaraces, y están esperando nuestra señal para comenzar el ataque. Cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]}, habla con Leighton Kipps y él enviará la señal.'","'Habla con Leighton Kipps... él dará la señal a los Montaraces cuando estés ${PLAYERNAME:listo[m]|lista[f]}.'","Leighton Kipps está en el campamento de los espías en el sureste de Rantost.\
\
Leighton Kipps está esperando para dar la señal a los Montaraces para asaltar Rantost.","El Azote de los Ladrones","'¡Los Montaraces necesitarán tu ayuda si quieren recuperar Rantost!'","Eliot Bencroft está en el sureste de Rantost.\
\
Eliot Bencroft se alegrará de saber que los Montaraces pudieron recuperar sus reliquias y que los espías pueden regresar a Ost Forod.","Un grupo de Montaraces está preparado para lanzar un asalto sobre la isla de Rantost, actualmente en manos de saqueadores de tumbas."},
[13418]={"Recompensa del Cazador de Ladrones","'Has hecho tanto por nosotros que mis hermanos y yo hemos pensado en una forma de recompensarte y servir a nuestros propios fines al mismo tiempo.\
\
'Hemos sabido que los ladrones han ocultado parte de su botín en una diminuta isla cerca de la desembocadura del Brandivino en el lago Evendim. Creemos que el botín reunido allí contiene no solo reliquias robadas, sino también monedas robadas. Si asaltas ese escondite, quizás podamos hacer tu recompensa una parte justa de la riqueza recuperada; el resto planeamos devolverlo a la gente respetuosa de la ley de Ost Forod.'","Saqueadores de tumbas y bandidos abundan en Evendim, saqueando las tumbas de los Dúnedain.","Esto parece que podría ser una trampa...","'Tu noticia me apena más de lo que puedo expresar. Agradezco que hayas logrado superar la emboscada. ¡Pero hay otras noticias urgentes...'","'¡Una emboscada! Me alegra que escapaste de la trampa. Pero debo pedirte que regreses y derrotes a Ned Leggett si puedes.'","El campamento de los ladrones está en una pequeña isla en la desembocadura del río Brandivino en el lago Evendim.\
\
Tras haber derrotado a los bandidos en la isla de Rantost, te han enviado a otro pequeño campamento de bandidos, con la esperanza de que puedas recuperar más tesoros robados.","'Por favor, busca ese campamento en el Camino de los Reyes.'","Has descubierto una emboscada de saqueadores de tumbas.","Recupera el tesoro robado","Balchelos está de regreso en Tinnudir.\
\
Has logrado superar la emboscada de los saqueadores de tumbas y debes informar del incidente a Balchelos."},
[13419]={"<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el patio</rgb>","Reclama el callejón embrujado","Reclama el patio","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el Ayuntamiento y liberado el sur de Bree.</rgb>","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado la Puerta Sur de Bree.</rgb>","Con la Puerta Sur recuperada, puedes avanzar hacia el patio sur y el Salón de Subastas, un centro crucial de comercio.","Reclama el Salón de Subastas","El camino hacia el norte ha sido bloqueado y atrincherado con enormes montículos de nieve; tendrás que dirigirte al oeste por el callejón embrujado.","Solo queda reclamar el Ayuntamiento y ver ondear sobre él la bandera de Bree.","Robo y Travesura","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el callejón embrujado.</rgb>","Recuperar la Cárcel proporcionará un lugar adecuado para encerrar a quienes queden cuando la ciudad vuelva a estar bajo control de los Pueblos Libres.","Mientras los Montaraces del Norte estaban distraídos en el Sur, unos bandidos aprovecharon la oportunidad para arrebatar el control de Bree....","Reclama el Ayuntamiento","eclama la Cárcel","Sin el control del patio, no puedes esperar asaltar y recuperar el Ayuntamiento.","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado la Cárcel.</rgb>","'Queda mucho por hacer. El mundo está asediado por el mal, pero por esta noche, ¡podemos celebrar una gran victoria!'","Reclama la Puerta Sur","<rgb=#00FF00>Has recuperado el Salón de Subastas</rgb>","El primer paso para expulsar a los bandidos de Bree es recuperar la Puerta Sur y obtener acceso a la ciudad."},
[13423]={"You have left the Kinta bracelet in the strongbox at Laivárth, where it can be retrieved by one of the people to whom it should be entrusted.","You find a bracelet engraved with Kinta writing clutched in the hand of the corpse","You pry open the webbed cocoon, but the spiders' victim has already succumbed to death. You decide to rid Narchásh of these many-legged killers, and to seek for any survivors.","Defeated spiders at Narchásh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thieves Among the Webs","The nearest grove of the Kintai should be Laivárth, located to the north-east of Narchásh. The Elves there will have a strongbox in which you can deposit the Kinta bracelet.","Examine the cocooned body","Leave the Kinta bracelet in a strongbox at Laivárth, the Kinta grove to the north-east","The spiders of Narchásh snare their victims in cocoons.","Examine another cocooned body at Narchásh","You have decided to combat the spiders of Narchásh and search for any survivors of their deadly hunger.","Completado","Defeat spiders at Narchásh (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You add the Kinta bracelet you found at Narchásh to the strongbox, leaving it with your wish that it will be claimed by one of the Kintai who will admire its beauty and find meaning in its craftsmanship.","At Narchásh, as elsewhere in Middle-earth, folk run afoul of the spiders, losing their lives and their possessions."},
[13425]={"Completado","Collect trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog","Although the halls of Khazad-dûm still teem with Orcs, you have done much to avenge the defilement of your kin and cousins' remains at Azanulbizar. The Orcs will take no trophies from the Haban'akkâ!","Thieves and Trophy-takers","Trophy-beards are carried by the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog, before the East-gate of Nud-mekhem at Azanulbizar.\
\
You should collect trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak.","Collected trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Orcs of the Ufúrzrak take the beards of fallen dwarves as trophies to bear into battle against the Haban'akkâ.","Collect trophy-beards from the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have collected many trophy-beards from the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog.","Encamped in the very shadows of Nud-mekhem, the East-gate, the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak have laid claim to Khazad-dûm in the name of their chieftain, Azog. It has been discovered that many of the Orcs have taken to severing the beards of slain dwarves to carry as trophies into battle at Azanulbizar. It is a dishonour to the dead and all the dwarves of the Haban'akkâ!\
\
You should collect trophy-beards claimed by the Orcs of the Ufúrzrak at Muru Azog."},
[13426]={"'Brave warrior! Stout ${CLASS}! You have done well, indeed! You do more to protect us than those White Hand guards and Overseers in Galtrev....'","Thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp","'The Draig-lûth is cruel, ${PLAYER}. Be wary when you fight them!'","Defeated Dragon-clan thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Fraid at his waggon","Fraid awaits you near his broken waggon in Pren Gwydh, not far from the Galtrev Lumber-camp.\
\
You should speak with Fraid and let him know that the woods are a little safer now.","'Help, Duvodiad! It was the Dragon-clan, those fiends. They have grown bold of late, probably because the young men and warriors went away.\
\
'This is meant to be the daily wood shipment, but as you can see, there has been an attack. Curse the Draig-lûth!'","Dragon-clan brigands and thieves roam the Galtrev Lumber-camp.\
\
You should defeat a number of Dunlending thieves to secure the Galtrev Lumber-camp.","A shipment of wood from the Galtrev Lumber-camp was meant to arrive at Galtrev quite a while ago, but it was held up when the waggon-driver was attacked by hostile Dunlendings.","Defeat Dragon-clan thieves at the Galtrev Lumber-camp (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13427]={"Recoge artefactos númenóreanos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los corsarios umbari están robando artefactos del lado de los Ambarûli del Muro de Telperiën.","Derrota a los corsarios ladrones para evitar que desentierren más artefactos y recoge las reliquias que ya han descubierto para devolverlas a los Ambarûli.","Artefactos númenóreanos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota a los corsarios (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Ladrones de la Antigüedad","Corsarios derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Regresemos a Iridír.'"},
[13428]={"Gorhir can be found in Halach in south-eastern Upper Lebennin.\
\
You have recovered many of the stolen goods and should now return them to Gorhir in Halach.","'Thank you, ${PLAYER}. I shall see these goods brought to the others at once.\
\
'We shall hide them away in secret places the next time the Haradrim dare attack Halach, for they cannot steal what they cannot find!'","Haradrim archers can be found to the east and north-east of Halach in Upper Lebennin.\
\
Gorhir has asked you to recover goods stolen by Haradrim archers in their last raid against Halach.","Recovered stolen goods from Haradrim archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thieves of Harad","'We have endured numerous assaults by the Haradrim now, traveller.\
\
'Many of our number were killed in their earliest attacks, and more still fled to Tumladen, but I shall not be moved. However, their archers are swift on their feet and in the midst of the last assault, they stole many goods of great import to us, including some of our food-stores. Our people are determined, but we cannot maintain a defence if we are starved.\
\
'If you can recover them from the archers, we shall be able to hold out for weeks to come.'","The Haradrim in Upper Lebennin have taken much from the people of Halach, and now these folk would see it returned.","Deliver the recovered goods to Gorhir in Halach","Recover stolen goods from Haradrim archers (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13434]={"Defeat invaders within Thikil-gundu","Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Invaders within Thikil-gundu have been defeated.","Defeat invaders within Thikil-gundu (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Thikil-gundu: Culling the Gundabad","Completado","Defeated invaders within Thikil-gundu (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13435]={"'Thikil-gundu is not quite as dangerous as it once was, but new forces threaten to take it over. There are ancient tomes contained within that could prove to be very valuable to us.\
\
'Would you be willing to go back in to Thikil-gundu once again?'\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","Defeat Zánmog","Talk to Stráhek the Stout","'You have left the Gundabad forces weakened. They will need to rebuild their ranks before attempting to retake Thikil-gundu.'","You ran out of time...","Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest has a one hour time limit. The timer will begin upon accepting the quest.</rgb>","You should return to to Stráhek the Stout in Skarháld and let him know of your success.","Defeated Zánmog","Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep","'You must head to Thikil-gundu at once!'","Defeat Zánmog within Thikil-gundu."},
[13436]={"Deep within the Grey Mountains lies Thikil-gundu. It is home to tomes of knowledge, long thought lost.\
\
<rgb=#FF0000>Warning: This quest requires Thikil-gundu: Deep Inside the Keep to be underway. If that quest has been completed or failed, you will be unable to exit and re-enter this instance in order to complete this quest.</rgb>","Gather tomes of knowledge.","You have gathered tomes of knowledge.","Thikil-gundu: Long Thought Lost","Completado","Gather tomes of knowledge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Gathered tomes of knowledge (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13437]={"Thin the Pack","The Wargs make their den in Naur-hoit, south of Mithechad.\
\
Perindúr has asked you to hunt down and defeat the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","Huargos derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Talk to Perindúr at Mithechad","'The Ashenslades has sadly become a home for a vicious pack of Wargs, which hampers our ability to explore the region in relative safety. Something must be done about them...they either ambush our patrols or report our positions to their Orc masters.\
\
'Will you aid us by hunting these hunters? I believe they make their den in Naur-hoit, the ruins to the south of us.\
\
'When you have slain a goodly number of the beasts, return to me.'","Perindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit.\
\
You should return to Perindúr with news of your success against the Wargs of the Ashenslades.","'Hunt the foul Wargs that make their home in Naur-hoit, the ruins to the south of us.'","'With each of these foul beasts slain, the Ashenslades opens a little more for our exploration.\
\
'Thank you.'","Naur-hoit, the ruins south of Mithechad, is home to a roving pack of Wargs.","Derrota huargos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13439]={"Objetos olvidados","'Si tan solo me trajeras nuevas noticias, ${PLAYER}. Lamentablemente, nosotros mismos hemos visto señales del paso de la Compañía. Temo que ya hayan sido descubiertas.\
\
'No obstante, no debemos correr riesgos. Hay mucho trabajo por hacer...'","Maedlathron teme que los hobbits o Gimli el enano puedan haber dejado caer algo más durante su viaje que pueda revelar al Enemigo el camino de su paso y la composición de la Compañía.","Golgallon se encuentra en Echad Eregion, al sureste de Gwingris.\
\
Maedlathron te ha pedido que adviertas a Golgallon que la Compañía puede haber dejado más señales de su paso en la naturaleza.","'${PLAYER}, me temo que no hay tiempo que perder. Ve a Echad Eregion, al sur y al este, y habla con Golgallon. Advierte que aún puede haber señales del paso de la Compañía en la naturaleza.'","Habla con Golgallon en Echad Eregion","'Habla con mi semejante, Golgallon, en Echad Eregion. Dile que el avance de la Compañía puede estar comprometido por la negligencia de los hobbits.'"},
[13441]={"Has recogido pieles (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Lo que pasó en las tierras de cultivo lo veo como un fallo mío. Amarion y yo vigilábamos este camino, pero los huargos pasaron entre ambos, y no los vimos hasta que fue demasiado tarde para los granjeros.\
\
'Amarion los protege ahora, pero quiero enmendar mi negligencia. ¿Me ayudarías a reunir pieles para enviarlas a esa pobre gente? No es gran cosa, pero los ayudará a aguantar el frío de la noche.'","Los osos y lobos pueden encontrarse en las colinas del norte de Annúndir, al oeste de Ost Lagoros.\
\
Orthonn desea enviar pieles calientes a los refugiados protegidos por Amarion en Amon Raith.","'¡Qué acto tan amable! Gracias, ${PLAYER}. Eres una persona hábil para la caza, y veloz además.'","Orthonn te espera en Ost Lagoros, al sureste de Annúndir y al otro lado del río.\
\
Debes llevarle las pieles que has reunido.","Orthonn te ha pedido reunir pieles para enviarlas a los refugiados de Amon Raith en estos tiempos difíciles, y Annúndir está lleno de bestias salvajes con pieles ideales.","Pensando por Adelantado","Recoge pieles de lobos o de osos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Lleva las pieles que reuniste a Orthonn"},
[13445]={"Donaith se encuentra en Gath Forthnír.\
\
Regresa con Donaith en el este de Angmar y cuéntale tus hazañas.","'Ve a Urugarth o Carn Dûm y reduce las hordas de orcos.'","El montañés llamado Donaith está preocupado por los orcos en las cercanías de Urugarth y Carn Dûm.","Orcos derrotados en Urugarth y Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Derrota orcos en Urugarth y Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Reduciendo la Horda","'Posees el tipo de espíritu de lucha que recuerdo de mis días más jóvenes, pero tu tarea aún no está completa, ${PLAYER}. El líder uruk sigue vivo, ¿no es así?'","Urugarth y Carn Dûm se encuentran al oeste de Gath Forthnír.\
\
Donaith te pidió que apoyaras la causa de su pueblo y derrotaras a los orcos que se reúnen en Urugarth o Carn Dûm.","Derrota uruks en Urugarth y Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Me enferma saber que mi pueblo está amenazado por los Malvados, y no hay nada que pueda hacer al respecto. En mi juventud, tal vez... pero el tiempo y los rigores de los viajes por Rammas Deluon me han robado el vigor.\
\
'Ah, pero tú eres fuerte y valiente. ¿Pero eres lo suficientemente valiente para enfrentarte a los orcos y reducir sus malditas filas? \
\
'Ve a sus fortificaciones al oeste. Allí, en los lugares conocidos como Urugarth y Carn Dûm, encontrarás tu parte de orcos. Cualquier golpe que asestemos contra el Falso Rey ayudará a mi pueblo a sobrevivir un día más.'","Uruks derrotados en Urugarth y Carn Dûm (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13446]={"Derrota a los Taurogrim (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","You have defeated many Taurogrim in Thornholt.","Taurogrim derrotados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","The Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt. The fewer there are, the safer it will be for the dwarves to gather wood here.","Completado","Thinning the Thornholt","The Taurogrim are a vicious tribe of Wood-trolls that have infested the woods of Thornholt."},
[13448]={"'It is a relief that the mad goblin will not be brewing any more vile poisons!'","'No cook worthy of the name would create a recipe like this. I suspect your 'cook' is more of a mad alchemist with a penchant for poisons.\
\
'Now, we all know that goblins and Wargs are not known for being particular about what they eat, and though most poisons would not bother them much, this little 'spice' might be enough to muddle one.\
\
'Perhaps this cook would be a bit easier to deal with after a taste of his own provender?'","Defeated the goblin-cook","This is Not the Work of a Cook","Spice the stew and defeat the goblin-cook","The insane goblin-cook who came up with the vile brew is a deadly threat to any living being.","Talk to Ondor in Nan Curunir","Ondor is encamped near the caves of western Nan Curunir.\
\
You should let Ondor know that the goblin-cook has cooked his last stew.","The dreadful goblin-cook is constantly at work in his kitchens in the caves of western Nan Curunir.\
\
Ondor suggests that if you can slip the goblin-cook's deadly spice into his stew-pot, it may weaken him enough that you can readily defeat him.","Wait for the goblin-cook to taste his brew"},
[13449]={"'Ahora la madre tiene el vientre lleno de conejo, pero aún no parece haberse recuperado del todo.\
\
'Creo que quizá un viejo remedio casero de enano podría ayudar. Tengo hidromiel de sobra, pero voy a necesitar un ingrediente secreto. Resulta que hay cardos afilados en la zona. Necesito que recojas algunas espinas para poder triturarlas y mezclarlas con el hidromiel.\
\
'En fin, hay plantas de cardo alrededor del bosque al norte de la cabaña.'","Lleva los cardos afilados a Thrasi","'Por favor, recolecta esos cardos afilados.'","Recolecta cardos afilados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Hidromiel de cardo","Encontraste el cadáver de un conejo con el que alimentar a la madre lince. Pero aún no parece estar lo suficientemente bien para cazar por sí misma.","'Excelente. No me llevará mucho preparar esta pócima....'","Hay cardos afilados alrededor del bosque al norte de la cabaña de Thrasi.\
\
Thrasi te pidió que recolectaras cardos afilados para preparar una pócima que cure las heridas de la madre lince.","Cardos afilados recolectados (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13450]={"'No quiero dinero del señor Cardoso. ¡El problema son los, Trasgos!'","Thomas Cardoso ha recibido una carta de Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada, hablando de una deuda y de un hombre que empleó para reunir artefactos de la región.","'¿El hombre del señor Cardoso fue capturado por Trasgos? ¿Vas a ir a buscarlo?'","Entrega la carta de Cardoso a Anlaf el Despojado","'Bienvenido a la posada, no tenemos mucho, pero cobramos tarifas justas y puedes alojarte todo el tiempo que quieras.'","'Dime, he oído hablar de tus hazañas por la ciudad. Necesito a una persona de honor, como tú.\
\
'Cometí un error de juicio que me ha puesto en una situación difícil. Recojo objetos raros de las ruinas de Arnor y, para ahorrar unas monedas, contraté a un hombre del Sur. Ese hombre, usando mi nombre, ahora le debe una gran cantidad de dinero al propietario de la Posada Abandonada.\
\
'Si estás dispuesto, lleva esta carta a Anlaf el Despojado en la Posada Abandonada antes de que las guildas de Bree se enteren. Está al este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este. No permitiré que una indiscreción arruine mi buen nombre.'","'¿Me ha enviado el señor Cardoso una carta de crédito para Bree? No la despreciaré, pero mi mensaje no pedía dinero. Los tiempos son difíciles aquí, y su hombre podría estar en un buen lío.\
\
'Verá, los Mascador comercian con artefactos. Ahí están Gadaric y Hunulf. Son buena gente... no roban. Los Trasgos o algo parecido los echaron de sus tierras. He oído que hay orcos también. Pero los Mascador ya no tienen nada que vender en Bree, así que el hombre de Cardoso dijo que iba a comerciar directamente con los Trasgos.\
\
'Lo que le envié a Cardoso fue una nota de los Trasgos. ¡Seguro que obligaron al hombre de Cardoso a escribirla! Han capturado a su hombre. Si sigue vivo, probablemente esté al noreste de aquí. Hay campamentos de Trasgos por allí, o eso dijo. Pareces alguien capaz de ir a rescatarlo, ¿no?'","'Rápido, ve a entregar esta carta. No permitiré que mi nombre se manche otro día más por culpa de este holgazán.'","'¿Mi hombre fue capturado por Trasgos? Bueno, supongo que eso significa que no le debo nada a Anlaf.'","Anlaf el Despojado se encuentra en la Posada Abandonada, al este, a lo largo del Gran Camino del Este.\
\
Thomas Cardoso te ha pedido que lleves una carta a Anlaf el Despojado, propietario de la Posada, prometiendo el pago de una deuda contraída por un hombre que contrató para reunir reliquias antiguas en su nombre.","'¡Sabía que cometía un error al contratar a ese holgazán!'","El nombre mancillado de Cardoso"},
[13453]={"Lleva el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Afwald","Averigua si Jakka de los Gauredain lleva un antídoto","Thorgest está en su morada, junto con Afwald.\
\
Afwald te ha dicho que Thorgest se desvanece rápidamente y que debes administrarle el antídoto antes de que sea demasiado tarde.","'¿Qué es eso que tienes ahí? ¿Lo llevaba el invocador espiritual gauradan? Tiene un aspecto horrible... pero al pobre maestro Thorgest se le acaba el tiempo.\
\
'Sea lo que sea, no puede hacerle más daño, y si hay alguna posibilidad de salvarlo, ¡debemos intentarlo! ¡Por favor, atiéndelo de inmediato!'","'¡Rápido! No queda tiempo... ¡dale el antídoto a Thorgest!'","Los campamentos gauradan están al sur de la morada de Thorgest.\
\
Afwald te ha pedido que busques al gran invocador espiritual de los Gauredain con la última esperanza de que posea la cura para el veneno que está matando lentamente a Thorgest.","La Última Esperanza de Thorgest","'¿Has derrotado ya a Jakka? Podría tener la cura para Thorgest.'","Thorgest gime casi inaudiblemente, y no has encontrado nada que alivie su sufrimiento.","'¡Te lo ruego, ${PLAYER}! No creo que al maestro Thorgest le quede mucho tiempo de vida, a menos que encontremos algún modo de curar este mal. Con su hermano muerto, no quiero ser el único testigo del fin de su linaje en esta tierra salvaje y cruel.\
\
'Antes de caer en este delirio, Thorgest me habló de los hombres-lobo que lo abatieron. Parece que uno de sus profanadores fue el culpable... y tal vez el único que conocería su cura.\
\
'Si puedes encontrar a ese invocador espiritual, quizá lleve encima el remedio para esta terrible dolencia. Hagas lo que hagas, ¡por favor, date prisa!'","Administra el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Thorgest","Thorgest ha sido envenenado por los Gauredain, y Afwald, el asistente de Thorgest, cree que el gran invocador espiritual de los Gauredain podría tener la clave para curarlo.","Has encontrado el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo","Afwald está en la morada de Thorgest, al norte de los campamentos gauradan.\
\
Debes llevar el antídoto Colmillo de Hielo a Afwald antes de que Thorgest sucumba al veneno.","'¿Qué? ¿Qué es esto? ¿Intentas envenenarme aún más? ¡Es horrible! ¡Prefiero morir antes que beber otra gota de eso! ¡No! ¡Déjame en paz...!'"},
[13458]={"Has aceptado la tarea de entregar la piel de albino de los sierpes que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","'Me alegra ver que te estás abriendo paso entre estas terribles criaturas. Gracias.'","Recolectar piel albina (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de la piel de albino.","Se busca: Piel de albino de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Piel de albino","'Hay una nidada de sierpes en el sur que son un enemigo aterrador. Necesitamos sacrificar su número y recoger las diversas escamas y piel que dejan atrás. Aparte de la posible armadura que podríamos hacer, las bestias son simplemente viles.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Piel albina recolectada (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Piel de albino de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubl-adas.","Entregar la piel de albino a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas"},
[13459]={"Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Dagas Rotas","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los Duramano en Ered Luin.","'¡Ja! Es bueno ver que los Duramano siguen siendo tan inútiles en una pelea como siempre. ¡Rompiendo sus propias dagas, ja!\
\
'Tus esfuerzos resonarán por los salones.'","'Los Duramano todavía están ahí fuera, al norte y al sur, y detenerlos mientras tengamos la oportunidad es una de las principales prioridades para nosotros, los Barbiluengos.'","Entregar las dagas rotas a Dorri en Gondamon","Dagas rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir dagas rotas. Debes entregárselas a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Se busca: Dagas rotas de los Duramano en Ered Luin. Recógelas y entrégaselas a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Dorri quiere dagas rotas. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon.","Recoger dagas rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13460]={"'A veces nos encontramos con escasez de metales trabajables. Los orcos tienen armas, y esas armas se pueden derretir y forjar correctamente. ¿Entiendes lo que quiero decir?'","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Mandobles rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le haga una entrega de mandobles rotos a Avar.","Has aceptado una tarea para recolectar y entregar mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Recoger mandobles rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'¡Eso les sirve bien! Derretiremos esto y lo forjaremos bien.'","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos","Entrega los mandobles rotos a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar"},
[13461]={"'Nuestros primos tontos, influenciados por el mal, y los Gauredain todos llevan armas y vainas. Recógelos y entrégamelos aquí. Un ajuste de cuentas es bienvenido.'","Mandobles rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar mandobles rotos de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean Zigilgund en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados al supervisor enano Fotri acampado en el hogar de los enanos.","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean el hogar de los enanos de Zigilgund. Entregue los artículos a Fotri, supervisor del asentamiento.","Recoge los mandobles rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos","Fotri, supervisor de los enanos de Forochel, espera la entrega de mandobles rotos en el hogar de los enanos de Zigilgund.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Es bueno ver que su número disminuirá. Gracias.'","Entrega los mandobles rotos a Fotri en Zigilgund en Forochel"},
[13462]={"'Los trasgos y Gauredain de esta zona son criaturas viles. Nos atacaron y nos obligaron a venir a este lugar. Ahora la venganza no siempre es la mejor opción, pero reducir su número es una necesidad si queremos irnos alguna vez. Tráeme sus vainas de espada y sus armas rotas.'","Entregar los mandobles rotos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas","'Es bueno saber que su número disminuye cada vez que sales a la naturaleza, gracias.'","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Mandobles rotos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar mandobles rotos de los Gauredain y trasgos que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","Recoger mandobles rotos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de los mandobles rotos.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Mandobles rotos"},
[13463]={"Alabardas rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Alabardas rotas de los Hombres y trasgos de toda la Fuente del Bruinen. \
\
Los enanos de las Montañas Nubladas han solicitado una colección de alabardas rotas.","Se busca: Alabardas rotas de los Hombres y trasgos de toda la Fuente del Bruinen.","Recoge alabardas rotas y déjalas en una caja de recolección (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Alabardas rotas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los campamentos dentro de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Debes llevar los trofeos que reuniste a una caja de recolección.","Los enanos de las Montañas Nubladas han solicitado una colección de alabardas rotas."},
[13464]={"Entregar las espadas largas rotas a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen en el Bosque de los Trolls","Has aceptado una tarea para recoger espadas largas rotas de los montañeses y trolls en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Debes entregar los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro, un enano refugiado en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Heithur Puñohierro, en la compañía y relativa seguridad del Campamento de Barachen, espera tu regreso con espadas largas rotas.","Recoger espadas largas rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Espadas largas rotas","Se busca: Espadas largas rotas de los montañeses y trolls en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls.","Espadas largas rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Hay montañeses y trolls en estos bosques, y tenemos la necesidad de ahuyentarlos. Consigue algo de ellos para que sepa que los has combatido.'","Se busca: Espadas largas rotas de los montañeses y trolls en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Entrega los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro en el campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","'¡Ja! Mira esto, les sirve bien a esas bestias. Gracias.'"},
[13465]={"Entregar las vainas de espada rotas a Dorri en Gondamon","Recoger vainas de espada rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Vainas de espada rotas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Dorri quiere vainas de espada rotas. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir vainas de espada rotas. Debes entregárselas a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","'trasgos o Duramano, cualquiera de los dos es aceptable, pero tráenos un trofeo que demuestre que estás trabajando para expulsarlos de nuestra tierra.'","'Prueba positiva de que estamos trabajando para reclamar Ered Luin para la gloria de los enanos.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos resonarán por los salones.'","Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los Duramano y trasgos en Ered Luin. Recógelas y entrégaselas a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Vainas de espada rotas","Se busca: Vainas de espada rotas de los Duramano y trasgos en Ered Luin."},
[13466]={"Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los Duramano que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte. Entregue los artículos a Birgir Listador en Othrikar.","Entregar las lanzas de madera rotas a Birgir Listador en Othrikar","'Los Duramano son una plaga para los enanos. Intentaron destruir todo lo que se construyó antes que ellos, y ahora debemos enmendarlo expulsándolos.'","Birgir Listador, uno de los mineros de Othrikar, en los confines septentrionales de las Quebradas del Norte, espera la entrega de lanzas de madera rotas.","Tienes la tarea de entregar lanzas de madera rotas de los Duramano en las Quebradas del Norte a Birgir Listador en Othrikar. Othrikar está al norte de Esteldín en las Quebradas del Norte.","'Ah, sí, ahora lo veo... diez lanzas completan la tarea como se esperaba. Estamos agradecidos.'","Recolecta lanzas de madera rotas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Lanzas de madera rotas de los Duramano que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Lanzas de madera rotas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Lanzas de madera rotas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13467]={"Se busca: Colas limpias de los sierpes que rodean Gabilshathûr.","'Es bueno saber que estas cosas ya no nos molestarán más.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar colas limpias de los sierpes que rodean Gabilshathûr a Avar en el puesto de avanzada Enano.","Colas limpias recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Colas limpias de los sierpes que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada Enano.","'Esos sierpes necesitan ser raleados. Simplemente hay demasiados.'","Recoger colas limpias (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le entregue a Avar una remesa de colas limpias.","Entregar las colas limpias a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Colas limpias"},
[13468]={"Forti, supervisor de los enanos de Forochel, espera la entrega de colas limpias en el hogar de los enanos de Zigilgund.","Colas limpias recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las colas limpias a Fotri en Zigilgund en Forochel","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar colas limpias de las sierpes que rodean Zigilgund en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados al supervisor enano Fotri acampado en el hogar de los enanos.","'En un apuro, una cola de sierpe bien tratada puede ser triturada y utilizada como amarres. Siempre es mejor estar preparado.'","'Tomará un tiempo curar estos, así que será mejor que empecemos el proceso. Gracias.'","Recoger colas limpias (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Colas limpias de las sierpes que rodean el hogar enano de Zigilgund. Entregue los artículos a Forti, supervisor del asentamiento.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Colas limpias"},
[13469]={"'La piel es un buen forro para la ropa. Podríamos usar un poco más si estás dispuesto a recoger las pieles.'","Pelajes ásperos recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pelajes ásperos de las bestias que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte. Entregue los artículos a Birgir Listmaster en Othrikar.","Se busca: Pelajes ásperos de las bestias que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte.","Recoger pelajes ásperos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Birgir Listador, uno de los mineros de Othrikar, en los confines septentrionales de las Quebradas del Norte, espera la entrega de pelajes ásperos.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Pelajes ásperos","Tienes la tarea de entregar pelajes ásperos de las bestias en las Quebradas del Norte a Birgir Listador en Othrikar. Othrikar está al norte de Esteldín en las Quebradas del Norte.","Entregar los pelajes ásperos a Birgir Listador en Othrikar","'Completado: Una simple tarea para obtener pelajes ásperos de las bestias. Estamos agradecidos.'"},
[13470]={"Recoger pieles ásperas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Pieles ásperas","Se busca: Pieles ásperas de las bestias que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte. Entregue los artículos a Birgir Listmaster en Othrikar.","Pieles ásperas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Pieles ásperas de las bestias que se encuentran en las Quebradas del Norte.","Birgir Listador, uno de los mineros de Othrikar, en los confines septentrionales de las Quebradas del Norte, espera la entrega de piel áspera.","Entregar las pieles ásperas a Birgir Listador en Othrikar","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tienes la tarea de entregar pieles ásperas de las bestias en las Quebradas del Norte a Birgir Listador en Othrikar. Othrikar está al norte de Esteldín en las Quebradas del Norte.","'Las pieles de bestia se pueden curtir y convertir en buenas bolsas para transportar. Podríamos usar algunas más de esas bolsas.'","'Completado: una simple tarea para obtener pieles ásperas de las bestias. Estamos agradecidos.'"},
[13471]={"Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Suciedad sucia","Dorri quiere suciedad sucia. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon.","Has aceptado una tarea para adquirir suciedad sucia. Debes entregársela a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Se busca: Suciedad sucia de los insectos y arañas de Ered Luin. Recógela y entrégasela a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","'Huele un poco mal, pero claro, es suciedad. Debería funcionar con la masa.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos resonarán por los salones.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Recoger suciedad sucia (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar la suciedad sucia a Dorri en Gondamon","Se busca: Suciedad sucia de los insectos y arañas de Ered Luin.","Suciedad sucia recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'La suciedad es desagradable, ciertamente. Sin embargo, podemos usarla para varias cosas, pero es mejor usarla también con la masa que encuentres.'"},
[13472]={"Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Alas sucias","'Los hendrevail trabajan con los Duramano, viles criaturas, y los murciélagos no son más que alimañas voladoras.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos resonarán por los salones.'","Se busca: Alas sucias de los hendrevail y murciélagos encontrados en Ered Luin. Recógelas y entrégaselas a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Dorri quiere alas sucias. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon.","Recoger alas sucias (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Mejor ponte en marcha... los hendrevail y los murciélagos de ahí fuera no van a venir a ti, ya sabes.'","Se busca: Alas sucias de los hendrevail y murciélagos encontrados en Ered Luin.","Has aceptado una tarea para conseguir alas sucias. Debes entregárselas a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Entregar las alas sucias a Dorri en Gondamon","Alas sucias recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13473]={"Entregar los picos sin filo a Dorri en Gondamon","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Picos sin filo","Dorri quiere picos sin filo. Se puede encontrar a Dorri de pie en la puerta oeste de Gondamon.","'Asegúrate de no matar a los hendrevail débiles... tienen picos de aspecto diferente.'","Recoger picos sin filo (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos sin filo de los hendrevail en Ered Luin.","Has aceptado una tarea para conseguir picos sin filo. Debes entregárselos a Dorri en la puerta oeste de Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin.","'Buen viaje a estas criaturas... demasiadas de ellas alrededor para que nos sintamos cómodos.\
\
'Tus esfuerzos resonarán por los salones.'","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Picos sin filo recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos sin filo de los hendrevail en Ered Luin. Recógelos y entrégaselos a Dorri en Gondamon para ganar el favor de la Mansión de Thorin."},
[13474]={"Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Picos extremadamente afilados","Recoge picos extremadamente afilados y déjalos en la caja de recolección (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos extremadamente afilados de las aves que se encuentran en toda la Fuente del Bruinen. \
\
Los enanos de las Montañas Nubladas han solicitado una colección de picos extremadamente afilados.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Las cajas de recolección para esta tarea se pueden encontrar en los campamentos dentro de las Montañas Nubladas.\
\
Debes llevar los trofeos que reuniste a una caja de recolección.","Picos extremadamente afilados recogidos (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Picos extremadamente afilados de las aves que se encuentran en toda la Fuente del Bruinen.","Los enanos de las Montañas Nubladas han solicitado una colección de picos extremadamente afilados."},
[13475]={"'No son muchos, pero estoy seguro de que puedo trabajar con ellos. Gracias.'","Heithur Puñohierro, en la compañía y relativa seguridad del Campamento de Barachen, espera tu regreso con garras extremadamente afiladas.","Se busca: Garras extremadamente afiladas de las garras de cueva en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Entrega los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro en el campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","'Voy a intentar hacer algunas trampas, pero aquí no hay forja para trabajar el metal. En su lugar, estaba pensando en hacerlas con garras y madera. La madera es fácil de conseguir, pero las garras fuertes y afiladas tendrán que venir de las garras de las cuevas.'","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Garras extremadamente afiladas","Entregar las garras extremadamente afiladas a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen en el Bosque de los Trolls","Has aceptado una tarea para recoger garras extremadamente afiladas de las garras de cueva en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Debes entregar los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro, un enano refugiado en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","Se busca: Garras extremadamente afiladas de las garras de cueva en las extensiones occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Garras extremadamente afiladas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoger garras extremadamente afiladas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13476]={"Heithur Puñohierro, en la compañía y relativa seguridad del Campamento de Barachen, espera tu regreso con pelaje fino.","'No son muchos, pero estoy seguro de que puedo trabajar con ellos. Gracias.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger pelaje fino de las bestias en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Debes entregar los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro, un enano refugiado en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Pelaje fino","Entrega el pelaje fino a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen en el Bosque de los Trolls","Recoger pelaje fino (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Le dije al Elfo que lo ayudaría con cualquier reparación que pudiéramos necesitar. Si encuentras alguna piel, pelaje u orejas, tráemelas.'","Se busca: Pelaje fino de las bestias en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Pelaje fino de las bestias en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Entrega los objetos a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","Pelaje fino recogido (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13477]={"Se busca: Piel fina de las bestias y garras de cueva en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls.","'No son muchos, pero estoy seguro de que puedo trabajar con ellos. Gracias.'","Entregar la piel fina a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen en el Bosque de los Trolls","Recoger piel fina (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Se busca: Piel fina de las bestias y garras de cueva en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Entregar los artículos a Heithur Puñohierro en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","'Le dije al Elfo que lo ayudaría con cualquier reparación que pudiéramos necesitar. Si encuentras alguna piel, pelaje u orejas, tráemelas.'","Piel fina recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Piel fina","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger piel fina de las bestias y garras de cueva en los tramos occidentales del Bosque de los Trolls. Debes entregar los artículos a Heithur Puñohierro, un enano refugiado en el Campamento de Barachen, al sur de la carretera en el oeste del Bosque de los Trolls.","Heithur Puñohierro, en la compañía y relativa seguridad del Campamento de Barachen, espera tu regreso con piel fina.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú."},
[13478]={"Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada Enano.","'Orcos usando vainas bien hechas... Sólo una cosa es posible: ¡las robaron! Recupéralas y las usaremos.'","Vainas de espada doradas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar vainas de espada doradas de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr a Avar en el puesto de avanzada Enano.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los orcos que rodean Gabilshathûr.","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le entregue a Avar una remesa de vainas de espada doradas.","Entregar las vainas de espada doradas a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Vainas de espada doradas","Recoger vainas de espada doradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Haremos un uso adecuado de estos.'"},
[13479]={"'Nuestros primos tontos, influenciados por el mal, y los Gauredain todos llevan armas y vainas. Recógelos y entrégamelos aquí. Un ajuste de cuentas es bienvenido.'","Vainas de espada doradas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las vainas de espada doradas a Fotri en Zigilgund en Forochel","Fotri, supervisor de los enanos de Forochel, espera la entrega de vainas de espada doradas en el hogar enano de Zigilgund.","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar vainas de espada doradas de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean Zigilgund en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados al supervisor enano Fotri acampado en el hogar enano.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los Duramano y Gauredain que rodean el hogar enano de Zigilgund. Entregar los artículos a Fotri, supervisor del asentamiento.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Vainas de espada doradas","Recoger vainas de espada doradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Es bueno ver que su número disminuirá. Gracias.'"},
[13480]={"'Los trasgos y Gauredain de esta zona son criaturas viles. Nos atacaron y nos obligaron a venir a este lugar. Ahora la venganza no siempre es la mejor opción, pero reducir su número es una necesidad si queremos irnos alguna vez. Tráeme sus vainas de espada y sus armas rotas.'","'Es bueno saber que su número disminuye cada vez que sales a la naturaleza, gracias.'","Vainas de espada doradas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar vainas de espada doradas de los Gauredain y trasgos que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","Entregar las vainas de espada doradas a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas.","Se busca: Vainas de espada doradas de los Gauredain y trasgos en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de las vainas de espada doradas.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Vainas de espada doradas","Recoger vainas de espada doradas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13481]={"Afwald, el aprovisionador de la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de las grandes orejas.","Entregar las grandes orejas a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas","Grandes orejas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Recoger grandes orejas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Grandes orejas","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","'Los suministros son suministros en este momento, gracias.'","Se busca: Grandes orejas de las bestias en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Se busca: Grandes orejas de las bestias en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas.","'Si te encuentras con alguna bestia por aquí, podríamos usar su pelaje, pieles y orejas. Iría yo mismo, pero mis deberes me retienen en Hrimbarg.'","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar grandes orejas de las bestias que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas."},
[13482]={"Entrega la gran suciedad a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar","Se busca: Gran suciedad de los insectos que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Recoge gran suciedad (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Gran suciedad","Se busca: Gran suciedad de los insectos que rodean Gabilshathûr.","Gran suciedad recogida (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has aceptado una tarea para recolectar y entregar gran suciedad de los insectos que rodean Gabilshathûr y devolverla a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le haga una entrega de gran suciedad a Avar.","'La gran suciedad que se desprende de los insectos que nos rodean puede alimentar los fuegos de nuestras forjas durante períodos más largos y hacer que los fuegos se calienten mucho.'","'Esto es asqueroso, pero arde bien, por mucho tiempo y con calor.'"},
[13483]={"Se busca: Grandes membranas de las babosas que rodean Gabilshathûr. La entrega de los artículos debe hacerse a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Se busca: Grandes membranas de las babosas que rodean Gabilshathûr.","'Les daremos un buen uso a estos.'","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Grandes membranas","'Las babosas tienen una membrana gruesa que no se quema muy bien. Nos gustaría algunas de estas.'","Los enanos de Gabilshathûr esperan que se le haga una entrega de grandes membranas a Avar.","Entrega las grandes membranas a Avar en Gabilshathûr en Angmar","Grandes membranas recogidas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Has aceptado una tarea para recolectar y entregar grandes membranas de las babosas que rodean Gabilshathûr a Avar en el puesto de avanzada enano.","Recoge grandes membranas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})"},
[13484]={"Grandes escamas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","'Las escamas de los sierpes tienen muchos usos. Siempre es mejor estar preparado.'","Has aceptado la tarea de recoger y entregar grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean Zigilgund en Forochel. Los artículos deben ser entregados al supervisor enano Fotri acampado en el hogar enano.","Fotri, supervisor de los enanos de Forochel, espera la entrega de grandes escamas en el hogar enano de Zigilgund.","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean el hogar enano de Zigilgund.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Grandes escamas","'Tomará un tiempo curar estos, así que será mejor que empecemos el proceso. Gracias.'","Recolectar grandes escamas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Entregar las grandes escamas a Fotri en Zigilgund en Forochel","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes que rodean el hogar enano de Zigilgund. Entregar los artículos a Fotri, supervisor del asentamiento."},
[13485]={"Entrega las grandes escamas a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas","'Me alegra ver que te estás abriendo paso entre estas terribles criaturas. Gracias.'","Afwald, el proveedor en la ruina enana de Hrimbarg, espera el regreso de grandes escamas.","'Hay una nidada de sierpes en el sur que son un enemigo aterrador. Necesitamos sacrificar su número y recoger las diversas escamas y piel que dejan atrás. Aparte de la posible armadura que podríamos hacer, las bestias son simplemente viles.'","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas. Puedes entregar estos artículos a Afwald dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg en las Montañas Nubladas.","Has aceptado la tarea de entregar grandes escamas de los sierpes que se encuentran en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas a Afwald. Afwald se puede encontrar dentro de las ruinas de Hrimbarg, también en las Montañas Nubladas.","Se busca: Grandes escamas de los sierpes en los confines orientales de las Montañas Nubladas.","Recolectar grandes escamas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Grandes escamas recolectadas (${NUMBER}/${TOTAL})","Has entregado un lote de trofeos a cambio de una modesta recompensa adecuada para un coleccionista como tú.","Tarea de la Mansión de Thorin: Grandes escamas"},
